msgid "Statscraft"
msgstr "Statscraft"

msgid "Statscraft is a free, open-source statistics package for the social sciences, built AI-native from the first line. It reads .sav files and runs your existing syntax, on Windows, macOS and Linux. Two programs written in Rust share one engine: the command line `statscraft` and the desktop window `statscraft-gui`."
msgstr "Statscraft 是一款面向社会科学的免费开源统计软件，从第一行代码起就为 AI 智能体而设计。它读取 .sav 文件，运行您现有的语法，支持 Windows、macOS 和 Linux。两个用 Rust 编写的程序共用一个引擎：命令行程序 `statscraft` 和桌面窗口程序 `statscraft-gui`。"

msgid "[Download](https://statscraft.org/download.html) · [Documentation](https://docs.statscraft.org) · [Website](https://statscraft.org)"
msgstr "[下载](https://statscraft.org/download.html) · [文档](https://docs.statscraft.org) · [网站](https://statscraft.org)"

msgid "What it does"
msgstr "功能 {#what-it-does}"

msgid "**Data files.** Reads and writes .sav and .zsav files with their labels, missing values and multiple response sets. Opens Excel workbooks and text files, and writes Excel, CSV and Stata files."
msgstr "**数据文件。** 读写 .sav 和 .zsav 文件，保留标签、缺失值和多重响应集。可以打开 Excel 工作簿和文本文件，并写出 Excel、CSV 和 Stata 文件。"

msgid "**Data preparation.** Compute, recode, select, weight, aggregate, merge and restructure, with macros and the matrix language."
msgstr "**数据准备。** 计算、重新编码、筛选、加权、汇总、合并和重构数据，支持宏和矩阵语言。"

msgid "**Custom tables.** Counts, percentages and means by groups, with totals, subtotals, multiple response sets and significance tests marked by letters."
msgstr "**自定义表格。** 按组统计计数、百分比和均值，支持总计、小计、多重响应集，以及用字母标注的显著性检验。"

msgid "**Statistics.** Frequencies, crosstabs, means, t tests and analysis of variance; linear, logistic and many other regressions; general, generalized and mixed linear models; factor, cluster and tree analysis; survival analysis, forecasting, complex samples, Bayesian tests and power analysis."
msgstr "**统计分析。** 频数、交叉表、均值、t 检验和方差分析；线性回归、逻辑回归及其他多种回归；一般线性模型、广义线性模型和混合线性模型；因子分析、聚类分析和决策树分析；生存分析、预测、复杂抽样、贝叶斯检验和功效分析。"

msgid "**Output.** Tables and charts to Excel, Word, PowerPoint, PDF and web pages. Charts go into the office programs as charts you can edit."
msgstr "**输出。** 表格和图表可导出到 Excel、Word、PowerPoint、PDF 和网页。图表在办公软件中仍是可编辑的图表。"

msgid "**AI agents.** An MCP server, JSON output, sessions that keep the data between runs, and errors with line and column, so an agent can do the analysis while you watch it in the window."
msgstr "**AI 智能体。** 提供 MCP 服务器、JSON 输出、在多次运行之间保留数据的会话，以及标明行号和列号的错误信息，让智能体完成分析，您在窗口中查看过程。"

msgid "The [command pages](commands/index.md) list every command."
msgstr "[命令页面](commands/index.md)列出了全部命令。"

msgid "Statscraft is an independent project. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the makers of other statistics software or the ArtCraft suite. Product names are trademarks of their owners."
msgstr "Statscraft 是一个独立项目，与其他统计软件的开发商及 ArtCraft 套件均无关联，也未获得其认可。产品名称是其各自所有者的商标。"

msgid "Status: early development. Licensed under MIT."
msgstr "状态：早期开发阶段。采用 MIT 许可证。"

msgid "This page takes you from installing Statscraft to an Excel workbook with a custom table. You work in the window, with a sample file you download below. At the end you see the same work on the command line."
msgstr "本页带您从安装 Statscraft 开始，直到得到一个含自定义表格的 Excel 工作簿。您在窗口中操作，使用下面下载的示例文件。最后，您会看到在命令行上完成同样的工作。"

msgid "Install"
msgstr "安装 {#install}"

msgid "Download the package for your system from the [download page](https://statscraft.org/download.html). Each package holds both programs: the window and the `statscraft` command line."
msgstr "从[下载页面](https://statscraft.org/download.html)下载适合您系统的安装包。每个安装包都包含两个程序：窗口程序和 `statscraft` 命令行。"

msgid "**Windows.** Run `statscraft-X-windows-x86_64-setup.exe` (`X` is the version). It installs for your user only, without administrator rights, and adds Statscraft to the Start menu. If Windows warns about an unknown publisher, choose **More info**, then **Run anyway**."
msgstr "**Windows。** 运行 `statscraft-X-windows-x86_64-setup.exe`（`X` 为版本号）。它只为您的用户安装，无需管理员权限，并把 Statscraft 添加到“开始”菜单。如果 Windows 提示发布者未知，请选择 **More info**，然后选择 **Run anyway**。"

msgid "**macOS.** Double-click `statscraft-X-macos-universal.tar.gz` to unpack it, and drag `Statscraft.app` to **Applications**. The first time you open it, macOS says it cannot verify the app: click **Done**, then open **System Settings > Privacy & Security** and click **Open Anyway** next to the message about Statscraft."
msgstr "**macOS。** 双击 `statscraft-X-macos-universal.tar.gz` 将其解压，然后把 `Statscraft.app` 拖到 **Applications**。第一次打开时，macOS 会提示无法验证该应用：点击 **Done**，然后打开 **System Settings > Privacy & Security**，在关于 Statscraft 的提示旁点击 **Open Anyway**。"

msgid "**Debian and Ubuntu.** Install the package with `sudo apt install ./statscraft_X_amd64.deb`. Statscraft is then in the applications menu."
msgstr "**Debian 和 Ubuntu。** 用 `sudo apt install ./statscraft_X_amd64.deb` 安装软件包。之后 Statscraft 会出现在应用程序菜单中。"

msgid "**Other Linux.** Unpack the tarball into `~/.local`: `tar -xzf statscraft-X-linux-x86_64.tar.gz --strip-components=1 -C ~/.local`."
msgstr "**其他 Linux。** 把压缩包解压到 `~/.local`：`tar -xzf statscraft-X-linux-x86_64.tar.gz --strip-components=1 -C ~/.local`。"

msgid "[Install and update](install.md) has the details: the portable Windows version, the command line on macOS, how to uninstall and how updates work."
msgstr "[安装与更新](install.md)介绍了详细内容：Windows 便携版、macOS 上的命令行、如何卸载以及更新方式。"

msgid "Open the sample file"
msgstr "打开示例文件 {#open-the-sample-file}"

msgid "Download the sample file [survey.sav](sample/survey.sav). It is an invented customer survey of 300 people, with labels on every variable and value."
msgstr "下载示例文件 [survey.sav](sample/survey.sav)。这是一份虚构的客户调查，共 300 名受访者，每个变量和值都带有标签。"

msgid "Start Statscraft. An empty data window opens."
msgstr "启动 Statscraft。一个空的数据窗口随即打开。"

msgid "Choose **File > Open data...** and pick `survey.sav`."
msgstr "选择 **File > Open data...**，然后选取 `survey.sav`。"

msgid "The data window now shows the cases, one row per respondent. **Show value labels**, above the grid, switches between the codes and their labels."
msgstr "数据窗口现在显示各个个案，每位受访者一行。网格上方的 **Show value labels** 用于在编码值和对应标签之间切换。"

msgid "Look at the variables"
msgstr "查看变量 {#look-at-the-variables}"

msgid "Click the **Variables** tab. Each row is one variable, with its label, value labels and missing values. This page uses these:"
msgstr "点击 **Variables** 选项卡。每一行是一个变量，包括其标签、值标签和缺失值。本页使用以下变量："

msgid "Variable"
msgstr "变量"

msgid "What it holds"
msgstr "内容"

msgid "`region`"
msgstr "`region`"

msgid "North, South, East or West"
msgstr "North、South、East 或 West"

msgid "`satisfaction`"
msgstr "`satisfaction`"

msgid "overall satisfaction from 1 (very dissatisfied) to 5 (very satisfied); 9 means \"Don't know\" and is a missing value"
msgstr "总体满意度，从 1（非常不满意）到 5（非常满意）；9 表示“Don't know”，为缺失值"

