msgid "Each region has a key: a for North, b for South, c for East and d for West. A letter beside a percentage says that it is significantly higher than the percentage of the region with that key. For example, \"c d\" beside 37.1% says that more customers in the North are satisfied than in the East or the West. A note under the table names the test. [Custom tables](window.md#custom-tables) explains the dialog in full."
msgstr "每个地区都有一个键：a 代表 North，b 代表 South，c 代表 East，d 代表 West。百分比旁的字母表示该百分比显著高于对应键所代表地区的百分比。例如，37.1% 旁的“c d”表示 North 地区感到满意的客户多于 East 或 West 地区。表格下方的注释说明所用的检验。[自定义表格](window.md#自定义表格)完整介绍了该对话框。"

msgid "Export to Excel"
msgstr "导出到 Excel {#export-to-excel}"

msgid "Choose **File > Export...**."
msgstr "选择 **File > Export...**。"

msgid "Under **Format**, choose **Excel workbook (.xlsx)**, and choose **One sheet per table** or **All tables on one sheet**."
msgstr "在 **Format** 下，选择 **Excel workbook (.xlsx)**，并选择 **One sheet per table** 或 **All tables on one sheet**。"

msgid "Click **Export...** and choose where to save the workbook."
msgstr "点击 **Export...**，然后选择工作簿的保存位置。"

msgid "Each table keeps its layout in Excel. Numbers stay numbers, so you can compute with them, and the significance letters stay next to them as text. [Export to Excel](window.md#exporting-all-output) lists every choice."
msgstr "每个表格在 Excel 中都保留其布局。数字仍然是数字，您可以用它们计算；显著性字母作为文本留在数字旁边。[导出到 Excel](window.md#exporting-all-output)列出了所有选项。"

msgid "Save the syntax"
msgstr "保存语法 {#save-the-syntax}"

msgid "Everything you did ran as syntax: the commands of the Statscraft language. You can save it and run it again later, on this file or on next month's data."
msgstr "您所做的一切都是以语法运行的，也就是 Statscraft 语言的命令。您可以保存这些语法，以后再次运行，用于这个文件或下个月的数据。"

msgid "Look at the log under the output."
msgstr "查看输出下方的日志。"

msgid "Click **Copy syntax**. That copies every command of your session."
msgstr "点击 **Copy syntax**。这会复制您会话中的所有命令。"

msgid "Choose **File > New > Syntax**, paste with Ctrl+V, and choose **File > Save syntax as...**. Save it as `first-table.sps`."
msgstr "选择 **File > New > Syntax**，按 Ctrl+V 粘贴，然后选择 **File > Save syntax as...**。将其保存为 `first-table.sps`。"

msgid "The file looks like this (your `GET FILE` line has the full path of your file):"
msgstr "文件内容如下（您的 `GET FILE` 行包含您文件的完整路径）："

msgid "To run it again, open it with **File > Open syntax...** and click **Run all**. Instead of **OK**, every dialog also has **Paste**, which puts its syntax into the syntax window without running it."
msgstr "要再次运行，用 **File > Open syntax...** 打开它，然后点击 **Run all**。除了 **OK**，每个对话框还有 **Paste**，它把对话框的语法放入语法窗口而不运行。"

msgid "The same on the command line"
msgstr "在命令行上完成同样的工作 {#the-same-on-the-command-line}"

msgid "The `statscraft` command line runs the same syntax without the window. In a terminal, go to the folder with `survey.sav` and `first-table.sps`:"
msgstr "`statscraft` 命令行无需窗口即可运行同样的语法。在终端中，进入存放 `survey.sav` 和 `first-table.sps` 的文件夹："

msgid "`describe` lists the variables. `run` prints every table as text and also writes them to `tables.xlsx`. [The command line](command-line.md) describes every option."
msgstr "`describe` 列出变量。`run` 以文本形式打印每个表格，同时将它们写入 `tables.xlsx`。[命令行](command-line.md)介绍了所有选项。"

msgid "Work with an AI agent"
msgstr "与 AI 智能体协作 {#work-with-an-ai-agent}"

msgid "An AI agent can do the same steps for you: look at the variables, write the syntax, run it and read the results. Connect your agent once with **Edit > Settings > AI agents** in the window. [Connect your AI agent](connect.md) shows how, and [Statscraft for AI agents](ai-agents.md) shows how an agent works with Statscraft."
msgstr "AI 智能体可以替您完成同样的步骤：查看变量、编写语法、运行语法并读取结果。在窗口中通过 **Edit > Settings > AI agents** 连接一次您的智能体即可。[连接您的 AI 智能体](connect.md)说明了具体方法，[面向 AI 智能体的 Statscraft](ai-agents.md)说明了智能体如何使用 Statscraft。"

msgid "Next"
msgstr "下一步 {#next}"

msgid "[The window](window.md): the data, syntax and output windows, and every menu."
msgstr "[窗口](window.md)：数据窗口、语法窗口和输出窗口，以及所有菜单。"

msgid "[Commands](commands/index.md): one page per command, with its syntax and an example."
msgstr "[命令](commands/index.md)：每个命令一页，包含其语法和一个示例。"

msgid "[The command line](command-line.md): every subcommand and option."
msgstr "[命令行](command-line.md)：所有子命令和选项。"

msgid "Statscraft runs on Windows, macOS and Linux. Each package holds both programs: the window (`statscraft-gui`) and the command line (`statscraft`)."
msgstr "Statscraft 可在 Windows、macOS 和 Linux 上运行。每个安装包都包含两个程序：窗口程序（`statscraft-gui`）和命令行程序（`statscraft`）。"

msgid "Download"
msgstr "下载 {#download}"

msgid "Download the package for your system from the [download page](https://statscraft.org/download.html). In the file names, `X` stands for the version:"
msgstr "请从[下载页面](https://statscraft.org/download.html)下载适合您系统的安装包。文件名中的 `X` 代表版本号："

msgid "File"
msgstr "文件 {#file}"

msgid "For"
msgstr "适用于"

msgid "`statscraft-X-windows-x86_64-setup.exe`"
msgstr "`statscraft-X-windows-x86_64-setup.exe`"

msgid "Windows, with an installer"
msgstr "Windows，带安装程序"

msgid "`statscraft-X-windows-x86_64.zip`"
msgstr "`statscraft-X-windows-x86_64.zip`"

msgid "Windows, without an installer"
msgstr "Windows，不带安装程序"

msgid "`statscraft-X-macos-universal.tar.gz`"
msgstr "`statscraft-X-macos-universal.tar.gz`"

msgid "macOS, on Apple silicon and Intel"
msgstr "macOS，适用于 Apple 芯片和 Intel 芯片"

msgid "`statscraft_X_amd64.deb`"
msgstr "`statscraft_X_amd64.deb`"

msgid "Debian and Ubuntu"
msgstr "Debian 和 Ubuntu {#debian-and-ubuntu}"

msgid "`statscraft-X-linux-x86_64.tar.gz`"
msgstr "`statscraft-X-linux-x86_64.tar.gz`"

msgid "any other Linux"
msgstr "其他 Linux 发行版"

msgid "The download page also explains how to check a file against its published checksum. The files for AI agents are described in [Connect your AI agent](connect.md)."
msgstr "下载页面还说明了如何用已发布的校验和核对文件。供 AI 智能体使用的文件见[连接您的 AI 智能体](connect.md)。"

msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

msgid "Run `statscraft-X-windows-x86_64-setup.exe`. It installs for your user only and needs no administrator rights."
msgstr "运行 `statscraft-X-windows-x86_64-setup.exe`。它只为当前用户安装，不需要管理员权限。"

msgid "The Start menu gets **Statscraft**, which opens the window."
msgstr "“开始”菜单中会出现 **Statscraft**，点击即可打开窗口。"

msgid "`statscraft` works in any terminal you open after the installation."
msgstr "安装后打开的任何终端中都可以使用 `statscraft`。"

msgid ".sav and .zsav files open in the window, and .sps files in its syntax editor. Where another program already opens one of these types, it stays the default, and Statscraft is offered under **Open with**."
msgstr ".sav 和 .zsav 文件在窗口中打开，.sps 文件在其语法编辑器中打开。如果已有其他程序打开这些类型的文件，它仍是默认程序，Statscraft 会出现在 **Open with** 中供选择。"

msgid "If Windows warns that the installer comes from an unknown publisher, choose **More info**, then **Run anyway**."
msgstr "如果 Windows 提示安装程序来自未知发布者，请选择 **More info**，然后选择 **Run anyway**。"

msgid "To uninstall, open **Settings > Apps > Installed apps**, find Statscraft and choose **Uninstall**."
msgstr "要卸载，请打开 **Settings > Apps > Installed apps**，找到 Statscraft 并选择 **Uninstall**。"

msgid "Windows without an installer"
msgstr "不使用安装程序的 Windows {#windows-without-an-installer}"

msgid "Use the .zip where you may not install programs. Unpack it anywhere you can write, for example to a folder in Documents or on a USB stick (in Explorer: right-click, **Extract All**). The folder holds:"
msgstr "在不允许安装程序的电脑上，请使用 .zip 文件。把它解压到任何可写入的位置，例如“文档”中的某个文件夹或 U 盘（在资源管理器中：右键单击，**Extract All**）。文件夹中包含："

msgid "`statscraft-gui.exe`, the window: double-click it to start Statscraft;"
msgstr "`statscraft-gui.exe`，即窗口程序：双击即可启动 Statscraft；"

msgid "`statscraft.exe`, the command line: run it in a terminal from that folder, or add the folder to your `PATH`;"
msgstr "`statscraft.exe`，即命令行程序：在终端中从该文件夹运行，或将该文件夹添加到 `PATH`；"

msgid "`LICENSE.txt` and `README.md`."
msgstr "`LICENSE.txt` 和 `README.md`。"

msgid "There is no Start menu entry, and files do not open with a double-click. Open them with **File > Open data...**, or drag them onto `statscraft-gui.exe`. Keep `LICENSE.txt` next to the programs, so updates know where to go. To remove Statscraft, delete the folder."
msgstr "这种方式没有“开始”菜单项，双击文件也不会打开。请用 **File > Open data...** 打开文件，或把文件拖到 `statscraft-gui.exe` 上。请将 `LICENSE.txt` 与程序放在一起，以便更新时知道安装位置。要删除 Statscraft，删除该文件夹即可。"

msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

msgid "Double-click `statscraft-X-macos-universal.tar.gz` in Finder to unpack it. Drag `Statscraft.app` to **Applications**."
msgstr "在 Finder 中双击 `statscraft-X-macos-universal.tar.gz` 将其解压。把 `Statscraft.app` 拖到 **Applications**。"

msgid "The first time you open it, macOS says it cannot verify the app. Click **Done** (not **Move to Trash**), then:"
msgstr "第一次打开时，macOS 会提示无法验证该应用。请点击 **Done**（不要点 **Move to Trash**），然后："

msgid "Choose Apple menu > **System Settings**, then **Privacy & Security**."
msgstr "选择苹果菜单 > **System Settings**，然后选择 **Privacy & Security**。"

msgid "Under **Security**, find the message about Statscraft and click **Open Anyway**."
msgstr "在 **Security** 下找到关于 Statscraft 的提示，点击 **Open Anyway**。"

msgid "Enter your login password and click **OK**."
msgstr "输入您的登录密码，然后点击 **OK**。"

msgid "After that, Statscraft opens with a double-click like any other app. Finder offers it under **Open With** for .sav, .zsav and .sps files."
msgstr "此后，Statscraft 和其他应用一样双击即可打开。对于 .sav、.zsav 和 .sps 文件，Finder 会在 **Open With** 中提供 Statscraft。"

msgid "The command line is the file `statscraft` in the same folder. Move it to a folder on your `PATH`, for example:"
msgstr "命令行程序是同一文件夹中的 `statscraft` 文件。请将它移到 `PATH` 中的某个文件夹，例如："

msgid "If `~/.local/bin` is not on your `PATH` yet, add `export PATH=\"$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\"` to `~/.zshrc`. The first `statscraft --version` is blocked in the same way as the app: allow it under **Privacy & Security** and run it again."
msgstr "如果 `~/.local/bin` 还不在 `PATH` 中，请在 `~/.zshrc` 中加入 `export PATH=\"$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\"`。第一次运行 `statscraft --version` 时会像应用一样被阻止：请在 **Privacy & Security** 中允许它，然后再运行一次。"

msgid "To uninstall, move Statscraft.app to the Bin and delete the `statscraft` file."
msgstr "要卸载，请把 Statscraft.app 移到废纸篓，并删除 `statscraft` 文件。"

msgid "Statscraft is then in the applications menu, and .sav, .zsav and .sps files open in the window. To uninstall, run `sudo apt remove statscraft`."
msgstr "之后 Statscraft 会出现在应用程序菜单中，.sav、.zsav 和 .sps 文件会在窗口中打开。要卸载，请运行 `sudo apt remove statscraft`。"

msgid "Other Linux"
msgstr "其他 Linux 发行版 {#other-linux}"

msgid "The tarball holds a `bin` and a `share` folder. Unpack it into `~/.local`, then refresh the file types and the applications menu:"
msgstr "该 tar 包包含 `bin` 和 `share` 两个文件夹。将其解压到 `~/.local`，然后刷新文件类型和应用程序菜单："

msgid "If `update-desktop-database` is missing, skip that line. `~/.local/bin` must be on your `PATH`, which it is on most distributions once the folder exists."
msgstr "如果没有 `update-desktop-database`，请跳过这一行。`~/.local/bin` 必须在 `PATH` 中；在大多数发行版上，只要该文件夹存在，就已满足这一点。"

msgid "To uninstall, delete what the tarball put there:"
msgstr "要卸载，请删除该 tar 包放入的内容："

msgid "Updates"
msgstr "更新 {#updates}"

msgid "When a new version is out, the window shows a bar under the menu. **Update now** installs it, and **Later** hides the bar until the next check. **Help > Check for updates** checks at once."
msgstr "有新版本时，窗口会在菜单下方显示一个提示栏。**Update now** 安装新版本，**Later** 隐藏提示栏直到下次检查。**Help > Check for updates** 立即检查。"

msgid "What **Update now** does depends on how you installed Statscraft:"
msgstr "**Update now** 的具体操作取决于您安装 Statscraft 的方式："

msgid "Installed with"
msgstr "安装方式"

msgid "What happens"
msgstr "结果"

msgid "the Windows installer"
msgstr "Windows 安装程序"

msgid "The window asks about unsaved work, closes, installs the new version and opens again."
msgstr "窗口会询问未保存的工作，然后关闭，安装新版本并重新打开。"

msgid "the Windows .zip"
msgstr "Windows .zip"

msgid "The two programs in the folder are replaced. **Restart now** opens the new version."
msgstr "文件夹中的两个程序被替换。**Restart now** 打开新版本。"

msgid "the Linux tarball"
msgstr "Linux tar 包"

msgid "The two programs in `~/.local/bin` are replaced. **Restart now** opens the new version."
msgstr "`~/.local/bin` 中的两个程序被替换。**Restart now** 打开新版本。"

msgid "the .deb"
msgstr ".deb 安装包"

msgid "The new package is saved in `~/Downloads`, and the system asks for your password to install it. Then **Restart now**."
msgstr "新安装包保存在 `~/Downloads` 中，系统会要求您输入密码进行安装。然后点击 **Restart now**。"

msgid "The bar has a **Download** link. Unpack the new package and replace Statscraft.app (and the `statscraft` file) with the new ones. The first start needs **Open Anyway** again."
msgstr "提示栏中有一个 **Download** 链接。解压新安装包，用新的 Statscraft.app（以及 `statscraft` 文件）替换旧的。首次启动时需要再次点击 **Open Anyway**。"

msgid "Every download is checked against the checksums published with the release before it is used."
msgstr "每个下载的文件在使用前都会与该版本发布的校验和进行核对。"

msgid "The window checks at most once a day. The check sends nothing about you or your data. To turn it off, clear **Edit > Settings > Updates > Check for updates automatically**."
msgstr "窗口每天最多检查一次。检查时不会发送任何关于您或您数据的信息。要关闭检查，请取消勾选 **Edit > Settings > Updates > Check for updates automatically**。"

msgid "From the command line:"
msgstr "在命令行中："

msgid "On Debian and Ubuntu, `statscraft update` downloads the package and prints the one command that installs it. On macOS it names the download page instead. [The command line](command-line.md#update) lists the options."
msgstr "在 Debian 和 Ubuntu 上，`statscraft update` 会下载安装包，并打印出安装它所需的那一条命令。在 macOS 上，它会给出下载页面。[命令行](command-line.md#update)页面列出了各个选项。"

msgid "This page is for analysts who work in the Statscraft window: the data editor, the syntax editor and the output, with their menus and dialogs. [Getting started](getting-started.md) walks through a first table."
msgstr "本页面向在 Statscraft 窗口中工作的分析人员：数据编辑器、语法编辑器和输出，以及它们的菜单和对话框。[入门](getting-started.md)将带您制作第一张表格。"

msgid "The window (`statscraft-gui`) runs on the same engine as the command line. It has three kinds of window, all on one session:"
msgstr "窗口程序（`statscraft-gui`）与命令行使用同一个引擎。它有三类窗口，全部共用一个会话："

msgid "a [data window](#data-windows) for each open dataset, with the **Data** and **Variables** tabs;"
msgstr "每个打开的数据集各有一个[数据窗口](#data-windows)，带有 **Data** 和 **Variables** 两个标签页；"

msgid "a [syntax window](#syntax-windows) for each syntax file;"
msgstr "每个语法文件各有一个[语法窗口](#syntax-windows)；"

msgid "an [output window](#output-windows) for each output document."
msgstr "每个输出文档各有一个[输出窗口](#output-windows)。"

msgid "The session has one active dataset, and every command, from any window, works on it. Every change and every result in the windows comes from syntax (see [Syntax is the only command layer](#syntax-is-the-only-command-layer))."
msgstr "会话中有一个活动数据集，任何窗口中的每条命令都作用于它。窗口中的每项更改和每个结果都来自语法（参见[语法是唯一的命令层](#syntax-is-the-only-command-layer)）。"

msgid "Started without a file, the program opens one empty data window, a place to open files from."
msgstr "不带文件启动时，程序会打开一个空的数据窗口，供您从中打开文件。"

msgid "Opening files"
msgstr "打开文件 {#opening-files}"

msgid "From a terminal, `statscraft-gui survey.sav job.sps` opens a data file and a syntax file. Both are optional."
msgstr "在终端中，`statscraft-gui survey.sav job.sps` 会打开一个数据文件和一个语法文件。两者都是可选的。"

msgid "File > Open data opens a .sav or .zsav file at once, in a data window of its own. The empty data window takes the first file."
msgstr "File > Open data 会立即在单独的数据窗口中打开 .sav 或 .zsav 文件。空的数据窗口会接收第一个文件。"

msgid "An Excel workbook (.xlsx, .xlsm, .xls) or a text file (.csv, .txt, .tab, .dat) opens the Open Data dialog first. It writes `GET DATA`, with `DATASET NAME` after it as for a .sav file:"
msgstr "Excel 工作簿（.xlsx、.xlsm、.xls）或文本文件（.csv、.txt、.tab、.dat）会先打开 Open Data 对话框。它写出 `GET DATA`，并像 .sav 文件一样在其后写出 `DATASET NAME`："

msgid "for a workbook: the sheet, whether the first row holds the variable names, and a range such as A1:F200 (empty reads the whole sheet);"
msgstr "对于工作簿：工作表、第一行是否为变量名，以及一个范围，例如 A1:F200（留空则读取整个工作表）；"

msgid "for a text file: the delimiter (comma, semicolon or tab; the one the first line uses most is chosen), and whether the first line holds the names, with that line shown. Every variable is read as `AUTO`."
msgstr "对于文本文件：分隔符（逗号、分号或制表符；自动选择第一行中出现最多的那一个），以及第一行是否为变量名，并显示该行。每个变量都以 `AUTO` 方式读取。"

msgid "After an Open Data run, File > Save data asks for a new .sav file."
msgstr "通过 Open Data 运行后，File > Save data 会要求指定一个新的 .sav 文件。"

msgid "File > Open output opens a Statscraft output file (.scout) in an output window of its own, by running `OUTPUT OPEN FILE='...'.`. See [saving output](#saving-output)."
msgstr "File > Open output 会运行 `OUTPUT OPEN FILE='...'.`，在单独的输出窗口中打开 Statscraft 输出文件（.scout）。参见[保存输出](#saving-output)。"

msgid "File > Recent files lists the ten files opened or saved last."
msgstr "File > Recent files 列出最近打开或保存的十个文件。"

msgid "Files dropped on the window from the file manager open too. A .sav or .zsav file opens as data, a workbook or text file in the Open Data dialog, a .sps file in a syntax window and each .scout file in an output window. One data file and one syntax file open at a time; the status bar names the files left out."
msgstr "从文件管理器拖放到窗口上的文件也会打开。.sav 或 .zsav 文件作为数据打开，工作簿或文本文件在 Open Data 对话框中打开，.sps 文件在语法窗口中打开，每个 .scout 文件在输出窗口中打开。一次只打开一个数据文件和一个语法文件；状态栏会列出未打开的文件。"

msgid "The installer on Windows, and the packages for macOS and Linux, let a double-click on a .sav, .zsav, .sps or .scout file open it in Statscraft. When Statscraft runs already, the file opens in that window and its session, and the window comes to the front; starting Statscraft from the menu without a file still opens a new window."
msgstr "Windows 上的安装程序以及 macOS 和 Linux 的安装包，使您双击 .sav、.zsav、.sps 或 .scout 文件即可在 Statscraft 中打开它。如果 Statscraft 已在运行，文件会在该窗口及其会话中打开，并且窗口会切换到最前面；从菜单启动 Statscraft 而不带文件时，仍会打开一个新窗口。"

msgid "Exporting data"
msgstr "导出数据 {#exporting-data}"

msgid "File > Export data writes `SAVE TRANSLATE`. The file name chosen sets the type: an Excel workbook (.xlsx), a CSV file (.csv), tab-delimited text (.txt) or a Stata file (.dta). The dialog offers:"
msgstr "File > Export data 写出 `SAVE TRANSLATE`。所选文件名决定文件类型：Excel 工作簿（.xlsx）、CSV 文件（.csv）、制表符分隔的文本（.txt）或 Stata 文件（.dta）。对话框提供："

msgid "a first row of variable names, variable labels or none;"
msgstr "第一行为变量名、变量标签或不设；"

msgid "value labels instead of values;"
msgstr "用值标签代替值；"

msgid "user-missing values as empty;"
msgstr "将用户缺失值写为空；"

msgid "the variables to export (none chosen: all, in the order of the dataset);"
msgstr "要导出的变量（未选择时：全部变量，按数据集中的顺序）；"

msgid "for a Stata file, instead of the first row and value labels: the Stata release that reads it (8 to 14, default 14) and whole strings (`EDITION=SE`, on by default; off, strings are cut at 80 bytes). Value labels go into the file as Stata value labels."
msgstr "对于 Stata 文件，取代第一行和值标签选项的是：读取该文件的 Stata 版本（8 到 14，默认 14）以及完整字符串（`EDITION=SE`，默认开启；关闭时，字符串在 80 字节处截断）。值标签以 Stata 值标签的形式写入文件。"

msgid "An existing file is replaced once the file dialog has asked."
msgstr "文件对话框询问后，已存在的文件会被替换。"

msgid "Data windows"
msgstr "数据窗口 {#data-windows}"

msgid "Each dataset of the session that holds data has a data window. The title names the file and the dataset, such as `survey.sav [DataSet1]`, and the window of the active dataset says `(active)`."
msgstr "会话中每个含有数据的数据集都有一个数据窗口。标题显示文件和数据集名称，例如 `survey.sav [DataSet1]`，活动数据集的窗口会标明 `(active)`。"

msgid "Opening a data file opens its window. A file opened from the window gets the next free dataset name (DataSet1, DataSet2 and so on), so the data open before stays open."
msgstr "打开数据文件会打开它的窗口。从窗口中打开的文件会获得下一个可用的数据集名称（DataSet1、DataSet2 等），因此之前打开的数据仍保持打开。"

msgid "A dataset made by syntax gets a window too: `DATASET COPY`, `DATASET DECLARE` once a command has written data to it, and a `GET` typed in syntax without `DATASET NAME`. A dataset that `DATASET CLOSE` closes loses its window, and `DATASET NAME` keeps the window under the new name."
msgstr "由语法创建的数据集也会获得窗口：`DATASET COPY`、命令已向其写入数据的 `DATASET DECLARE`，以及在语法中输入的不带 `DATASET NAME` 的 `GET`。被 `DATASET CLOSE` 关闭的数据集会失去其窗口，而 `DATASET NAME` 会让窗口以新名称保留。"

msgid "A click anywhere in a data window, its menus included, makes its dataset active. That runs `DATASET ACTIVATE name.`, which shows in the log like any run. A click in the window of the active dataset runs nothing."
msgstr "在数据窗口中的任何位置单击（包括其菜单），都会使其数据集成为活动数据集。这会运行 `DATASET ACTIVATE name.`，并像其他运行一样显示在日志中。在活动数据集的窗口中单击不会运行任何命令。"

msgid "Dialogs opened from a data window work on its dataset, which is active by then."
msgstr "从数据窗口打开的对话框作用于该窗口的数据集，此时它已是活动数据集。"

msgid "Each window keeps its own tab, selection and find bar. Grid edits, right-click menus and Delete work in every data window."
msgstr "每个窗口都保留自己的标签页、选择范围和查找栏。网格编辑、右键菜单和 Delete 键在每个数据窗口中都可使用。"

msgid "The data a typed `GET` reads without `DATASET NAME` has no name. Such a dataset closes when another one becomes active (a click in another data window, the Active list, opening a file). When it holds unsaved changes, a question comes first: **Save** saves it and goes on, **Don't save** goes on without it, **Cancel** keeps everything as it is."
msgstr "在语法中输入的不带 `DATASET NAME` 的 `GET` 所读取的数据没有名称。当另一个数据集成为活动数据集时（在另一个数据窗口中单击、使用 Active 列表、打开文件），这样的数据集会被关闭。如果它有未保存的更改，会先弹出询问：**Save** 保存后继续，**Don't save** 不保存直接继续，**Cancel** 保持一切不变。"

msgid "File > Close or the window's close button closes the dataset. When its data is unsaved, a question offers **Save**, **Don't save** and **Cancel**. Closing runs `DATASET CLOSE name.`. When the dataset is the active one, another open dataset is activated first, as `DATASET CLOSE` of the active dataset only takes its name away; when it is the last one, `NEW FILE.` follows."
msgstr "File > Close 或窗口的关闭按钮会关闭该数据集。如果其数据未保存，会弹出询问，提供 **Save**、**Don't save** 和 **Cancel**。关闭时运行 `DATASET CLOSE name.`。如果该数据集是活动数据集，会先激活另一个打开的数据集，因为对活动数据集运行 `DATASET CLOSE` 只会去掉它的名称；如果它是最后一个数据集，随后会运行 `NEW FILE.`。"

msgid "Closing the last data window does not end the program while other windows are open. Opening a file opens a data window again."
msgstr "当其他窗口仍打开时，关闭最后一个数据窗口不会退出程序。再次打开文件会重新打开数据窗口。"

msgid "The Data tab"
msgstr "Data 标签页 {#the-data-tab}"

msgid "The cases, in a grid that draws only the visible cells."
msgstr "个案显示在一个只绘制可见单元格的网格中。"

msgid "What the grid shows"
msgstr "网格显示的内容 {#what-the-grid-shows}"

msgid "**Show value labels**, above the grid, switches value labels on and off."
msgstr "网格上方的 **Show value labels** 用于开启和关闭值标签显示。"

msgid "Each column draws its values and labels with the variable's alignment. When the file sets none, numbers go to the right and strings to the left."
msgstr "每一列按变量的对齐方式绘制值和标签。如果文件中未设置对齐方式，数字靠右，字符串靠左。"

msgid "A value or label too wide for its column is cut short with an ellipsis and keeps its alignment."
msgstr "超出列宽的值或标签会以省略号截短，并保持其对齐方式。"

msgid "A system-missing value shows as a small gray dot. An empty string shows as nothing."
msgstr "系统缺失值显示为一个灰色小圆点。空字符串不显示任何内容。"

msgid "While `FILTER BY` is in force, the row number of every case the filter leaves out has a diagonal stroke through it. The case stays in the grid."
msgstr "当 `FILTER BY` 生效时，被过滤器排除的每个个案的行号上会有一条斜线。该个案仍留在网格中。"

msgid "A column is as wide as the variable's display width (the width a .sav file keeps for each variable). Drag the border at the right of its name to change it. That runs `VARIABLE WIDTH var (n).`, so the width is saved with the data."
msgstr "列宽等于变量的显示宽度（.sav 文件为每个变量保存的宽度）。拖动变量名右侧的边框即可更改。这会运行 `VARIABLE WIDTH var (n).`，因此宽度会随数据一起保存。"

msgid "Editing"
msgstr "编辑 {#editing}"

msgid "Double-click a cell or press Enter to change it. Enter commits, Escape cancels."
msgstr "双击单元格或按 Enter 键即可修改。Enter 确认，Escape 取消。"

msgid "Delete with whole columns selected asks to delete those variables."
msgstr "选中整列时按 Delete，会询问是否删除这些变量。"

msgid "Delete with cells selected clears them, for example `IF (RANGE($CASENUM, 2, 4)) age = $SYSMIS.` (a blank for a string). Ctrl+Z brings them back."
msgstr "选中单元格时按 Delete 会清除它们，例如 `IF (RANGE($CASENUM, 2, 4)) age = $SYSMIS.`（字符串则为空白）。Ctrl+Z 可以恢复。"

msgid "Keys and selection"
msgstr "按键与选择"

msgid "Arrows, Page Up and Page Down, Home and End move the selection."
msgstr "方向键、Page Up 和 Page Down、Home 和 End 用于移动选择。"

msgid "Ctrl with an arrow goes to the first or last row or column. Ctrl+Home and Ctrl+End go to the first and last cell."
msgstr "Ctrl 加方向键跳到第一行或最后一行、第一列或最后一列。Ctrl+Home 和 Ctrl+End 跳到第一个和最后一个单元格。"

msgid "Tab and Shift+Tab move to the next and previous cell, committing an edit on the way."
msgstr "Tab 和 Shift+Tab 移到下一个和上一个单元格，并顺带确认正在进行的编辑。"

msgid "Shift with these keys, or Shift+click, extends the selection to a block."
msgstr "Shift 加这些按键，或 Shift+单击，可将选择扩展为一个区块。"

msgid "A click on a row number or a column name selects the whole case or variable. Shift+click selects a range, Ctrl+click adds or removes one."
msgstr "单击行号或列名会选中整个个案或变量。Shift+单击选择一个范围，Ctrl+单击添加或移除一个。"

msgid "Dragging across cells selects the block. Dragging across column names or row numbers selects the variables or cases in between."
msgstr "在单元格上拖动会选中该区块。在列名或行号上拖动会选中其间的变量或个案。"

msgid "Ctrl+C copies the selection as tab-separated text, with the variable names as the first line, for a spreadsheet or a text editor. One cell copies as its text alone. More than two million cells are not copied."
msgstr "Ctrl+C 将所选内容复制为制表符分隔的文本，第一行为变量名，可粘贴到电子表格或文本编辑器中。单个单元格只复制其文本。超过两百万个单元格时不会复制。"

msgid "The Variables tab"
msgstr "Variables 标签页 {#the-variables-tab}"

msgid "One row per variable, with these columns: name, type, format, width, decimals, label, value labels, missing values, columns (the display width, as wide as the Data tab shows it), alignment, measure and role. A variable without an alignment or role in the file shows numbers to the right, strings to the left and the role Input."
msgstr "每个变量一行，包含以下列：名称、类型、格式、宽度、小数位、标签、值标签、缺失值、列宽（显示宽度，与 Data 标签页中显示的宽度相同）、对齐方式、测量级别和角色。文件中未设置对齐方式或角色的变量，数字靠右、字符串靠左，角色为 Input。"

msgid "Changing a field"
msgstr "修改字段 {#changing-a-field}"

msgid "Double-click a field to change it, or press Enter to change the field at the cursor."
msgstr "双击字段即可修改，或按 Enter 键修改光标所在的字段。"

msgid "**Type and format.** The type (Numeric, Date or String) and the format open a small dialog. It offers only formats that exist: numbers (plain, comma, dot, dollar, percent, scientific, leading zeros), dates and times, and strings. Width and decimals are numbers within that format's limits. The dialog runs `FORMATS`, or `ALTER TYPE` for a new type or string width. A new type drops value labels and missing values, and the dialog says so."
msgstr "**类型和格式。** 类型（Numeric、Date 或 String）和格式会打开一个小对话框。它只提供实际存在的格式：数字（普通、逗号、点、美元、百分比、科学计数、前导零）、日期和时间，以及字符串。宽度和小数位是该格式限制范围内的数字。对话框运行 `FORMATS`，如果是新类型或新的字符串宽度则运行 `ALTER TYPE`。更改类型会丢弃值标签和缺失值，对话框会对此作出提示。"

msgid "**Value labels.** An editor with one row per code and label, to change, add and remove. It runs `VALUE LABELS` with the whole set."
msgstr "**值标签。** 一个编辑器，每个代码和标签占一行，可以修改、添加和删除。它用完整的标签集运行 `VALUE LABELS`。"

msgid "**Paste many**, in the value labels editor, is a text area for many lines, each a code and a label. A tab, semicolon, equals sign or comma separates them (the first of these that the text holds). It either updates the set (`ADD VALUE LABELS`: new codes are added, the labels of existing codes change) or replaces it (`VALUE LABELS`)."
msgstr "值标签编辑器中的 **Paste many** 是一个可输入多行的文本区域，每行一个代码和一个标签。二者以制表符、分号、等号或逗号分隔（取文本中最先出现的那一种）。它可以更新标签集（`ADD VALUE LABELS`：添加新代码，修改已有代码的标签），也可以替换标签集（`VALUE LABELS`）。"

msgid "**Missing values.** An editor for up to three values, or for numbers a range and one value more (LO and HI stand for the lowest and highest value). It runs `MISSING VALUES`."
msgstr "**缺失值。** 一个编辑器，最多可设三个值；对于数字，可设一个范围再加一个值（LO 和 HI 分别表示最小值和最大值）。它运行 `MISSING VALUES`。"

msgid "When the variable's row is one of several selected rows, the value labels and missing values editors can give the same labels or missing values to the other selected variables of its type."
msgstr "当该变量的行是多个选中行之一时，值标签和缺失值编辑器可以将相同的标签或缺失值赋给其他选中的同类型变量。"

msgid "**Columns** runs `VARIABLE WIDTH`, **alignment** `VARIABLE ALIGNMENT` and **role** `VARIABLE ROLE`. Alignment and role are chosen from a list, like the measure."
msgstr "**Columns** 运行 `VARIABLE WIDTH`，**alignment** 运行 `VARIABLE ALIGNMENT`，**role** 运行 `VARIABLE ROLE`。对齐方式和角色与测量级别一样，从列表中选择。"

msgid "The keys, mouse selection and Ctrl+C work as in the Data tab."
msgstr "按键、鼠标选择和 Ctrl+C 的用法与 Data 标签页相同。"

msgid "Delete deletes the variables whose row numbers are selected, with `DELETE VARIABLES`, after a question. Edit > Undo brings them back."
msgstr "Delete 会在询问后用 `DELETE VARIABLES` 删除行号被选中的变量。Edit > Undo 可以恢复它们。"

msgid "Drag a column border to resize it. These widths are a window setting."
msgstr "拖动列边框可调整列宽。这些宽度属于窗口设置。"

msgid "Finding a variable"
msgstr "查找变量 {#finding-a-variable}"

msgid "Ctrl+F in the Data or Variables tab opens a find bar."
msgstr "在 Data 或 Variables 标签页中按 Ctrl+F 会打开查找栏。"

msgid "Typing goes to the first variable whose name or label holds the text, in any case."
msgstr "输入文字后，会跳到名称或标签中包含该文字的第一个变量，不区分大小写。"

msgid "Enter or F3 goes to the next one. Escape closes the bar."
msgstr "Enter 或 F3 跳到下一个。Escape 关闭查找栏。"

msgid "The Variables tab goes to the variable's row, the Data tab to its column."
msgstr "在 Variables 标签页中跳到该变量的行，在 Data 标签页中跳到它的列。"

msgid "Right-click menus"
msgstr "右键菜单 {#right-click-menus}"

msgid "A right click opens a menu over what it lands on. The top of the menu names what it acts on."
msgstr "右键单击会针对所点击的对象打开一个菜单。菜单顶部显示它作用的对象。"

msgid "**On a column name**, or on the selected columns when it lands inside them:"
msgstr "**在列名上**，或在选中的列内单击时作用于所有选中的列："

msgid "Sort ascending or descending by them (`SORT CASES`)."
msgstr "按这些列升序或降序排序（`SORT CASES`）。"

msgid "Frequencies or Descriptives (numeric variables only), run at once."
msgstr "Frequencies 或 Descriptives（仅限数值变量），立即运行。"

msgid "Rename."
msgstr "Rename（重命名）。"

msgid "Insert variable before: a new numeric variable `new_1`."
msgstr "Insert variable before：插入一个新的数值变量 `new_1`。"

msgid "Copy, Delete."
msgstr "Copy、Delete。"

msgid "**On a cell**:"
msgstr "**在单元格上**："

msgid "Copy, Edit, Clear value."
msgstr "Copy、Edit、Clear value。"

msgid "Only cases where the variable has this value: a filter that leaves the other cases out of analyses (`FILTER BY`). It compares the stored value, not the rounded one shown."
msgstr "Only cases where the variable has this value：一个将其他个案排除在分析之外的过滤器（`FILTER BY`）。它比较的是存储的值，而不是显示的四舍五入值。"

msgid "Stop filtering."
msgstr "Stop filtering（停止过滤）。"

msgid "Keep only cases where...: opens Select Cases to delete the other cases."
msgstr "Keep only cases where...：打开 Select Cases，以删除其他个案。"

msgid "Sort ascending or descending by the variable."
msgstr "按该变量升序或降序排序。"

msgid "**On a row number**: Copy, or Delete case."
msgstr "**在行号上**：Copy 或 Delete case。"

msgid "**In the Variables tab**, the menu on row numbers is the one of the column names. On a cell it starts with Edit for that field."
msgstr "**在 Variables 标签页中**，行号上的菜单与列名上的菜单相同。在单元格上，菜单以该字段的 Edit 开头。"

msgid "How the items behave:"
msgstr "菜单项的行为："

msgid "Every item runs syntax like any other run, so it shows in the log and Ctrl+Z takes a change back."
msgstr "每个菜单项都像其他运行一样运行语法，因此会显示在日志中，并且可以用 Ctrl+Z 撤销更改。"

msgid "Items that run syntax wait while a run is going on. The analyses and sorting are off when there are no cases."
msgstr "运行语法的菜单项会在有运行进行时等待。没有个案时，分析和排序不可用。"

msgid "Some items first show a question with the syntax: deleting variables or a case, sorting while a split is on (sorting ends the split), and Frequencies of more than 100 variables. Only a click on the button runs it; Escape cancels."
msgstr "有些菜单项会先显示一个带有语法的询问：删除变量或个案、在拆分开启时排序（排序会结束拆分），以及对超过 100 个变量运行 Frequencies。只有单击按钮才会运行；Escape 取消。"

msgid "Syntax windows"
msgstr "语法窗口 {#syntax-windows}"

msgid "Each syntax window holds one syntax file, or new syntax, in an editor with line numbers."
msgstr "每个语法窗口在带行号的编辑器中容纳一个语法文件或新语法。"

msgid "File > New > Syntax opens a new window, named Syntax1, Syntax2 and so on until it is saved. File > Open syntax, Recent files and a dropped .sps file open the file in a new window; a file that is open already brings its window to the front."
msgstr "File > New > Syntax 会打开一个新窗口，在保存之前依次命名为 Syntax1、Syntax2 等。File > Open syntax、Recent files 和拖放的 .sps 文件会在新窗口中打开该文件；如果文件已打开，则将其窗口切换到最前面。"

msgid "Save syntax and Save syntax as save the window they are chosen in."
msgstr "Save syntax 和 Save syntax as 保存选择它们时所在的窗口。"

msgid "File > Close or the window's close button closes it. When its text is unsaved, a question offers **Save**, **Don't save** and **Cancel**."
msgstr "File > Close 或窗口的关闭按钮会关闭它。如果其文本未保存，会弹出询问，提供 **Save**、**Don't save** 和 **Cancel**。"

msgid "The toolbar has **Run all**, **Run selection** and the **Active** list. The Active list shows the datasets of the session, with the active one chosen. Choosing another runs `DATASET ACTIVATE name.`, which shows in the log like any run."
msgstr "工具栏上有 **Run all**、**Run selection** 和 **Active** 列表。Active 列表显示会话中的数据集，并选中活动数据集。选择另一个数据集会运行 `DATASET ACTIVATE name.`，并像其他运行一样显示在日志中。"

msgid "Every window runs on the same session and the same active dataset. A run started while another goes on waits its turn, and the status bar says how many runs wait."
msgstr "所有窗口都在同一个会话和同一个活动数据集上运行。在另一次运行进行时开始的运行会排队等待，状态栏会显示有多少次运行在等待。"

msgid "**Paste** in a dialog or the output puts the syntax at the end of the designated syntax window: the one opened last, or the one chosen with Window > Designate window. With no syntax window open, a new one opens."
msgstr "对话框或输出中的 **Paste** 会将语法放到指定语法窗口的末尾：即最后打开的那个，或用 Window > Designate window 选定的那个。如果没有打开的语法窗口，会新开一个。"

msgid "**The Agent window.** Syntax that an AI agent or `statscraft run -s gui` runs in this window is added to a syntax window named Agent when it works, each run under a comment line with its time. It opens with the first such run, and again after you close it. Edit it, run lines from it and save it like any syntax window; pasted syntax never goes there. An agent can also read and edit your other syntax windows and run them, and you see each change in the editor as it happens (Ctrl+Z there takes it back). See [the MCP server](mcp.md#syntax-windows)."
msgstr "**Agent 窗口。** AI 智能体或 `statscraft run -s gui` 在此窗口中运行的语法，如果成功，会添加到一个名为 Agent 的语法窗口中，每次运行之前有一行带时间的注释。它在第一次这样的运行时打开，关闭后再次运行时会重新打开。您可以像任何语法窗口一样编辑它、从中运行行并保存它；粘贴的语法永远不会进入这里。智能体还可以读取、编辑和运行您的其他语法窗口，您会在编辑器中实时看到每处更改（在那里按 Ctrl+Z 可撤销）。参见 [MCP 服务器](mcp.md#syntax-windows)。"

msgid "The editor"
msgstr "编辑器 {#the-editor}"

msgid "Colors mark command names, subcommands, keywords, strings, numbers, comments, macro words (`!name` and the words of the macro language) and the period that ends a command."
msgstr "不同颜色标示命令名、子命令、关键字、字符串、数字、注释、宏词（`!name` 和宏语言的词）以及结束命令的句点。"

msgid "A macro defined with DEFINE, in the editor text or in an earlier run of the session, is colored as a macro where it is called, also where a command would stand."
msgstr "用 DEFINE 定义的宏，无论定义在编辑器文本中还是会话的先前运行中，在调用处都会以宏的颜色显示，包括出现在命令位置时。"

msgid "**Run all** runs the whole text. **Run selection** (Ctrl+Enter) runs the commands on the selected lines. On a line with no command (such as the empty line under a command just typed) it runs the command above."
msgstr "**Run all** 运行全部文本。**Run selection**（Ctrl+Enter）运行所选行上的命令。在没有命令的行上（例如刚输入的命令下面的空行），它运行上方的命令。"

msgid "An error shows at its line and column."
msgstr "错误会显示在其所在的行和列。"

msgid "Long lines wrap at the window edge. Edit > Settings > Editor > Wrap long lines turns that off."
msgstr "长行会在窗口边缘换行。Edit > Settings > Editor > Wrap long lines 可以关闭此功能。"

msgid "Completion"
msgstr "自动补全 {#completion}"

msgid "While you type, a list offers what fits at the cursor:"
msgstr "在您输入时，会出现一个列表，提供适合光标位置的内容："

msgid "command names at the start of a command (abbreviations such as FRE or VAL LAB find the full name);"
msgstr "命令开头处的命令名（FRE 或 VAL LAB 等缩写可找到完整名称）；"

msgid "subcommands after `/`, and the keywords of the command;"
msgstr "`/` 之后的子命令，以及该命令的关键字；"

msgid "the variables of the open data, with their labels;"
msgstr "已打开数据中的变量及其标签；"

msgid "function names where an expression goes;"
msgstr "表达式位置上的函数名；"

msgid "the macros defined with DEFINE in the text or the session, where a command goes and inside commands;"
msgstr "在文本或会话中用 DEFINE 定义的宏，出现在命令位置和命令内部；"

msgid "after `!`, the words of the macro language."
msgstr "`!` 之后的宏语言词。"

msgid "Ctrl+Space opens the list at any point. Arrows choose, Enter or Tab puts the choice in, Escape closes the list."
msgstr "Ctrl+Space 可在任意位置打开列表。方向键选择，Enter 或 Tab 插入所选项，Escape 关闭列表。"

msgid "Find and replace"
msgstr "查找和替换 {#find-and-replace}"

msgid "Ctrl+F (Edit > Find) opens a find bar over the editor, Ctrl+H (Edit > Replace) the same bar with a replace row. Selected text on one line becomes the text to find."
msgstr "Ctrl+F（Edit > Find）在编辑器上方打开查找栏，Ctrl+H（Edit > Replace）打开同一个查找栏并带有替换行。单行内选中的文本会成为要查找的文本。"

msgid "Typing goes to the first match from the cursor. Every match is marked, the selected one more strongly, and the bar counts them (\"2 of 7\")."
msgstr "输入文字后，会跳到光标之后的第一个匹配项。所有匹配项都会被标记，当前选中的标记更醒目，查找栏会显示计数（“2 of 7”）。"

msgid "Enter or F3 goes to the next match, Shift+Enter or Shift+F3 to the previous one, round the end of the text."
msgstr "Enter 或 F3 跳到下一个匹配项，Shift+Enter 或 Shift+F3 跳到上一个，到达文本末尾后循环。"

msgid "**Match case** tells upper and lower case apart. **Whole word** skips matches inside a longer name, so `age` does not find `age2`."
msgstr "**Match case** 区分大小写。**Whole word** 跳过较长名称内部的匹配，因此 `age` 不会找到 `age2`。"

msgid "**Replace** (or Enter in the replace field) replaces the selected match and goes to the next one. **Replace all** replaces every match and says how many. Ctrl+Z in the editor takes a replacement back."
msgstr "**Replace**（或在替换字段中按 Enter）替换当前选中的匹配项并跳到下一个。**Replace all** 替换所有匹配项并显示替换数量。在编辑器中按 Ctrl+Z 可撤销替换。"

msgid "Escape or **Close** closes the bar and puts the cursor back in the editor."
msgstr "Escape 或 **Close** 关闭查找栏，并将光标放回编辑器中。"

msgid "Help in the editor"
msgstr "编辑器中的帮助 {#help-in-the-editor}"

msgid "A command in the list, or a command name under the mouse, shows its summary and syntax."
msgstr "列表中的命令，或鼠标指向的命令名，会显示其摘要和语法。"

msgid "F1 opens the full help of the command at the cursor in a small window."
msgstr "F1 会在一个小窗口中打开光标处命令的完整帮助。"

msgid "The Window menu"
msgstr "Window 菜单 {#the-window-menu}"

msgid "Every window has the same menu bar. The Window menu lists the open windows; a click brings one to the front. The designated syntax window and the designated output window are marked `+`. **Designate window** makes the syntax or output window it is chosen in the designated one of its kind; for an output window it runs `OUTPUT ACTIVATE name.`."
msgstr "每个窗口都有相同的菜单栏。Window 菜单列出已打开的窗口；单击可将其切换到最前面。指定语法窗口和指定输出窗口标有 `+`。**Designate window** 会将选择它时所在的语法窗口或输出窗口设为同类中的指定窗口；对于输出窗口，它运行 `OUTPUT ACTIVATE name.`。"

msgid "The program ends when the last window closes, whatever its kind."
msgstr "最后一个窗口关闭时，无论它是哪一类，程序都会退出。"

msgid "Output windows"
msgstr "输出窗口 {#output-windows}"

msgid "Each output document of the session has an output window, named after the document (Document1, Document2 and so on, or the name `OUTPUT NAME` gave). The tables of every run go to the designated document, so they appear in its window."
msgstr "会话中的每个输出文档都有一个输出窗口，以文档命名（Document1、Document2 等，或 `OUTPUT NAME` 指定的名称）。每次运行的表格都进入指定文档，因此会显示在它的窗口中。"

msgid "The first tables of a session start Document1, and its window opens."
msgstr "会话中的第一批表格会创建 Document1，并打开其窗口。"

msgid "File > New > Output runs `OUTPUT NEW.`: a new window opens and becomes the designated one."
msgstr "File > New > Output 运行 `OUTPUT NEW.`：打开一个新窗口并成为指定窗口。"

msgid "Window > Designate window, in an output window, runs `OUTPUT ACTIVATE name.`. `OUTPUT NEW`, `OUTPUT ACTIVATE` and `OUTPUT NAME` typed in syntax change the windows the same way."
msgstr "在输出窗口中，Window > Designate window 运行 `OUTPUT ACTIVATE name.`。在语法中输入的 `OUTPUT NEW`、`OUTPUT ACTIVATE` 和 `OUTPUT NAME` 也以同样的方式改变窗口。"

msgid "File > Close or the window's close button runs `OUTPUT CLOSE name.`. When the window holds output that is not saved, it asks first: Save, Don't save or Cancel. The next tables after the designated window closed start a new document and window."
msgstr "File > Close 或窗口的关闭按钮运行 `OUTPUT CLOSE name.`。如果窗口中有未保存的输出，会先询问：Save、Don't save 或 Cancel。指定窗口关闭后，下一批表格会创建新的文档和窗口。"

msgid "Each output window shows its tables beside a navigator that groups them by run and command. A click on a run in the navigator folds it away."
msgstr "每个输出窗口在导航器旁显示其表格，导航器按运行和命令对表格分组。在导航器中单击某次运行可将其折叠。"

msgid "What the output shows"
msgstr "输出显示的内容 {#what-the-output-shows}"

msgid "Everything the output shows is an element in the navigator. Under each command come its heading (the line such as \"CTABLES, line 36\" above its first table) and its tables and charts, each with its title and, when it has them, its notes."
msgstr "输出中显示的所有内容都是导航器中的一个元素。每个命令下依次是它的标题（第一张表格上方的那一行，例如“CTABLES, line 36”）及其表格和图表，每张表格和图表都带有其标题，如有注释也带有注释。"

msgid "Each element has a box beside it in the navigator. Clear the box to hide that one element, check it to show it again. A table hidden by `OUTPUT MODIFY` starts with its box clear."
msgstr "导航器中每个元素旁都有一个复选框。取消勾选可隐藏该元素，再次勾选可重新显示。被 `OUTPUT MODIFY` 隐藏的表格，其复选框一开始就未勾选。"

msgid "Edit > Settings > Grids and output > **Show in the output** shows or hides whole kinds: command headings (off by default), titles, tables, notes under tables and charts (on by default)."
msgstr "Edit > Settings > Grids and output > **Show in the output** 显示或隐藏整类内容：命令标题（默认关闭）、标题、表格、表格下方的注释以及图表（默认开启）。"

msgid "An element shows when its kind is on and it is not hidden itself. A table or chart that does not show takes its title and notes with it, and a command whose tables all are hidden has no heading."
msgstr "当元素所属的类别开启且该元素本身未被隐藏时，它才会显示。不显示的表格或图表会连同其标题和注释一起隐藏，所有表格都被隐藏的命令也不显示命令标题。"

msgid "An element that does not show is greyed and in italics in the navigator. The output closes up around it at once."
msgstr "不显示的元素在导航器中以灰色斜体显示。输出会立即合拢，填补它留下的空白。"

msgid "A chart's notes are its subtitle and footnote."
msgstr "图表的注释是指其副标题和脚注。"

msgid "Hiding is a matter of the window: OUTPUT SAVE keeps everything, with the hidden flags `OUTPUT MODIFY` set. A command heading hidden by `OUTPUT MODIFY /SELECT HEADINGS ... VISIBLE=NO` is a cleared Command headings box of that command only; its tables stay."
msgstr "隐藏只影响窗口：OUTPUT SAVE 会保存全部内容，并带上 `OUTPUT MODIFY` 设置的隐藏标记。被 `OUTPUT MODIFY /SELECT HEADINGS ... VISIBLE=NO` 隐藏的命令标题，仅相当于取消勾选该命令的 Command headings 复选框；其表格仍保留。"

msgid "How tables look"
msgstr "表格的外观 {#how-tables-look}"

msgid "Each table has its multi-level header. Its caption and notes follow it."
msgstr "每张表格都有多级表头。其说明文字和注释位于表格之后。"

msgid "Columns are as wide as their numbers, which align right."
msgstr "列宽与其中的数字相适应，数字右对齐。"

msgid "Long row labels and column headers wrap between words."
msgstr "较长的行标签和列标题会在单词之间换行。"

msgid "A row label repeated under the same outer labels is shown once, beside all its rows."
msgstr "在同一外层标签下重复的行标签只显示一次，位于其所有行的旁边。"

msgid "Selecting tables"
msgstr "选择表格 {#selecting-tables}"

msgid "A run selects nothing, so its tables show without a frame."
msgstr "运行不会选中任何内容，因此其表格显示时没有边框。"

msgid "Click a table, or its name in the navigator, to select it. Ctrl+click selects more; Ctrl+A or **Select all** selects all."
msgstr "单击表格或导航器中的表格名称即可选中。Ctrl+单击选择更多；Ctrl+A 或 **Select all** 全选。"

msgid "Click a selected table again, press Escape or click beside the tables to clear the selection."
msgstr "再次单击已选中的表格、按 Escape 或在表格旁边单击，可清除选择。"

msgid "The syntax of a selected table's command shows under the navigator, exactly as it ran, with **Copy**, **Paste** (into the designated syntax window) and **Run again**. Pointing at a command in the navigator shows its syntax too."
msgstr "所选表格对应命令的语法会按实际运行时的原样显示在导航器下方，并带有 **Copy**、**Paste**（粘贴到指定语法窗口）和 **Run again** 按钮。将鼠标指向导航器中的命令也会显示其语法。"

msgid "Working with tables"
msgstr "处理表格 {#working-with-tables}"

msgid "The buttons over the tables act on the selected tables. A right click on a table offers the same."
msgstr "表格上方的按钮作用于所选表格。右键单击表格会提供相同的操作。"

msgid "**Copy** (Ctrl+C) puts the tables on the clipboard with their layout, for a word processor or spreadsheet, and as plain text beside it."
msgstr "**Copy**（Ctrl+C）将表格连同其版式放到剪贴板上，可粘贴到文字处理软件或电子表格中，同时附带纯文本版本。"

msgid "**Copy as text** gives tab-separated text."
msgstr "**Copy as text** 给出制表符分隔的文本。"

msgid "**Delete** removes them from the window and from its output document, so OUTPUT SAVE and OUTPUT EXPORT leave them out too. The log shows the deletion as a comment line. While a run is going, Delete waits: the status bar asks to try again when it ends."
msgstr "**Delete** 将它们从窗口及其输出文档中删除，因此 OUTPUT SAVE 和 OUTPUT EXPORT 也不会包含它们。日志会以一行注释显示这次删除。在有运行进行时，Delete 会等待：运行结束时状态栏会提示您再试一次。"

msgid "**Export...** opens the Export dialog (below) set to only them."
msgstr "**Export...** 打开 Export 对话框（见下文），并设为只导出这些表格。"

msgid "**Clear output** deletes every table, the same way."
msgstr "**Clear output** 以同样的方式删除所有表格。"

msgid "Copies and exports (web page, PDF, Excel, from these buttons and from the File menu) take only what the output shows: no hidden tables, and no headings, titles or notes that do not show. A table whose title does not show has no title row in Excel, and its sheet and PDF bookmark keep its name. With **Hidden items too** in the Export dialog on, they take everything; the box is remembered, and copies follow it too."
msgstr "复制和导出（网页、PDF、Excel，无论通过这些按钮还是通过 File 菜单）只包含输出中显示的内容：不包括隐藏的表格，也不包括未显示的命令标题、标题或注释。标题未显示的表格在 Excel 中没有标题行，但其工作表和 PDF 书签仍保留其名称。在 Export 对话框中开启 **Hidden items too** 后，它们会包含全部内容；该选项会被记住，复制也会遵循它。"

msgid "Charts"
msgstr "图表 {#charts}"

msgid "A chart shows in the output as a picture, as wide as the window up to about 760 pixels, on the same paper as the tables."
msgstr "图表在输出中以图片形式显示，宽度与窗口相同，最多约 760 像素，与表格位于同一页面上。"

msgid "Bar, pie, line, area and scatter charts and histograms are drawn, with error bars where the chart has them."
msgstr "条形图、饼图、折线图、面积图、散点图和直方图都会绘制出来，图表带误差条时也会绘制误差条。"

msgid "So are the statistical plots: boxplots, Q-Q and P-P plots, ROC curves, the dendrogram, the icicle plot, the tree diagram and the territorial map."
msgstr "统计图也一样：箱线图、Q-Q 图和 P-P 图、ROC 曲线、树状图、冰柱图、树形图和领域图。"

msgid "A stem-and-leaf display and a plot in three dimensions show as their data table."
msgstr "茎叶图和三维图以其数据表的形式显示。"

msgid "A right click on a chart offers, besides Copy, Copy as text and Delete:"
msgstr "右键单击图表时，除 Copy、Copy as text 和 Delete 外，还提供："

msgid "**Show data**: the chart's numbers as a table in its place; **Show chart** brings the picture back."
msgstr "**Show data**：在图表的位置以表格形式显示图表的数字；**Show chart** 恢复图片。"

msgid "**Save chart as PNG...** and **Save chart as SVG...**: the picture as a file, 640 pixels wide (a PNG has twice the pixels), on the paper the output shows."
msgstr "**Save chart as PNG...** 和 **Save chart as SVG...**：将图片保存为文件，宽 640 像素（PNG 的像素数为两倍），背景与输出中显示的页面相同。"

msgid "Charts in the office programs"
msgstr "Office 程序中的图表 {#charts-in-the-office-programs}"

msgid "Bar, pie, line and area charts go into PowerPoint, Word and Excel as real charts of those programs. Their numbers sit in a workbook inside the chart, so **Edit Data** opens them. They have no colors of their own, so they take the theme of the presentation or document. A statistical plot, such as a histogram or a boxplot, goes in as a picture."
msgstr "条形图、饼图、折线图和面积图会以这些程序自己的真实图表形式进入 PowerPoint、Word 和 Excel。其数字保存在图表内部的一个工作簿中，因此 **Edit Data** 可以打开它们。这些图表没有自己的颜色，因此会采用演示文稿或文档的主题。统计图（例如直方图或箱线图）以图片形式插入。"

msgid "A right click on a drawn chart offers:"
msgstr "右键单击已绘制的图表时，提供："

msgid "**Open in PowerPoint**: a presentation with one slide, the chart's title as the slide title."
msgstr "**Open in PowerPoint**：一个只有一张幻灯片的演示文稿，以图表标题作为幻灯片标题。"

msgid "**Open in Excel**: a workbook with the chart's data table and the chart beside it."
msgstr "**Open in Excel**：一个工作簿，包含图表的数据表，图表位于其旁边。"

msgid "**Open in Word**: a document holding the chart."
msgstr "**Open in Word**：一个包含该图表的文档。"

msgid "Each writes the file to a temporary folder and opens it with the program the system uses for that type of file, so it may be another office suite. Save it from there to keep it."
msgstr "每一项都会将文件写入临时文件夹，并用系统为该文件类型设定的程序打开，因此打开的也可能是其他办公套件。如需保留，请在该程序中保存。"

msgid "**Copy** on a single selected chart puts it on the Windows clipboard as an editable chart, with its data as tab-separated text and its picture as a PNG beside it, so a program that takes only pictures pastes the picture. Pasted into PowerPoint or Word it becomes their own chart, in the theme of the slide or document, and Edit Data opens its numbers. Excel pastes such a chart without its data, as it does with a chart copied in PowerPoint; use Open in Excel instead. On macOS and Linux, Copy puts the chart's data table on the clipboard, as for any table."
msgstr "对单个选中的图表使用 **Copy**，会将其作为可编辑图表放到 Windows 剪贴板上，同时附带制表符分隔的数据文本和 PNG 图片，因此只接受图片的程序会粘贴图片。粘贴到 PowerPoint 或 Word 中时，它会成为这些程序自己的图表，采用幻灯片或文档的主题，Edit Data 可以打开其数字。Excel 粘贴这样的图表时不带数据，与粘贴从 PowerPoint 复制的图表一样；请改用 Open in Excel。在 macOS 和 Linux 上，Copy 会像对待任何表格一样，将图表的数据表放到剪贴板上。"

msgid "Saving output"
msgstr "保存输出 {#saving-output}"

msgid "The output of a window can be kept as a Statscraft output file (.scout) and opened again later, with each command's syntax, warnings, tables and charts."
msgstr "窗口的输出可以保存为 Statscraft 输出文件（.scout），以后再次打开，其中包含每条命令的语法、警告、表格和图表。"

msgid "File > Save output writes the document of the output window it is chosen in (elsewhere, of the designated output window) to the file it came from or was saved to last; the first time, it asks for a file. File > Save output as always asks. Both run `OUTPUT SAVE NAME=name OUTFILE='...'.`, so the step is in the log."
msgstr "File > Save output 将选择它时所在输出窗口的文档（在其他窗口中则为指定输出窗口的文档）写入它原来的文件或上次保存的文件；第一次保存时会要求指定文件。File > Save output as 总是会询问。两者都运行 `OUTPUT SAVE NAME=name OUTFILE='...'.`，因此这一步会记录在日志中。"

msgid "File > Open output runs `OUTPUT OPEN FILE='...'.`. The file opens as a new document in a window of its own, as one run named after the file, and becomes the designated one: the next tables join it, and saving writes old and new together."
msgstr "File > Open output 运行 `OUTPUT OPEN FILE='...'.`。文件会作为新文档在单独的窗口中打开，表现为以文件命名的一次运行，并成为指定文档：下一批表格会加入其中，保存时会将新旧内容一起写入。"

msgid "The window keeps track of what is saved. A window whose output changed since it was opened or saved asks before it closes, and so does the program before it ends."
msgstr "窗口会记录哪些内容已保存。自打开或保存以来输出有变化的窗口在关闭前会询问，程序在退出前也会询问。"

msgid "A .scout file is plain JSON, one table row per line, so any text tool or AI agent can read it. See [the command line](command-line.md#output-files)."
msgstr ".scout 文件是纯 JSON，每行一个表格行，因此任何文本工具或 AI 智能体都能读取它。参见[命令行](command-line.md#output-files)。"

msgid "Exporting all output"
msgstr "导出全部输出 {#exporting-all-output}"

msgid "This is how your tables get to Excel, a web page or a PDF file."
msgstr "通过这种方式，您可以将表格导出到 Excel、网页或 PDF 文件。"

msgid "Choose **File > Export...**. In a data or syntax window, this exports the designated output window."
msgstr "选择 **File > Export...**。在数据窗口或语法窗口中，这会导出指定输出窗口。"

msgid "Choose the **Format**. For an Excel workbook, choose **One sheet per table** or **All tables on one sheet**."
msgstr "选择 **Format**。对于 Excel 工作簿，选择 **One sheet per table** 或 **All tables on one sheet**。"

msgid "Under **Items**, choose all items of the output or only the selected tables, and whether to take **Hidden items too**."
msgstr "在 **Items** 下，选择输出的全部项目或仅所选表格，以及是否包含 **Hidden items too**。"

msgid "Click **Export...** and choose where to save. The dialog remembers your choices for the next export."
msgstr "单击 **Export...** 并选择保存位置。对话框会记住您的选择，供下次导出使用。"

msgid "**The Excel workbook**:"
msgstr "**Excel 工作簿**："

msgid "Each table has its title in bold, its column headers with merged cells for every level, its row labels, thin borders and its caption below. With one sheet per table, each sheet is named after its table."
msgstr "每张表格的标题为粗体，列标题在每一级都使用合并单元格，并带有行标签、细边框，说明文字位于下方。每张表格一个工作表时，每个工作表以其表格命名。"

msgid "Numbers stay numbers, with a format that shows them as the output does: a percentage cell holds the exact value and shows it as 45.2%. Dates, times and currency values are numbers with a date, time or currency format, so Excel can compute with them."
msgstr "数字仍是数字，并带有与输出显示方式一致的格式：百分比单元格保存精确值，并显示为 45.2%。日期、时间和货币值是带有日期、时间或货币格式的数字，因此 Excel 可以用它们计算。"

msgid "Significance letters and hidden small counts (such as `<5`) stay text."
msgstr "显著性字母和隐藏的小计数（例如 `<5`）仍为文本。"

msgid "A bar, pie, line or area chart goes in as its data table with an editable Excel chart beside it, drawn from those cells: change a number and the chart follows. The chart takes the workbook's theme. A statistical plot, such as a histogram or a boxplot, goes in as a picture beside its data table."
msgstr "条形图、饼图、折线图或面积图以其数据表的形式插入，旁边是一张根据这些单元格绘制的可编辑 Excel 图表：修改数字，图表会随之变化。图表采用工作簿的主题。统计图（例如直方图或箱线图）以图片形式插入在其数据表旁边。"

msgid "[Plugins](plugins.md) can add colors, fonts, column widths and comments, which become cell notes."
msgstr "[插件](plugins.md)可以添加颜色、字体、列宽和批注，批注会成为单元格注释。"

msgid "**Other formats**: a web page holds the tables, with each chart as a picture inside the page. A PDF file has A4 pages, with the tables as text, the charts as drawings, and bookmarks for the commands and their items."
msgstr "**其他格式**：网页包含表格，每张图表以图片形式嵌在页面中。PDF 文件使用 A4 页面，表格为文本，图表为矢量图，并带有命令及其项目的书签。"

msgid "**Without the window**: `statscraft run job.sps --xlsx tables.xlsx` writes the tables of a run to the same kind of workbook (see [Excel export](command-line.md#excel-export)). While the window is open, `statscraft export` and the MCP tool `export_output` export its output window with the same choices (see [export](command-line.md#export)). In syntax, OUTPUT EXPORT writes an output document to a workbook, a Word document, a presentation, a web page, text or a CSV file."
msgstr "**不使用窗口**：`statscraft run job.sps --xlsx tables.xlsx` 将一次运行的表格写入同样的工作簿（参见 [Excel 导出](command-line.md#excel-export)）。窗口打开时，`statscraft export` 和 MCP 工具 `export_output` 会以相同的选项导出其输出窗口（参见[导出](command-line.md#export)）。在语法中，OUTPUT EXPORT 将输出文档写入工作簿、Word 文档、演示文稿、网页、文本或 CSV 文件。"

msgid "**Analyze > Custom Tables...** builds a table of counts, percentages or means by groups, and can mark the groups that differ significantly. Most survey reports are made of such tables. The dialog writes one [CTABLES](commands/ctables.md) command."
msgstr "**Analyze > Custom Tables...** 按组构建计数、百分比或均值表格，并可标出有显著差异的组。大多数调查报告都由这样的表格组成。该对话框写出一条 [CTABLES](commands/ctables.md) 命令。"

msgid "For example, with the [sample file](getting-started.md#open-the-sample-file): put `satisfaction` in Rows and `region` in Columns, check **Column %**, check **Compare column proportions**, and click **OK**. The table shows, for each region, how many customers gave each answer, and letters mark the regions that differ. [Getting started](getting-started.md#build-a-custom-table) shows the result."
msgstr "例如，使用[示例文件](getting-started.md#open-the-sample-file)：将 `satisfaction` 放入 Rows，将 `region` 放入 Columns，勾选 **Column %** 和 **Compare column proportions**，然后单击 **OK**。表格会显示每个地区有多少客户给出了各个答案，并用字母标出有差异的地区。[入门](getting-started.md#build-a-custom-table)中展示了结果。"

msgid "Building the table"
msgstr "构建表格 {#building-the-table}"

msgid "The list on the left holds the variables of the active dataset, and under **Multiple response sets** the sets of the file. Click one or more names to pick them, then click **Add** beside a box. Click a name in a box to take it out again."
msgstr "左侧列表包含活动数据集的变量，**Multiple response sets** 下是文件中的多重响应集。单击一个或多个名称选中它们，然后单击某个框旁边的 **Add**。单击框中的名称可将其移出。"

msgid "**Rows (categories or sets)**: the categories of these variables and sets make the rows. Several are stacked, one below the other."
msgstr "**Rows (categories or sets)**：这些变量和多重响应集的类别构成行。多个变量上下堆叠。"

msgid "**Columns (categories or sets)**: the groups you compare, side by side. Several are stacked side by side."
msgstr "**Columns (categories or sets)**：您要比较的组，并排排列。多个变量左右并排堆叠。"

msgid "**Layers (a table for each category)**: a separate table for each category, for example one table per region."
msgstr "**Layers (a table for each category)**：每个类别一张单独的表格，例如每个地区一张表格。"

msgid "**Means of (scale variables, in the rows)**: scale variables, such as age or spend. Their mean shows in a row of their own."
msgstr "**Means of (scale variables, in the rows)**：尺度变量，例如年龄或消费额。其均值显示在单独的一行中。"

msgid "The syntax at the bottom of the dialog changes as you go. **OK** runs it, and **Paste** puts it in the syntax window, so you can change it or run it again later on new data."
msgstr "对话框底部的语法会随您的操作而变化。**OK** 运行它，**Paste** 将它放入语法窗口，以便您以后修改它，或在新数据上再次运行。"

msgid "Counts and percentages"
msgstr "计数和百分比 {#counts-and-percentages}"

msgid "Choose what each cell shows under **Summaries**:"
msgstr "在 **Summaries** 下选择每个单元格显示的内容："

msgid "**Count**: the number of cases, weighted when a weight is on."
msgstr "**Count**：个案数，开启权重时为加权个案数。"

msgid "**Column %**: the percentage of each column. Each column adds up to 100%, so you compare the groups in the columns."
msgstr "**Column %**：各列的百分比。每列加起来为 100%，因此您可以比较各列中的组。"

msgid "**Row %**: the percentage of each row."
msgstr "**Row %**：各行的百分比。"

msgid "**Mean**: the mean of the variables under **Means of**."
msgstr "**Mean**：**Means of** 下各变量的均值。"

msgid "**Totals**: a total row and a total column."
msgstr "**Totals**：一个总计行和一个总计列。"

msgid "**Effective count**, with an **Effective base weight**: for weighted survey data, the sample size that the weights leave in effect."
msgstr "**Effective count**，配合 **Effective base weight**：对于加权的调查数据，指权重作用后实际有效的样本量。"

msgid "**Hide counts below** hides small counts, for example to protect respondents in a small group. A count below the number shows as `<5`."
msgstr "**Hide counts below** 隐藏较小的计数，例如为了保护小组中的受访者。低于该数值的计数显示为 `<5`。"

msgid "Categories and totals"
msgstr "类别和总计 {#categories-and-totals}"

msgid "**Categories, totals and subtotals** opens once a variable is in the table. Choose a variable under **Set the categories of this variable**, then:"
msgstr "表格中有变量后，即可打开 **Categories, totals and subtotals**。在 **Set the categories of this variable** 下选择一个变量，然后："

msgid "**Sort by** its value, its label, the count or the mean of a scale variable, ascending or descending."
msgstr "**Sort by** 按其值、标签、计数或某个尺度变量的均值，升序或降序排序。"

msgid "**Total, labeled**: a total for this variable only, with a label of your own, before or after its categories."
msgstr "**Total, labeled**：仅为此变量添加总计，使用您自己的标签，置于其类别之前或之后。"

msgid "**Show user-missing values as categories**, such as \"Don't know\"."
msgstr "**Show user-missing values as categories**，例如“Don't know”。"

msgid "**Subtotals**: **Add subtotal**, give it a label and choose the categories it sums, for example \"Top two\" for codes 4 and 5. **Hide the categories a subtotal sums** shows only the subtotal. **Show the categories outside the subtotals** keeps the rest."
msgstr "**Subtotals**：单击 **Add subtotal**，为其设置标签，并选择它要相加的类别，例如为代码 4 和 5 设置“Top two”。**Hide the categories a subtotal sums** 只显示小计。**Show the categories outside the subtotals** 保留其余类别。"

msgid "**Back to the defaults** clears the settings of that variable."
msgstr "**Back to the defaults** 清除该变量的设置。"

msgid "Significance tests"
msgstr "显著性检验 {#significance-tests}"

msgid "Tests need a variable in **Columns**."
msgstr "检验要求 **Columns** 中有变量。"

msgid "**Chi-square test of independence**: one test per pair of a row variable and a column variable, in a table of its own. It says whether the rows depend on the columns at all."
msgstr "**Chi-square test of independence**：每对行变量和列变量做一次检验，结果放在单独的表格中。它说明行是否与列有关。"

msgid "**Compare column proportions**: for each row, compares the column percentages of every pair of columns."
msgstr "**Compare column proportions**：对每一行，比较每对列的列百分比。"

msgid "**Compare column means**: for each variable under **Means of**, compares the means of every pair of columns."
msgstr "**Compare column means**：对 **Means of** 下的每个变量，比较每对列的均值。"

msgid "**Significance level** is 0.05 unless you change it. With many columns, many pairs are tested, so the significance is adjusted: **Bonferroni** (the default), **Benjamini-Hochberg**, or **No adjustment**."
msgstr "**Significance level** 为 0.05，除非您修改它。列较多时，要检验的列对也多，因此会调整显著性：**Bonferroni**（默认）、**Benjamini-Hochberg** 或 **No adjustment**。"

msgid "**Letters of the column comparisons** chooses where the results go:"
msgstr "**Letters of the column comparisons** 选择结果的放置位置："

msgid "**In a table of their own** (the default): each column gets a capital letter (A, B, C and so on). A second table repeats the rows, and each cell there shows the letters of the columns it is significantly higher than."
msgstr "**In a table of their own**（默认）：每列获得一个大写字母（A、B、C 等）。第二张表格重复各行，其中每个单元格显示它显著高于的那些列的字母。"

msgid "**In the main table, column keys**: each column gets a key (a, b, c and so on), and a cell shows the keys of the columns it is significantly higher than."
msgstr "**In the main table, column keys**：每列获得一个键（a、b、c 等），单元格显示它显著高于的那些列的键。"

msgid "**In the main table, shared letters (APA)**: columns that share a letter do not differ; columns with no letter in common do."
msgstr "**In the main table, shared letters (APA)**：有相同字母的列之间没有差异；没有共同字母的列之间有差异。"

msgid "A note under the table names the test, the level and the adjustment."
msgstr "表格下方的注释会写明检验方法、显著性水平和调整方法。"

msgid "Multiple response sets"
msgstr "多重响应集 {#multiple-response-sets}"

msgid "A multiple response set is one question with several answers allowed, stored as several variables. In the sample file, five yes or no variables record which channels a customer used, and the set `$channels` groups them."
msgstr "多重响应集是允许多选的一道问题，存储为多个变量。在示例文件中，五个是/否变量记录客户使用了哪些渠道，多重响应集 `$channels` 将它们组合在一起。"

msgid "Define a set with **Data > Define Multiple Response Sets...**. A dichotomy set counts one value (such as 1 for \"used\") across its variables. A category set gathers the codes of several variables (first answer, second answer and so on). Saving the data keeps the set in the file."
msgstr "使用 **Data > Define Multiple Response Sets...** 定义多重响应集。二分集在其变量中统计一个值（例如表示“使用过”的 1）。类别集汇集多个变量的代码（第一个答案、第二个答案等）。保存数据时，多重响应集会保存在文件中。"

msgid "Put the set in **Rows** or **Columns** like a variable. Each answer becomes a row or column."
msgstr "像变量一样将多重响应集放入 **Rows** 或 **Columns**。每个答案成为一行或一列。"

msgid "Percentages of a set are of the respondents, so a column can add up to more than 100%. A respondent who gave none of the answers is left out of the set."
msgstr "多重响应集的百分比以受访者为基数，因此一列加起来可能超过 100%。没有给出任何答案的受访者不计入该集。"

msgid "The tests work with sets too. A note under the table says how they take into account that one respondent can be in several categories."
msgstr "检验也适用于多重响应集。表格下方的注释会说明检验如何考虑一名受访者可以属于多个类别这一情况。"

msgid "Custom tables in Excel"
msgstr "Excel 中的自定义表格 {#custom-tables-in-excel}"

msgid "Export the output with **File > Export...** and **Excel workbook**. Each table keeps its header levels, labels and caption, the numbers stay numbers and the significance letters stay text. To put several tables on one sheet, choose **All tables on one sheet**. [Exporting all output](#exporting-all-output) describes the workbook."
msgstr "使用 **File > Export...** 和 **Excel workbook** 导出输出。每张表格都保留其表头层级、标签和说明文字，数字仍为数字，显著性字母仍为文本。要将多张表格放在一个工作表上，请选择 **All tables on one sheet**。[导出全部输出](#exporting-all-output)介绍了该工作簿。"

msgid "[Plugins](plugins.md) can color and comment the cells of custom tables in the window and in the workbook."
msgstr "[插件](plugins.md)可以在窗口和工作簿中为自定义表格的单元格着色和添加批注。"

msgid "Menus"
msgstr "菜单 {#menus}"

msgid "The menu bar is the same in every window: File, Edit, Data, Analyze, Graphs, Transform, Window and Help. The items of Data, Analyze, Graphs and Transform open a [dialog](#dialogs) that writes a command. Each command has a page of its own, linked in the tables below, with every option."
msgstr "每个窗口的菜单栏都相同：File、Edit、Data、Analyze、Graphs、Transform、Window 和 Help。Data、Analyze、Graphs 和 Transform 中的菜单项会打开一个写出命令的[对话框](#dialogs)。每条命令都有单独的页面，列出所有选项，链接见下表。"

msgid "**Open data...**, **Save data**, **Save data as...** and **Export data...** (see [Opening files](#opening-files) and [Exporting data](#exporting-data)). Save data saves the dataset of the data window it is chosen in, and the active dataset elsewhere."
msgstr "**Open data...**、**Save data**、**Save data as...** 和 **Export data...**（参见[打开文件](#opening-files)和[导出数据](#exporting-data)）。Save data 保存选择它时所在数据窗口的数据集，在其他窗口中则保存活动数据集。"

msgid "**Apply Data Dictionary...** copies labels, formats and missing values from another data file ([APPLY DICTIONARY](commands/apply-dictionary.md))."
msgstr "**Apply Data Dictionary...** 从另一个数据文件复制标签、格式和缺失值（[APPLY DICTIONARY](commands/apply-dictionary.md)）。"

msgid "**New > Syntax** and **New > Output**, **Open syntax...**, **Open output...** and **Recent files**."
msgstr "**New > Syntax** 和 **New > Output**、**Open syntax...**、**Open output...** 以及 **Recent files**。"

msgid "**Save syntax**, **Save syntax as...**, **Save output**, **Save output as...** and **Export...** (see [Saving output](#saving-output) and [Exporting all output](#exporting-all-output))."
msgstr "**Save syntax**、**Save syntax as...**、**Save output**、**Save output as...** 和 **Export...**（参见[保存输出](#saving-output)和[导出全部输出](#exporting-all-output)）。"

msgid "**Output Management > Start...** and **End...** route tables to files while syntax runs ([OMS](commands/oms.md), [OMSEND](commands/omsend.md))."
msgstr "**Output Management > Start...** 和 **End...** 在语法运行时将表格发送到文件（[OMS](commands/oms.md)、[OMSEND](commands/omsend.md)）。"

msgid "**Close** and **Exit**."
msgstr "**Close** 和 **Exit**。"

msgid "Edit"
msgstr "Edit"

msgid "**Undo** (Ctrl+Z) and **Redo** (Ctrl+Y or Ctrl+Shift+Z): see [Syntax is the only command layer](#syntax-is-the-only-command-layer). Each item names the run it would take back or do again."
msgstr "**Undo**（Ctrl+Z）和 **Redo**（Ctrl+Y 或 Ctrl+Shift+Z）：参见[语法是唯一的命令层](#syntax-is-the-only-command-layer)。每个菜单项都会写明它将撤销或重做的运行。"

msgid "**Settings...**: see [Settings](#settings)."
msgstr "**Settings...**：参见[设置](#settings)。"

msgid "Data"
msgstr "Data"

msgid "Menu path"
msgstr "菜单路径"

msgid "Command"
msgstr "命令"

