msgstr "Select Cases"

msgid "leaves cases out of analyses, or deletes them"
msgstr "将个案排除在分析之外，或删除它们"

msgid "[FILTER](commands/filter.md), [SELECT IF](commands/select-if.md)"
msgstr "[FILTER](commands/filter.md), [SELECT IF](commands/select-if.md)"

