msgid "Window"
msgstr "Window"

msgid "See [The Window menu](#the-window-menu)."
msgstr "参见 [Window 菜单](#the-window-menu)。"

msgid "Help"
msgstr "Help"

msgid "**Documentation** opens this documentation online."
msgstr "**Documentation** 在线打开本文档。"

msgid "**About Statscraft** shows the version, the license (MIT), links to the source code and the documentation, and the licenses of the color themes and fonts."
msgstr "**About Statscraft** 显示版本、许可证（MIT）、源代码和文档的链接，以及颜色主题和字体的许可证。"

msgid "**Check for updates**: see [Updates](#updates)."
msgstr "**Check for updates**：参见[更新](#updates)。"

msgid "Dialogs"
msgstr "对话框 {#dialogs}"

msgid "Every dialog that builds syntax ends the same way. That holds for the menus' dialogs and for the Variables tab's editors of type and format, value labels and missing values."
msgstr "每个构建语法的对话框都以相同的方式结束。这适用于菜单中的对话框，也适用于 Variables 标签页中类型和格式、值标签和缺失值的编辑器。"

msgid "The syntax it builds is shown, or why there is none yet."
msgstr "显示它构建的语法，或说明为何尚无语法。"

msgid "**OK** runs it, **Paste** puts it in the designated syntax window, **Cancel** closes the dialog. The menus' dialogs also have **Reset**."
msgstr "**OK** 运行语法，**Paste** 将其放入指定语法窗口，**Cancel** 关闭对话框。菜单中的对话框还有 **Reset**。"

msgid "OK and Paste stay off until the syntax is complete. Escape cancels."
msgstr "语法完整之前，OK 和 Paste 不可用。Escape 取消。"

msgid "Options left at their defaults add nothing to the syntax."
msgstr "保持默认值的选项不会向语法中添加任何内容。"

msgid "The status bar and the log"
msgstr "状态栏和日志 {#the-status-bar-and-the-log}"

msgid "The status bar:"
msgstr "状态栏："

msgid "shows what is running, and how many runs wait after it;"
msgstr "显示正在运行的内容，以及其后有多少次运行在等待；"

msgid "says how many warnings a run gave (the warnings appear under their command in the log); a click there shows the log, and from a data window it brings the designated output window to the front;"
msgstr "显示一次运行产生了多少条警告（警告显示在日志中对应命令的下方）；单击此处会显示日志，在数据窗口中单击则会将指定输出窗口切换到最前面；"

msgid "shows errors, whatever the tab;"
msgstr "无论在哪个标签页，都会显示错误；"

msgid "names, at its right, the split, filter and weight in force, such as `Split by region (layered)`, `Filter: filter_$` and `Weight: weight`. A click on one opens Split File, Select Cases or Weight Cases."
msgstr "在右侧列出生效的拆分、过滤和权重，例如 `Split by region (layered)`、`Filter: filter_$` 和 `Weight: weight`。单击其中之一会打开 Split File、Select Cases 或 Weight Cases。"

msgid "The log, in every syntax window and output window:"
msgstr "日志位于每个语法窗口和输出窗口中："

msgid "lists every command with what it changed;"
msgstr "列出每条命令及其所做的更改；"

msgid "has **Copy syntax**, which gives a script that repeats the session with `statscraft run`;"
msgstr "带有 **Copy syntax**，它给出一个用 `statscraft run` 重现该会话的脚本；"

msgid "is turned off by Edit > Settings > Grids and output > Log under Syntax and Output. A run with warnings shows the log even when it is off."
msgstr "可通过 Edit > Settings > Grids and output > Log under Syntax and Output 关闭。有警告的运行即使在日志关闭时也会显示日志。"

msgid "Data windows have no log, so the grid gets the whole height."
msgstr "数据窗口没有日志，因此网格占据整个高度。"

msgid "Syntax is the only command layer"
msgstr "语法是唯一的命令层 {#syntax-is-the-only-command-layer}"

msgid "Every change and every result in the window comes from syntax run by the engine, exactly as `statscraft run` runs it."
msgstr "窗口中的每项更改和每个结果都来自引擎运行的语法，与 `statscraft run` 的运行方式完全相同。"

msgid "Opening a file runs `GET FILE` and `DATASET NAME` with the next free name (DataSet1, DataSet2 and so on), so the data open before stays open in the session."
msgstr "打开文件会运行 `GET FILE` 和带下一个可用名称（DataSet1、DataSet2 等）的 `DATASET NAME`，因此之前打开的数据仍在会话中保持打开。"

msgid "Editing a cell runs `IF ($CASENUM = n) var = value.`"
msgstr "编辑单元格会运行 `IF ($CASENUM = n) var = value.`"

msgid "Editing a label runs `VARIABLE LABELS`, and so on."
msgstr "编辑标签会运行 `VARIABLE LABELS`，依此类推。"

msgid "Macros defined by one run (DEFINE, or INCLUDE of a macro library) stay defined for the later runs while the window is open, with the macro settings of SET."
msgstr "一次运行中定义的宏（DEFINE，或 INCLUDE 宏库）在窗口打开期间对之后的运行保持定义，SET 的宏设置也一样。"

msgid "Edit > Undo (Ctrl+Z outside a text field) puts back the dataset from before the last run that changed it, and the data file that was open then. Each use goes one run further back, up to 10 runs; for a very large file the window keeps fewer when the saved states would hold more than 1 GB of memory not shared with the current data, but always the newest. The log marks each run taken back as undone, and Copy syntax leaves it out."
msgstr "Edit > Undo（在文本字段之外按 Ctrl+Z）会恢复上一次更改数据集的运行之前的数据集，以及当时打开的数据文件。每用一次就再往前退一次运行，最多 10 次；对于非常大的文件，如果保存的状态会占用超过 1 GB 不与当前数据共享的内存，窗口会保留较少的状态，但总会保留最新的一个。日志会将每次被撤销的运行标记为 undone，Copy syntax 不会包含它。"

msgid "Edit > Redo (Ctrl+Y or Ctrl+Shift+Z outside a text field) does again the run that the last undo took back, one run per use, and the log no longer marks it as undone. A run that changes the data after an undo ends the redo. The output stays as it is in both directions. The command line and an agent do the same with `statscraft undo`, `statscraft redo` and the MCP tools `undo` and `redo`."
msgstr "Edit > Redo（在文本字段之外按 Ctrl+Y 或 Ctrl+Shift+Z）会重新执行上一次撤销的运行，每用一次重做一次运行，日志也不再将其标记为 undone。撤销后再运行一次更改数据的命令会结束重做。在这两个方向上，输出都保持不变。命令行和智能体可以用 `statscraft undo`、`statscraft redo` 以及 MCP 工具 `undo` 和 `redo` 做同样的事。"

msgid "The window stays responsive while a run goes on. The status bar shows what is running."
msgstr "运行进行时，窗口仍保持响应。状态栏会显示正在运行的内容。"

msgid "One run goes at a time. Runs from every window and requests from the command line wait their turn, in the order they came."
msgstr "一次只进行一次运行。来自所有窗口的运行和来自命令行的请求按到达顺序排队等待。"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置 {#settings}"

msgid "Edit > Settings holds every setting of the window in one dialog, with its sections in a list on the left. A change applies at once and is saved. **Close** or Escape closes the dialog."
msgstr "Edit > Settings 在一个对话框中包含窗口的全部设置，各部分列在左侧的列表中。更改会立即生效并保存。**Close** 或 Escape 关闭对话框。"

msgid "**Editor**"
msgstr "**Editor**"

msgid "**Syntax colors**: the colors and background of the syntax editor. Statscraft Light (the default) and Statscraft Dark are in the Statscraft colors. The ready-made editor themes are Catppuccin Latte and Mocha, One Dark, Solarized Light and Dark, and GitHub Light and Dark."
msgstr "**Syntax colors**：语法编辑器的颜色和背景。Statscraft Light（默认）和 Statscraft Dark 采用 Statscraft 的配色。现成的编辑器主题有 Catppuccin Latte 和 Mocha、One Dark、Solarized Light 和 Dark，以及 GitHub Light 和 Dark。"

msgid "**Wrap long lines** (on by default) wraps them at the window edge."
msgstr "**Wrap long lines**（默认开启）会在窗口边缘换行。"

msgid "**Grids and output**"
msgstr "**Grids and output**"

msgid "**Paper of the grids and the output**: the Data and Variables grids and the output tables. **Always light** (the default) keeps them dark text on a light sheet, as a spreadsheet or a document page does, while menus, panels and dialogs follow the system's dark or light theme. **Follow the system theme** draws them in the system theme too."
msgstr "**Paper of the grids and the output**：指 Data 和 Variables 网格以及输出表格。**Always light**（默认）让它们始终是浅色底上的深色文字，就像电子表格或文档页面一样，而菜单、面板和对话框则跟随系统的深色或浅色主题。**Follow the system theme** 让它们也采用系统主题。"

msgid "**Log under Syntax and Output** (on by default)."
msgstr "**Log under Syntax and Output**（默认开启）。"

msgid "**Show in the output**: Command headings (off by default), Titles, Tables, Notes under tables and Charts (on by default). See [What the output shows](#what-the-output-shows)."
msgstr "**Show in the output**：Command headings（默认关闭）、Titles、Tables、Notes under tables 和 Charts（默认开启）。参见[输出显示的内容](#what-the-output-shows)。"

msgid "**Variables in tables** (Labels, Names, or Names and labels) and **Values in tables** (Labels, Values, or Values and labels). These belong to the session, not the window. A choice runs `SET TVARS` or `SET TNUMBERS` like any other command, shows in the log and stays for the later runs. A SET in syntax changes the dialog too. The window remembers the choice and sets it again when it starts, so you set it once."
msgstr "**Variables in tables**（Labels、Names 或 Names and labels）和 **Values in tables**（Labels、Values 或 Values and labels）。这些设置属于会话，而不是窗口。选择后会像其他命令一样运行 `SET TVARS` 或 `SET TNUMBERS`，显示在日志中，并对之后的运行保持有效。语法中的 SET 也会改变对话框中的设置。窗口会记住您的选择，并在启动时重新设置，因此您只需设置一次。"

msgid "**Output for multiply imputed data**: Original data, Each imputation, Pooled and Diagnostics, for procedures run on data split by `Imputation_`. A change runs `SET MIOUTPUT=[...]`; at least one part stays checked. Like the table labels it belongs to the session, and the window sets it again when it starts."
msgstr "**Output for multiply imputed data**：Original data、Each imputation、Pooled 和 Diagnostics，适用于在按 `Imputation_` 拆分的数据上运行的过程。更改时会运行 `SET MIOUTPUT=[...]`；至少有一项保持勾选。与表格标签设置一样，它属于会话，窗口启动时会重新设置它。"

msgid "**Updates**"
msgstr "**Updates**"

msgid "**Check for updates automatically**: see [Updates](#updates)."
msgstr "**Check for updates automatically**：参见[更新](#updates)。"

msgid "**AI agents**"
msgstr "**AI agents**"

msgid "Adds the Statscraft MCP server to the AI apps on this computer, or takes it out again, with a click per app, and says what to restart. For Claude Desktop, **Install extension** downloads and opens the Statscraft extension of this version. **Check** shows each app's settings files and whether the entry is in them now. See [Connect your AI agent](connect.md#from-the-window-edit--settings--ai-agents)."
msgstr "一键将 Statscraft MCP 服务器添加到本机的各个 AI 应用中，或再次移除，每个应用单击一次，并告诉您需要重启什么。对于 Claude Desktop，**Install extension** 会下载并打开此版本的 Statscraft 扩展。**Check** 显示每个应用的设置文件，以及其中当前是否有该条目。参见[连接您的 AI 智能体](connect.md#from-the-window-edit--settings--ai-agents)。"

msgid "**Plugins**"
msgstr "**Plugins**"

msgid "The installed plugins, programs that color and comment the cells of custom tables, in the order they run. See [Plugins](plugins.md)."
msgstr "已安装的插件，即为自定义表格的单元格着色和添加批注的程序，按运行顺序排列。参见[插件](plugins.md)。"

msgid "What the window remembers"
msgstr "窗口记住的内容 {#what-the-window-remembers}"

msgid "Between sessions the window remembers the size and position of each kind of window, the folder of the last file dialog, the ten recent files (File > Recent files), the column widths of the Variables tab and every choice in Edit > Settings. A new window opens where the last one of its kind was, a little lower and to the right of those already open."
msgstr "在不同会话之间，窗口会记住每类窗口的大小和位置、上次文件对话框的文件夹、最近的十个文件（File > Recent files）、Variables 标签页的列宽，以及 Edit > Settings 中的每项选择。新窗口会在同类窗口上次所在的位置打开，并相对已打开的窗口稍向右下方偏移。"

msgid "Closing and unsaved work"
msgstr "关闭与未保存的工作 {#closing-and-unsaved-work}"

msgid "The program ends when the last window closes, or with File > Exit, the Windows installer of an update, or Restart now. It first checks for unsaved work in every window."
msgstr "最后一个窗口关闭时程序退出，也可以通过 File > Exit、Windows 更新安装程序或 Restart now 退出。退出前会先检查每个窗口中是否有未保存的工作。"

msgid "Unsaved work is a dataset changed since it was last opened or saved, syntax whose text differs from its file, new syntax that is not empty, and an output document with tables added or deleted since it was opened or saved."
msgstr "未保存的工作包括：自上次打开或保存以来有更改的数据集、文本与其文件不同的语法、非空的新语法，以及自打开或保存以来添加或删除了表格的输出文档。"

msgid "Data counts as saved after a run that ends with `GET`, `GET DATA` or `SAVE`, whether from a menu, a syntax window or the command line."
msgstr "以 `GET`、`GET DATA` 或 `SAVE` 结束的运行之后，数据视为已保存，无论运行来自菜单、语法窗口还是命令行。"

msgid "With nothing unsaved, the program ends at once."
msgstr "如果没有未保存的内容，程序会立即退出。"

msgid "Otherwise one question lists what is unsaved, with **Save**, **Don't save** and **Cancel**."
msgstr "否则会弹出一个询问，列出未保存的内容，提供 **Save**、**Don't save** 和 **Cancel**。"

msgid "Save saves the syntax of every window, every changed output document and every changed dataset, each to its file, or with a file dialog when there is none yet. The program ends once all are written. A canceled file dialog or a failed save keeps it open."
msgstr "Save 会保存每个窗口的语法、每个有更改的输出文档和每个有更改的数据集，各自保存到其文件，尚无文件时则通过文件对话框保存。全部写入后程序退出。取消文件对话框或保存失败时，程序保持打开。"

msgid "Cancel, Escape or a click beside the question keeps it open."
msgstr "Cancel、Escape 或在询问框旁边单击，程序保持打开。"

msgid "Closing one window while others stay open asks only about its own work: the syntax of a syntax window, the data of a data window, the output of an output window."
msgstr "在其他窗口仍打开时关闭一个窗口，只会询问该窗口自己的工作：语法窗口的语法、数据窗口的数据、输出窗口的输出。"

msgid "When a new version is out, a bar under the menu says so, with a link to the release notes, **Update now** and **Later**. **Help > Check for updates** checks at once. [Install and update](install.md#updates) says what Update now does for each kind of installation, and how to turn the daily check off."
msgstr "有新版本发布时，菜单下方会出现一个提示栏，带有发布说明的链接、**Update now** 和 **Later**。**Help > Check for updates** 会立即检查。[安装和更新](install.md#updates)介绍了 Update now 对每种安装方式的作用，以及如何关闭每日检查。"

msgid "Working with an AI agent"
msgstr "与 AI 智能体协作 {#working-with-an-ai-agent}"

msgid "While the window is open, the command line and AI agents can work in it: their syntax runs here, and you see every table and command appear. See [the live window session](command-line.md#the-live-window-session), and [Statscraft for AI agents](ai-agents.md#working-in-the-open-window) for how an agent should use it."
msgstr "窗口打开时，命令行和 AI 智能体可以在其中工作：它们的语法在这里运行，您会看到每张表格和每条命令出现。参见[实时窗口会话](command-line.md#the-live-window-session)，以及 [Statscraft 与 AI 智能体](ai-agents.md#working-in-the-open-window)中关于智能体应如何使用它的说明。"

msgid "Fonts"
msgstr "字体 {#fonts}"

msgid "The window brings its own fonts, both under the SIL Open Font License:"
msgstr "窗口自带字体，两者都采用 SIL Open Font License："

msgid "Schibsted Grotesk for menus, dialogs, grids and output, with digits of equal width so numbers line up in columns;"
msgstr "Schibsted Grotesk 用于菜单、对话框、网格和输出，其数字等宽，因此数字在列中对齐；"

msgid "JetBrains Mono for syntax."
msgstr "JetBrains Mono 用于语法。"

msgid "Characters they lack, such as Cyrillic in Schibsted Grotesk, come from system fonts: Segoe UI and Consolas on Windows, Arial and Courier New on macOS, DejaVu, Noto or Liberation on Linux. Set `STATSCRAFT_FONT` or `STATSCRAFT_MONO_FONT` to a .ttf file to use another font first."
msgstr "它们缺少的字符（例如 Schibsted Grotesk 中的西里尔字母）来自系统字体：Windows 上为 Segoe UI 和 Consolas，macOS 上为 Arial 和 Courier New，Linux 上为 DejaVu、Noto 或 Liberation。将 `STATSCRAFT_FONT` 或 `STATSCRAFT_MONO_FONT` 设为一个 .ttf 文件，即可优先使用另一种字体。"

msgid "`statscraft --version` prints the version, and `statscraft <subcommand> --help` lists the flags of a subcommand. The examples use the [sample file](getting-started.md#open-the-sample-file) `survey.sav` or a data file of your own, and `job.sps` stands for a syntax file of your own. `plan` and `db` have a page of their own: [Databases](databases.md)."
msgstr "`statscraft --version` 打印版本号，`statscraft <subcommand> --help` 列出某个子命令的选项。示例使用[示例文件](getting-started.md#open-the-sample-file) `survey.sav` 或您自己的数据文件，`job.sps` 代表您自己的语法文件。`plan` 和 `db` 有单独的页面：[数据库](databases.md)。"

msgid "describe"
msgstr "describe"

msgid "Flag"
msgstr "选项"

msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

msgid "`FILE`"
msgstr "`FILE`"

msgid "a .sav or .zsav file"
msgstr ".sav 或 .zsav 文件"

msgid "`-s`, `--session NAME`"
msgstr "`-s`, `--session NAME`"

msgid "describe a session instead: its dataset and the state it keeps; `gui` is the open window"
msgstr "改为描述一个会话：它的数据集和它保存的状态；`gui` 表示打开的窗口"

msgid "`--json`"
msgstr "`--json`"

msgid "the full dictionary as JSON instead of one line per variable, with the data file attributes under `attributes` (each name with its list of values) when there are any"
msgstr "以 JSON 输出完整的字典，而不是每个变量一行；如果数据文件有属性，则放在 `attributes` 下（每个名称及其值列表）"

msgid "Give either a file or a session. The text form prints `cases, variables` and then, per variable, name, format, measurement level, valid count and label, separated by tabs. For a session it goes on with what the session keeps besides the data, one line each when there is something: `settings:`, `PRESERVE levels:`, `directory:` (where relative file names start: the folder of the last CD, else, for the window, its last caller's folder), `active dataset:`, `datasets:`, `macros:`, `output documents:`, `designated output:`. In JSON these are the object `session` (see [Sessions](#sessions-and-line-ranges))."
msgstr "请给出文件或会话之一。文本形式先打印 `cases, variables`，然后每个变量一行，列出名称、格式、测量级别、有效计数和标签，以制表符分隔。对于会话，接着列出会话在数据之外保存的内容，有内容时每项一行：`settings:`、`PRESERVE levels:`、`directory:`（相对文件名的起点：最后一次 CD 的文件夹，否则对窗口而言是其最近一个调用方的文件夹）、`active dataset:`、`datasets:`、`macros:`、`output documents:`、`designated output:`。在 JSON 中，这些内容位于对象 `session` 中（参见[会话](#sessions-and-line-ranges)）。"

msgid "The datasets and output documents in `session`:"
msgstr "`session` 中的数据集和输出文档："

msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

msgid "What"
msgstr "内容"

msgid "`active_dataset`"
msgstr "`active_dataset`"

msgid "the name of the active dataset, the one every command works on; absent when it has no name"
msgstr "活动数据集的名称，即所有命令所作用的数据集；没有名称时不出现"

msgid "`datasets`"
msgstr "`datasets`"

msgid "every named dataset, the active one first: `name`, and `cases` and `variables` when it holds data (a name only declared with DATASET DECLARE has none)"
msgstr "每个命名数据集，活动数据集在前：`name`，以及有数据时的 `cases` 和 `variables`（仅用 DATASET DECLARE 声明的名称没有这两项）"

msgid "`output_documents`"
msgstr "`output_documents`"

msgid "every open output document in the order it was opened: `name` and the number of `tables`"
msgstr "每个打开的输出文档，按打开顺序排列：`name` 和表格数 `tables`"

msgid "`designated_output`"
msgstr "`designated_output`"

msgid "the document the next tables go to (OUTPUT NEW and OUTPUT ACTIVATE set it); absent when none is open, and the next table then starts `Document1`"
msgstr "下一批表格将进入的文档（由 OUTPUT NEW 和 OUTPUT ACTIVATE 设定）；没有打开的文档时不出现，此时下一个表格会新建 `Document1`"

msgid "\"session\""
msgstr "\"session\""

msgid "\"active_dataset\""
msgstr "\"active_dataset\""

msgid "\"DataSet2\""
msgstr "\"DataSet2\""

msgid "\"datasets\""
msgstr "\"datasets\""

msgid "\"name\""
msgstr "\"name\""

msgid "\"cases\""
msgstr "\"cases\""

msgid "\"variables\""
msgstr "\"variables\""

msgid "\"DataSet1\""
msgstr "\"DataSet1\""

msgid "\"output_documents\""
msgstr "\"output_documents\""

msgid "\"Document1\""
msgstr "\"Document1\""

msgid "\"tables\""
msgstr "\"tables\""

msgid "\"designated_output\""
msgstr "\"designated_output\""

msgid "The open window (`-s gui`) lists what the window holds, the same way. A file session keeps its output documents between runs the same way, so there the list shows what earlier runs collected."
msgstr "打开的窗口（`-s gui`）以同样的方式列出窗口中的内容。文件会话同样会在多次运行之间保留其输出文档，因此列表显示的是之前各次运行收集的内容。"

msgid "run"
msgstr "run"

msgid "a syntax file; `-` reads the syntax from standard input"
msgstr "语法文件；`-` 表示从标准输入读取语法"

msgid "`-e`, `--execute TEXT`"
msgstr "`-e`, `--execute TEXT`"

msgid "syntax given on the command line instead of a file"
msgstr "在命令行上直接给出的语法，代替文件"

msgid "load the dataset from this session before the run and save it after; `gui` is the open window"
msgstr "运行前从该会话加载数据集，运行后保存；`gui` 表示打开的窗口"

msgid "`--lines FIRST-LAST`"
msgstr "`--lines FIRST-LAST`"

msgid "run only the commands inside these lines (1-based, inclusive), for example `40-55`"
msgstr "只运行这些行内的命令（从 1 开始计数，包含两端），例如 `40-55`"

msgid "print the result as JSON instead of Markdown"
msgstr "以 JSON 而不是 Markdown 打印结果"

msgid "`--vega-lite`"
msgstr "`--vega-lite`"

msgid "also give every chart as a Vega-Lite specification (see [Charts](#charts))"
msgstr "同时将每个图表输出为 Vega-Lite 规范（参见[图表](#charts)）"

msgid "`--encoding NAME`"
msgstr "`--encoding NAME`"

msgid "encoding of the syntax file or standard input, such as `windows-1257` or `1252`; without it a file that is valid UTF-8 (with or without a byte order mark) is read as UTF-8 and any other file in the system's legacy code page"
msgstr "语法文件或标准输入的编码，例如 `windows-1257` 或 `1252`；不加此选项时，有效的 UTF-8 文件（带或不带字节顺序标记）按 UTF-8 读取，其他文件按系统的旧代码页读取"

msgid "`--xlsx FILE`"
msgstr "`--xlsx FILE`"

msgid "also write every table and chart of the run to an Excel workbook, one sheet per table"
msgstr "同时将本次运行的每个表格和图表写入 Excel 工作簿，每个表格一个工作表"

msgid "`--xlsx-one-sheet`"
msgstr "`--xlsx-one-sheet`"

msgid "with `--xlsx`, put all tables on one sheet, one below the other"
msgstr "与 `--xlsx` 一起使用时，将所有表格放在同一个工作表上，上下排列"

msgid "`--xlsx-no-titles`"
msgstr "`--xlsx-no-titles`"

msgid "with `--xlsx`, leave out the title row above each table and chart; variable labels, captions and what plugins add stay"
msgstr "与 `--xlsx` 一起使用时，省略每个表格和图表上方的标题行；变量标签、说明文字和插件添加的内容保留"

msgid "`--plugin PROGRAM`"
msgstr "`--plugin PROGRAM`"

msgid "with `--xlsx`, let a plugin color, comment and lay out the custom tables (see [plugins](plugins.md)); its settings come from the active data's attributes, with `-s gui` those of the window's active data. Give it more than once for several plugins: they run in that order and their answers merge, the later one winning where two style the same thing"
msgstr "与 `--xlsx` 一起使用时，让插件为自定义表格着色、添加批注和排版（参见[插件](plugins.md)）；其设置来自活动数据的属性，使用 `-s gui` 时来自窗口活动数据的属性。多个插件可多次给出此选项：它们按给出顺序运行，结果合并，两个插件设置同一样式时以后者为准"

msgid "`--plugin-template FILE`"
msgstr "`--plugin-template FILE`"

msgid "with `--plugin`, lay a design template file, made by Export in the window's Plugin Settings ([plugins](plugins.md)), over the data's attributes for this run, as an active template does in the window. One file per plugin, each holding exactly one template of one of the `--plugin` programs"
msgstr "与 `--plugin` 一起使用时，在本次运行中将一个设计模板文件叠加在数据属性之上，效果与窗口中启用的模板相同。模板文件由窗口 Plugin Settings 中的 Export 生成（[插件](plugins.md)）。每个插件一个文件，每个文件只包含某个 `--plugin` 程序的一个模板"

msgid "`--charts DIR`"
msgstr "`--charts DIR`"

msgid "also write every chart of the run as a picture into this folder (see [Chart pictures](#chart-pictures))"
msgstr "同时将本次运行的每个图表作为图片写入该文件夹（参见[图表图片](#chart-pictures)）"

msgid "`--chart-format svg\\|png`"
msgstr "`--chart-format svg\\|png`"

msgid "with `--charts`, the picture format; default `svg`"
msgstr "与 `--charts` 一起使用时的图片格式；默认为 `svg`"

msgid "Without `--json`, every table is printed as a Markdown table under a `###` title, every chart as a table of its numbers whose caption names the kind of chart, warnings as `warning: line N: COMMAND: message` (the command named once: a message that names it itself, also with a subcommand as in `FACTOR /SAVE:`, keeps that name, and the name of a split group comes after it), then a summary: the dataset loaded, variables added, changed and removed, the case count when it changed, and `ran N command(s)`, with `, session saved` when the session was written."
msgstr "不加 `--json` 时，每个表格以 Markdown 表格打印在 `###` 标题下，每个图表打印为一个数值表，其说明文字指明图表类型，警告打印为 `warning: line N: COMMAND: message`（命令名只出现一次：本身已提及命令名的消息保留该名称，带子命令时也是如此，如 `FACTOR /SAVE:`，拆分组的名称跟在其后），最后是摘要：加载的数据集，新增、更改和删除的变量，个案数发生变化时的个案数，以及 `ran N command(s)`，会话已写入时再加上 `, session saved`。"

msgid ""
"```\n"
"statscraft run job.sps\n"
"statscraft run -s demo -e \"FREQUENCIES VARIABLES=gender.\"\n"
"echo \"DESCRIPTIVES VARIABLES=age monthly_spend.\" | statscraft run -s demo -\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"statscraft run job.sps\n"
"statscraft run -s demo -e \"FREQUENCIES VARIABLES=gender.\"\n"
"echo \"DESCRIPTIVES VARIABLES=age monthly_spend.\" | statscraft run -s demo -\n"
"```"

msgid "A run is all or nothing. When any command fails, nothing is saved: not the session, not the workbook. Files that `SAVE` wrote before the failing command stay on disk."
msgstr "一次运行要么全部成功，要么全部不生效。任何命令失败时都不保存任何内容：会话不保存，工作簿也不保存。失败命令之前由 `SAVE` 写入的文件仍留在磁盘上。"

msgid "check"
msgstr "check"

msgid "The same flags as `run`, without `--xlsx`. `check` runs the commands on a copy of the session's dataset and skips every file write, so it finds both syntax errors and errors that depend on the data (an unknown variable, a string where a number is needed). The session and the disk stay unchanged. The summary says `checked N command(s)`, and in JSON `saved` is always false."
msgstr "选项与 `run` 相同，但没有 `--xlsx`。`check` 在会话数据集的副本上运行命令，并跳过所有文件写入，因此既能发现语法错误，也能发现依赖数据的错误（未知变量，需要数值的地方给了字符串）。会话和磁盘保持不变。摘要显示 `checked N command(s)`，JSON 中的 `saved` 始终为 false。"

msgid ""
"```\n"
"statscraft check -s demo -e \"COMPUTE age10 = age / 10.\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"statscraft check -s demo -e \"COMPUTE age10 = age / 10.\"\n"
"```"

msgid "Every syntax error of the source is reported at once, one per bad command. Errors found while running stop at the first failing command."
msgstr "源代码中的所有语法错误一次性报告，每个有错的命令一条。运行时发现的错误在第一个失败的命令处停止。"

msgid "help"
msgstr "help"

msgid "An unknown name is an error. The same text, one page per command, is in [commands](commands/index.md)."
msgstr "未知的名称会报错。相同的文本按每个命令一页收录在[命令](commands/index.md)中。"

msgid "Sessions and line ranges"
msgstr "会话和行范围 {#sessions-and-line-ranges}"

msgid "A session keeps your work between runs, as the window does while it is open. Give it a name with `-s`, and each run builds on the one before:"
msgstr "会话在多次运行之间保留您的工作，就像窗口打开期间那样。用 `-s` 给它一个名称，每次运行都在上一次的基础上继续："

msgid ""
"```\n"
"statscraft run -s demo -e \"GET FILE='survey.sav'.\"\n"
"statscraft run -s demo -e \"RECODE age (LOWEST THRU 39 = 1) (40 THRU HIGHEST = 2) INTO young_old.\"\n"
"statscraft run -s demo -e \"FREQUENCIES VARIABLES=young_old.\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"statscraft run -s demo -e \"GET FILE='survey.sav'.\"\n"
"statscraft run -s demo -e \"RECODE age (LOWEST THRU 39 = 1) (40 THRU HIGHEST = 2) INTO young_old.\"\n"
"statscraft run -s demo -e \"FREQUENCIES VARIABLES=young_old.\"\n"
"```"

msgid "A session keeps:"
msgstr "会话保存："

msgid "the active dataset with its weight, split and filter, and every named dataset;"
msgstr "活动数据集及其权重、拆分和过滤，以及每个命名数据集；"

msgid "the macros (DEFINE, or a macro library brought in with INCLUDE) and the macro settings of SET;"
msgstr "宏（DEFINE，或用 INCLUDE 引入的宏库）以及 SET 的宏设置；"

msgid "file handles, SET values, PRESERVE levels and the folder of the last CD;"
msgstr "文件句柄、SET 的值、PRESERVE 层级和最后一次 CD 的文件夹；"

msgid "where the random numbers stand, so the next run goes on where the last one stopped;"
msgstr "随机数的当前位置，因此下一次运行从上一次停止的地方继续；"

msgid "the output documents and their tables;"
msgstr "输出文档及其表格；"

msgid "the syntax of every run that worked, in the file `syntax.sps`: a record of how the session got where it is. Run it from the top on the original data to repeat the work."
msgstr "每次成功运行的语法，保存在文件 `syntax.sps` 中：记录会话如何走到当前状态。在原始数据上从头运行它即可重复这些工作。"

msgid "TEMPORARY, N OF CASES, scratch variables and VECTOR end with the run that gives them. An open DO IF or LOOP fails the run."
msgstr "TEMPORARY、N OF CASES、临时变量和 VECTOR 在给出它们的那次运行结束时失效。未闭合的 DO IF 或 LOOP 会使运行失败。"

msgid "The first run of a new session starts without data, so it usually begins with `GET FILE`."
msgstr "新会话的第一次运行没有数据，因此通常以 `GET FILE` 开始。"

msgid "A run is all or nothing: when one command fails, the session stays as it was. Fix the line and run it again."
msgstr "一次运行要么全部成功，要么全部不生效：一个命令失败时，会话保持原样。修正该行后再运行一次。"

msgid "`describe -s NAME` shows the active dataset and what the session keeps (see [describe](#describe))."
msgstr "`describe -s NAME` 显示活动数据集以及会话保存的内容（参见 [describe](#describe)）。"

msgid "Sessions live in `.statscraft/sessions/<name>/` under the current folder. Delete that folder to start over."
msgstr "会话保存在当前文件夹下的 `.statscraft/sessions/<name>/` 中。删除该文件夹即可重新开始。"

msgid "Tables pile up in the session's output from run to run. `OUTPUT CLOSE ALL.` empties it. `--xlsx` writes only the tables of its own run; to write the tables of several runs at once, end with `OUTPUT EXPORT` (see [Excel export](#excel-export))."
msgstr "表格在会话的输出中逐次运行累积。`OUTPUT CLOSE ALL.` 会清空输出。`--xlsx` 只写入本次运行的表格；要一次写入多次运行的表格，请以 `OUTPUT EXPORT` 结束（参见 [Excel 导出](#excel-export)）。"

msgid "`--lines` runs a part of a file, so you can work through a long script piece by piece:"
msgstr "`--lines` 运行文件的一部分，因此您可以逐段处理一个长脚本："

msgid "The range must cover whole commands. Blank lines and comments inside it are fine, and a syntax error outside it does not stop it. A range that cuts through a command fails:"
msgstr "范围必须覆盖完整的命令。范围内的空行和注释没有问题，范围外的语法错误也不会使其停止。截断某个命令的范围会失败："

msgid "Line numbers in the output always refer to the whole file, not to the range."
msgstr "输出中的行号始终指整个文件中的行，而不是范围内的行。"

msgid "Exit codes"
msgstr "退出代码 {#exit-codes}"

msgid "Code"
msgstr "代码"

msgid "When"
msgstr "情形"

msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

msgid "success, including runs with warnings"
msgstr "成功，包括带有警告的运行"

msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

msgid "the syntax, the run, a file or a session failed; also `plan` and `db` when they print `\"ok\":false`"
msgstr "语法、运行、文件或会话失败；`plan` 和 `db` 打印 `\"ok\":false` 时也是如此"

msgid "2"
msgstr "2"

msgid "the command line itself is wrong: an unknown flag, a missing value, flags that conflict"
msgstr "命令行本身有误：未知选项、缺少值、选项相互冲突"

msgid "10"
msgstr "10"

msgid "`update --check`: a newer release is published"
msgstr "`update --check`：已发布更新的版本"

msgid "update"
msgstr "update"

msgid "The latest release is the newest published release on the GitHub repository; drafts and prereleases do not count. `update --check` prints the running and the latest version and exits with 0 when this copy is up to date (also when no release is published yet) and with 10 when a newer one exists, so a script can ask `statscraft update --check || ...`. With `--json` it prints one line:"
msgstr "最新版本是 GitHub 仓库上最新发布的版本；草稿和预发布版本不算在内。`update --check` 打印当前运行的版本和最新版本，本副本已是最新时（尚未发布任何版本时也是如此）以 0 退出，有更新的版本时以 10 退出，因此脚本可以使用 `statscraft update --check || ...`。加上 `--json` 时，它打印一行："

msgid ""
"```\n"
"{\"current\":\"0.1.0\",\"latest\":\"0.2.0\",\"update\":true,\"notes\":\"https://github.com/statscrafthq/statscraft/releases/tag/v0.2.0\"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"{\"current\":\"0.1.0\",\"latest\":\"0.2.0\",\"update\":true,\"notes\":\"https://github.com/statscrafthq/statscraft/releases/tag/v0.2.0\"}\n"
"```"

msgid "`latest` is null when no release is published yet, and `notes` is the release page when there is an update."
msgstr "尚未发布任何版本时 `latest` 为 null；有更新时 `notes` 为该版本的发布页面。"

msgid "`update --check --plugin PROGRAM` asks a [plugin](plugins.md#updates) instead, as the window's Check in Edit > Settings > Plugins does: it prints the plugin's name, its version and, when the plugin offers a newer one, that version and its notes; exit code 10 when there is an update, else 0. With `--json`: `{\"plugin\":\"Acme Tables\",\"current\":\"0.2.1\",\"latest\":\"0.2.2\",\"update\":true,\"notes\":\"Faster tables\"}`. It never installs the plugin: `--plugin` only goes with `--check`, and Update in the window's plugin settings installs it. A plugin that does not offer updates, or cannot check, is an error with its reason."
msgstr "`update --check --plugin PROGRAM` 改为查询一个[插件](plugins.md#updates)，与窗口中 Edit > Settings > Plugins 里的 Check 相同：它打印插件的名称、版本，插件提供更新版本时还打印该版本及其说明；有更新时退出代码为 10，否则为 0。加上 `--json` 时：`{\"plugin\":\"Acme Tables\",\"current\":\"0.2.1\",\"latest\":\"0.2.2\",\"update\":true,\"notes\":\"Faster tables\"}`。它从不安装插件：`--plugin` 只能与 `--check` 一起使用，安装插件请使用窗口插件设置中的 Update。不提供更新或无法检查的插件会报错并说明原因。"

msgid "`update` does what the window's **Update now** does, for the way this copy was installed: see [Updates](install.md#updates). On Debian and Ubuntu it only downloads the package and prints the command that installs it. A copy built from source, or the command line from the macOS package, is not updated: the command says how to update it instead, with exit code 1."
msgstr "`update` 的作用与窗口中的 **Update now** 相同，具体取决于本副本的安装方式：参见[更新](install.md#updates)。在 Debian 和 Ubuntu 上，它只下载软件包，并打印安装它的命令。从源代码构建的副本，或来自 macOS 软件包的命令行，不会被更新：该命令会说明如何更新，退出代码为 1。"

msgid "Every download is checked against the checksums published with the release before anything is run or replaced; on a mismatch nothing changes. The check sends nothing about you or your data. Errors print as for the other subcommands, exit code 1."
msgstr "每个下载在运行或替换任何内容之前，都会与随版本发布的校验和进行核对；不匹配时不做任何更改。检查不会发送任何关于您或您的数据的信息。错误的打印方式与其他子命令相同，退出代码为 1。"

msgid "connect"
msgstr "connect"

msgid "`statscraft connect` adds an entry that starts `statscraft mcp` to every AI agent installed on this computer and says what to restart. `statscraft connect AGENT` connects one, `--list` only shows the state, `--remove [AGENT]` takes the entry out again, and `--json` prints the result as JSON. [Connect your AI agent](connect.md) lists the agents, the files it changes and how to make the same change by hand."
msgstr "`statscraft connect` 为本机安装的每个 AI 智能体添加一个启动 `statscraft mcp` 的条目，并告诉您需要重启什么。`statscraft connect AGENT` 只连接一个智能体，`--list` 只显示状态，`--remove [AGENT]` 再次删除该条目，`--json` 以 JSON 打印结果。[连接您的 AI 智能体](connect.md)列出了支持的智能体、它所修改的文件以及如何手动进行同样的修改。"

msgid "Excel export"
msgstr "Excel 导出 {#excel-export}"

msgid ""
"```\n"
"statscraft run job.sps --xlsx tables.xlsx\n"
"statscraft run job.sps --xlsx all.xlsx --xlsx-one-sheet\n"
"statscraft run -s gui -e \"FREQUENCIES VARIABLES=region.\" --xlsx region.xlsx\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"statscraft run job.sps --xlsx tables.xlsx\n"
"statscraft run job.sps --xlsx all.xlsx --xlsx-one-sheet\n"
"statscraft run -s gui -e \"FREQUENCIES VARIABLES=region.\" --xlsx region.xlsx\n"
"```"

msgid "Every table and chart of the run goes into the workbook, one sheet per table, named after its title. `--xlsx-one-sheet` puts them all on one sheet `Tables`, one below the other. `--xlsx-no-titles` leaves out the title row above each table and chart, for example to stack custom tables on one sheet. The workbook looks as the window's export makes it: see [Exporting all output](window.md#exporting-all-output). The text output on the terminal is the same as without `--xlsx`."
msgstr "本次运行的每个表格和图表都写入工作簿，每个表格一个工作表，以其标题命名。`--xlsx-one-sheet` 将它们全部放在一个名为 `Tables` 的工作表上，上下排列。`--xlsx-no-titles` 省略每个表格和图表上方的标题行，例如用于在一个工作表上堆叠自定义表格。工作簿的样式与窗口导出的相同：参见[导出全部输出](window.md#exporting-all-output)。终端上的文本输出与不加 `--xlsx` 时相同。"

msgid "A workbook that cannot be written fails the run, and the session is then not saved."
msgstr "无法写入的工作簿会使运行失败，此时会话不会保存。"

msgid "To collect the tables of several runs in one workbook, end the last run with OUTPUT EXPORT, which writes the whole output document of the session: `OUTPUT EXPORT /XLSX DOCUMENTFILE='all.xlsx'.` OUTPUT EXPORT also writes Word documents (/DOC), presentations (/PPT), web pages (/HTML) and picture files of the charts (see [Chart pictures](#chart-pictures))."
msgstr "要将多次运行的表格收集到一个工作簿中，请在最后一次运行末尾使用 OUTPUT EXPORT，它会写入会话的整个输出文档：`OUTPUT EXPORT /XLSX DOCUMENTFILE='all.xlsx'.` OUTPUT EXPORT 还能写入 Word 文档（/DOC）、演示文稿（/PPT）、网页（/HTML）以及图表的图片文件（参见[图表图片](#chart-pictures)）。"

msgid "Output files"
msgstr "输出文件 {#output-files}"

msgid "OUTPUT SAVE writes an output document as a Statscraft output file (`.scout`), and OUTPUT OPEN reads one back as a new document. The window saves and opens the same files ([the window](window.md#saving-output))."
msgstr "OUTPUT SAVE 将输出文档写为 Statscraft 输出文件（`.scout`），OUTPUT OPEN 将其读回为一个新文档。窗口保存和打开的是同样的文件（[窗口](window.md#saving-output)）。"

msgid ""
"```\n"
"statscraft run -e \"GET FILE='survey.sav'.\n"
"CROSSTABS region BY gender.\n"
"OUTPUT SAVE OUTFILE='region.scout'.\"\n"
"statscraft run -e \"OUTPUT OPEN FILE='region.scout'.\n"
"OUTPUT EXPORT /XLSX DOCUMENTFILE='region.xlsx' /HTML DOCUMENTFILE='region.html'.\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"statscraft run -e \"GET FILE='survey.sav'.\n"
"CROSSTABS region BY gender.\n"
"OUTPUT SAVE OUTFILE='region.scout'.\"\n"
"statscraft run -e \"OUTPUT OPEN FILE='region.scout'.\n"
"OUTPUT EXPORT /XLSX DOCUMENTFILE='region.xlsx' /HTML DOCUMENTFILE='region.html'.\"\n"
"```"

msgid "The second run converts the saved output without the data: OUTPUT OPEN makes the file's document the designated one, and OUTPUT EXPORT writes it. Tables of commands after OUTPUT OPEN join that document, so open, run and save again adds to the file."
msgstr "第二次运行在没有数据的情况下转换已保存的输出：OUTPUT OPEN 将文件中的文档设为指定文档，OUTPUT EXPORT 将其写出。OUTPUT OPEN 之后的命令所产生的表格会加入该文档，因此打开、运行、再次保存就会向文件中追加内容。"

msgid "A file may come from anyone, so OUTPUT OPEN checks every table and chart before it shows it. An item that fails the checks is left out with a warning that says why, and the rest of the file opens."
msgstr "文件可能来自任何人，因此 OUTPUT OPEN 在显示每个表格和图表之前都会对其进行检查。未通过检查的项会被省略，并给出说明原因的警告，文件的其余部分照常打开。"

msgid "The file is plain JSON, one table row per line, so an agent or a script can read it directly, with no Statscraft call. Each command is an item with the syntax exactly as it ran, its warnings, and its tables and charts in the form of [the run result](#run-result). The [developer notes](https://github.com/statscrafthq/statscraft/blob/main/docs/developers/README.md#output-files) describe the layout."
msgstr "该文件是纯 JSON，每个表格行占一行，因此智能体或脚本无需调用 Statscraft 即可直接读取。每个命令是一项，包含与运行时完全相同的语法、其警告，以及采用[运行结果](#run-result)形式的表格和图表。[开发者说明](https://github.com/statscrafthq/statscraft/blob/main/docs/developers/README.md#output-files)描述了其结构。"

msgid "Chart pictures"
msgstr "图表图片 {#chart-pictures}"

msgid "Every chart of the run is written to the folder, which is made if it is missing, as `01-<title>.svg`, `02-<title>.svg` and so on: numbered in the order of the output, the title in lower case with hyphens between its words. An existing file of the same name is replaced. The pictures are 640 pixels wide on white paper (a PNG has twice the pixels, for sharp text), drawn as the window draws them: flat bars, lines, areas, dots and slices in petrol and amber, muted labels and thin rule lines, in Schibsted Grotesk with tabular figures. Drawn are bar charts in both orientations, side by side, stacked and stacked to 100%, pie, line, area and scatter charts, the scatterplot matrix, the histogram with its normal curve, boxplots, the point plots (normal Q-Q and P-P, detrended Q-Q, spread versus level, residual and loading plots) with their reference lines, the dendrogram, the icicle plot and the tree diagram. A stem-and-leaf display and a plot in three dimensions get no file; their data table is in the output. An SVG names the font and falls back to the system's sans-serif font where Schibsted Grotesk is not installed; a PNG has it built in."
msgstr "本次运行的每个图表都写入该文件夹（文件夹不存在时会自动创建），文件名为 `01-<title>.svg`、`02-<title>.svg` 等：按输出顺序编号，标题转为小写，单词之间用连字符连接。同名的现有文件会被替换。图片宽 640 像素，白色背景（PNG 的像素数是其两倍，以使文字清晰），绘制方式与窗口相同：扁平的条形、线条、面积、圆点和扇区，采用石油蓝和琥珀色，标签颜色柔和，规则线细，字体为 Schibsted Grotesk，数字等宽。可绘制的有：两种方向的条形图（并列、堆积和 100% 堆积），饼图、折线图、面积图和散点图，散点图矩阵，带正态曲线的直方图，箱图，点图（正态 Q-Q 和 P-P 图、去势 Q-Q 图、离散度与水平图、残差图和载荷图）及其参考线，树状图，冰柱图和树形图。茎叶图和三维图不生成文件；它们的数据表在输出中。SVG 指定字体名称，未安装 Schibsted Grotesk 时回退到系统的无衬线字体；PNG 则内置了该字体。"

msgid "The text output on the terminal is the same as without `--charts`. The charts are written after the run, so a folder that cannot be written fails the command but leaves the session as the run saved it."
msgstr "终端上的文本输出与不加 `--charts` 时相同。图表在运行之后写入，因此无法写入的文件夹会使命令失败，但会话保持运行时保存的状态。"

msgid "The syntax writes pictures too. OUTPUT EXPORT with an image subcommand and no document saves every chart of the output document, numbered from 0 after IMAGEROOT:"
msgstr "语法也可以写出图片。带图片子命令但不带文档的 OUTPUT EXPORT 会保存输出文档中的每个图表，在 IMAGEROOT 之后从 0 开始编号："

msgid "The first line gives `charts/june0.png`, `charts/june1.png` and so on; the folder must exist. PERCENTSIZE=100 is the PNG of `--charts`, 1280 pixels wide; 50 halves it. PNG, JPG, BMP and TIF are written. EMF and EPS give a warning and are not written. A web page from OUTPUT EXPORT /HTML holds its charts as pictures inside the page, and /TEXT saves them beside the text file, named after it."
msgstr "第一行生成 `charts/june0.png`、`charts/june1.png` 等；文件夹必须已存在。PERCENTSIZE=100 就是 `--charts` 生成的 PNG，宽 1280 像素；50 则减半。可写入 PNG、JPG、BMP 和 TIF。EMF 和 EPS 会给出警告，不会写入。OUTPUT EXPORT /HTML 生成的网页将图表作为图片嵌入页面，/TEXT 则将图表保存在文本文件旁边，以该文件命名。"

msgid "The live window session"
msgstr "实时窗口会话 {#the-live-window-session}"

msgid "While `statscraft-gui` is open, the session name `gui` means the window:"
msgstr "`statscraft-gui` 打开期间，会话名 `gui` 表示该窗口："

msgid ""
"```\n"
"statscraft run -s gui -e \"GET FILE='survey.sav'.\"\n"
"statscraft run -s gui --json job.sps\n"
"statscraft check -s gui -e \"COMPUTE x = age / 10.\"\n"
"statscraft describe -s gui --json\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"statscraft run -s gui -e \"GET FILE='survey.sav'.\"\n"
"statscraft run -s gui --json job.sps\n"
"statscraft check -s gui -e \"COMPUTE x = age / 10.\"\n"
"statscraft describe -s gui --json\n"
"```"

msgid "The window runs the syntax as its own Run button does: the tables appear in the designated output window, the commands in the log, and the data windows show the new data."
msgstr "窗口运行语法的方式与它自己的 Run 按钮相同：表格出现在指定的输出窗口中，命令出现在日志中，数据窗口显示新数据。"

msgid "The command line prints what it prints for a file session, with `\"session\": \"gui\"`. `saved` is true when the run changed what the window's session keeps (see [Sessions](#sessions-and-line-ranges)); nothing is written to disk unless the syntax says `SAVE`."
msgstr "命令行打印的内容与文件会话相同，并带有 `\"session\": \"gui\"`。当运行改变了窗口会话保存的内容时，`saved` 为 true（参见[会话](#sessions-and-line-ranges)）；除非语法中有 `SAVE`，否则不会向磁盘写入任何内容。"

msgid "The window keeps the same state between runs as a file session, in memory until it closes; `describe -s gui` shows it the same way."
msgstr "窗口在多次运行之间保存的状态与文件会话相同，保存在内存中，直到窗口关闭；`describe -s gui` 以同样的方式显示它。"

msgid "Relative paths in the syntax start from the folder where `statscraft` was started, unless a CD is in force in the window's session: a CD starts from that folder too and then stays until the next CD, as in a file session. INSERT and INCLUDE in a syntax file given to `run` start from the file's folder, as in a file session. A run leaves the caller's folder to the window's own later runs, and `describe` shows it as `directory`; a check uses it only for itself. A syntax window that an agent runs starts from its own file's folder, or from the agent's folder when it has no file. A folder that is gone makes relative files fail with their own error; nothing is read or written anywhere else."
msgstr "语法中的相对路径从启动 `statscraft` 的文件夹开始，除非窗口会话中有生效的 CD：CD 本身也从该文件夹开始，然后一直有效到下一个 CD，与文件会话相同。传给 `run` 的语法文件中的 INSERT 和 INCLUDE 从该文件所在的文件夹开始，与文件会话相同。一次运行会把调用方的文件夹留给窗口自己之后的运行，`describe` 将其显示为 `directory`；检查只为自身使用该文件夹。智能体运行的语法窗口从其自身文件所在的文件夹开始，没有文件时从智能体的文件夹开始。文件夹已不存在时，相对路径的文件会以各自的错误失败；不会在其他任何位置读取或写入内容。"

msgid "Unlike a file session, the window names files in its messages by their full path, since it resolves relative names against the caller's folder."
msgstr "与文件会话不同，窗口在消息中用完整路径指称文件，因为它根据调用方的文件夹解析相对名称。"

msgid "One run goes at a time. A request waits while the window is busy."
msgstr "一次只进行一个运行。窗口忙碌时，请求会等待。"

msgid "When no window is open, `-s gui` fails with \"no Statscraft window is running\". With several windows open, the one started last answers."
msgstr "没有打开的窗口时，`-s gui` 失败并显示 “no Statscraft window is running”。打开多个窗口时，由最后启动的那个响应。"

msgid "How it connects, and why it is safe: see [AI agents](ai-agents.md#safety-of-the-live-session)."
msgstr "它如何连接以及为何安全：参见[AI 智能体](ai-agents.md#safety-of-the-live-session)。"

msgid "export"
msgstr "export"

msgid "Writes the output of the open `statscraft-gui` window to a file, exactly as its File > Export does (see [the window](window.md#exporting-all-output)): the designated output window, with what its plugins put on the tables."
msgstr "将打开的 `statscraft-gui` 窗口的输出写入文件，与其 File > Export 完全相同（参见[窗口](window.md#exporting-all-output)）：写入指定的输出窗口，包括其插件添加到表格上的内容。"

msgid "the file to write; a relative path starts in the current folder. An existing file is replaced"
msgstr "要写入的文件；相对路径从当前文件夹开始。现有文件会被替换"

msgid "`--format xlsx\\|html\\|pdf`"
msgstr "`--format xlsx\\|html\\|pdf`"

msgid "an Excel workbook, a web page or a PDF document; without it the extension of `FILE` says (`.xlsx`, `.html` or `.htm`, `.pdf`)"
msgstr "Excel 工作簿、网页或 PDF 文档；不加此选项时由 `FILE` 的扩展名决定（`.xlsx`、`.html` 或 `.htm`、`.pdf`）"

msgid "`--one-sheet`"
msgstr "`--one-sheet`"

msgid "Excel: all tables on one sheet, one below the other, instead of one sheet per table"
msgstr "Excel：所有表格放在一个工作表上，上下排列，而不是每个表格一个工作表"

msgid "`--selected`"
msgstr "`--selected`"

msgid "only the tables selected in the output window; fails when none is selected"
msgstr "只输出在输出窗口中选中的表格；没有选中任何表格时失败"

msgid "`--hidden`"
msgstr "`--hidden`"

msgid "hidden items too; without it only what the output window shows"
msgstr "也包括隐藏的项；不加此选项时只输出输出窗口中显示的内容"

msgid ""
"```\n"
"statscraft run -s gui -e \"FREQUENCIES region.\"\n"
"statscraft export tables.xlsx --one-sheet\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"statscraft run -s gui -e \"FREQUENCIES region.\"\n"
"statscraft export tables.xlsx --one-sheet\n"
"```"

msgid "It fails when no window is open, when the window has no output, and when the file cannot be written. An export waits until the plugins have answered for the tables of the last run."
msgstr "没有打开的窗口、窗口没有输出或文件无法写入时，它会失败。导出会等待插件对上次运行的表格作出响应。"

msgid "output"
msgstr "output"

msgid "Shows what an output window of the open `statscraft-gui` window holds, as the person sees it there: every command heading and every table and chart of the session in order, also those from earlier runs and other callers. Without `--document` it reads the designated output window; `NAME` is an output document as `describe -s gui` lists it. It changes nothing in the window."
msgstr "显示打开的 `statscraft-gui` 窗口中某个输出窗口的内容，与用户在那里看到的一样：会话中的每个命令标题以及每个表格和图表，按顺序排列，也包括之前各次运行和其他调用方产生的内容。不加 `--document` 时读取指定的输出窗口；`NAME` 是 `describe -s gui` 列出的某个输出文档。它不会更改窗口中的任何内容。"

msgid "The first line sums up the document and says which kinds of element the window shows (Edit > Settings: command headings, titles, tables, notes, charts). Then each heading and table follows as `run` prints them, a chart as its data table; `(hidden)` marks a heading or table hidden in the output, `(selected)` a table selected in the output window."
msgstr "第一行概括该文档，并说明窗口显示哪些类型的元素（Edit > Settings：命令标题、标题、表格、注释、图表）。随后每个标题和表格按 `run` 的方式打印，图表打印为其数据表；`(hidden)` 标记在输出中隐藏的标题或表格，`(selected)` 标记在输出窗口中选中的表格。"

msgid ""
"```\n"
"statscraft run -s gui -e \"FREQUENCIES region.\"\n"
"statscraft output\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"statscraft run -s gui -e \"FREQUENCIES region.\"\n"
"statscraft output\n"
"```"

msgid "With `--json` it prints the window's answer: `document`, `shows` (`headings`, `titles`, `tables`, `notes`, `charts`, each true or false) and `commands`, each with `id`, `heading`, `hidden` and `items`; an item has `id`, `hidden`, `selected` and a `table` or a `chart` in the form `run --json` gives them. It fails when no window is open, when the window has no output window, and when no output document has that name."
msgstr "加上 `--json` 时，它打印窗口的应答：`document`、`shows`（`headings`、`titles`、`tables`、`notes`、`charts`，各为 true 或 false）和 `commands`，每个命令带有 `id`、`heading`、`hidden` 和 `items`；每一项带有 `id`、`hidden`、`selected`，以及采用 `run --json` 所给形式的 `table` 或 `chart`。没有打开的窗口、窗口没有输出窗口或没有该名称的输出文档时，它会失败。"

msgid "undo"
msgstr "undo"

msgid "Takes back the last run that changed the data in the open `statscraft-gui` window, exactly as its Edit > Undo does (see [the window](window.md#syntax-is-the-only-command-layer)): the datasets are as they were before that run, the output stays, and the log marks the run as undone. It goes one change back for each call, up to 10 changes (fewer for a very large file, when the saved states would hold more than 1 GB of memory not shared with the current data; the newest change can always be taken back). `statscraft redo` does it again. It prints the first line of the syntax it took back:"
msgstr "撤销打开的 `statscraft-gui` 窗口中最近一次更改了数据的运行，与其 Edit > Undo 完全相同（参见[窗口](window.md#syntax-is-the-only-command-layer)）：数据集恢复到该次运行之前的状态，输出保留，日志将该次运行标记为已撤销。每次调用后退一步更改，最多 10 步（文件很大时会更少，即保存的状态会占用超过 1 GB 不与当前数据共享的内存时；最近一次更改始终可以撤销）。`statscraft redo` 重做该运行。它打印所撤销语法的第一行："

msgid ""
"```\n"
"statscraft run -s gui -e \"COMPUTE total = q1 + q2.\"\n"
"statscraft undo\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"statscraft run -s gui -e \"COMPUTE total = q1 + q2.\"\n"
"statscraft undo\n"
"```"

msgid "It fails when no window is open, and when no change to the data is left to take back. File sessions have no undo."
msgstr "没有打开的窗口，或没有可撤销的数据更改时，它会失败。文件会话没有撤销功能。"

msgid "redo"
msgstr "redo"

msgid "Does again the run that the last `statscraft undo` took back in the open `statscraft-gui` window, as its Edit > Redo does: the datasets are as they were before that undo, and the log no longer marks the run as undone. Each call goes one run forward, as far as the runs that were taken back. A run that changes the data after an undo ends the redo, as does any change that follows it. It prints the first line of the syntax it did again:"
msgstr "在打开的 `statscraft-gui` 窗口中重做最近一次 `statscraft undo` 所撤销的运行，与其 Edit > Redo 相同：数据集恢复到该次撤销之前的状态，日志不再将该次运行标记为已撤销。每次调用前进一次运行，最多到所撤销的运行为止。撤销之后运行一个更改数据的命令会结束重做，之后的任何更改也是如此。它打印所重做语法的第一行："

msgid "It fails when no window is open, and when there is nothing to do again."
msgstr "没有打开的窗口，或没有可重做的内容时，它会失败。"

msgid "mcp"
msgstr "mcp"

msgid "`statscraft mcp` serves describe, help, check and run as MCP tools over standard input and output, for agent apps that start local MCP servers. It runs until the app closes the connection. [The MCP server](mcp.md) lists the tools and says where their sessions live."
msgstr "`statscraft mcp` 通过标准输入和标准输出将 describe、help、check 和 run 作为 MCP 工具提供，供启动本地 MCP 服务器的智能体应用使用。它一直运行，直到应用关闭连接。[MCP 服务器](mcp.md)列出了这些工具，并说明其会话保存在何处。"

msgid "JSON output"
msgstr "JSON 输出 {#json-output}"

msgid "`run`, `check` and `describe` print pretty JSON with `--json`. `plan` and `db` always print one line of JSON."
msgstr "`run`、`check` 和 `describe` 加上 `--json` 时打印格式化的 JSON。`plan` 和 `db` 始终打印一行 JSON。"

msgid "Run result"
msgstr "运行结果 {#run-result}"

msgid "`statscraft run -s demo --json -e \"COMPUTE spend_year = monthly_spend * 12.` followed by a second line `FREQUENCIES VARIABLES=gender.\"` prints (the table rows are shortened here):"
