msgid "`bar`, `pie`, `line`, `area`, `error_bar` (a point per value with its error bar), `range_bar` (a floating bar between each pair of series), `drop_line` and `high_low` (points with a line from the lowest to the highest value of each category; for `high_low` the third series is the close), `difference` (two lines with the area between them shaded), `scatter`, `dot` (a dot plot: points as for `scatter`, captioned as a dot plot), `histogram`, `boxplot`, `stem_leaf`, `normal_qq`, `detrended_normal_qq`, `normal_pp`, `spread_level`, `dendrogram`, `icicle`, `tree_diagram` or `territorial_map`"
msgstr "`bar`、`pie`、`line`、`area`、`error_bar`（每个值一个点，带误差条）、`range_bar`（每对系列之间的浮动条形）、`drop_line` 和 `high_low`（各点，并有一条线从每个类别的最低值连到最高值；对于 `high_low`，第三个系列为收盘值）、`difference`（两条线，其间区域加阴影）、`scatter`、`dot`（点图：点与 `scatter` 相同，说明文字标为点图）、`histogram`、`boxplot`、`stem_leaf`、`normal_qq`、`detrended_normal_qq`、`normal_pp`、`spread_level`、`dendrogram`、`icicle`、`tree_diagram` 或 `territorial_map`"

msgid "`tier`"
msgstr "`tier`"

msgid "`presentation` (a chart the office programs can hold as an editable chart) or `statistical` (a plot drawn exactly, such as the histogram)"
msgstr "`presentation`（办公软件可作为可编辑图表保存的图表）或 `statistical`（精确绘制的图，例如直方图）"

msgid "`orientation`"
msgstr "`orientation`"

msgid "`vertical` (categories along the bottom) or `horizontal`; absent for a pie"
msgstr "`vertical`（类别沿底部排列）或 `horizontal`；饼图时不出现"

msgid "`grouping`"
msgstr "`grouping`"

msgid "`clustered`, `stacked` or `percent` (stacked to 100%); bars, lines and areas only"
msgstr "`clustered`、`stacked` 或 `percent`（100% 堆积）；仅用于条形、线和面积"

msgid "`title`, `subtitle`, `footnote`"
msgstr "`title`, `subtitle`, `footnote`"

msgid "the title, as a table of the same command would have it, an optional line under it (GRAPH /SUBTITLE), and an optional note such as the mean, standard deviation and N of a histogram"
msgstr "标题（与同一命令的表格标题相同），其下方的可选一行（GRAPH /SUBTITLE），以及可选的注释，例如直方图的均值、标准差和 N"

msgid "`category_axis`, `value_axis`"
msgstr "`category_axis`, `value_axis`"

msgid "each with its `title`, the display `format` of its numbers, `maximum` when the syntax set the top of the axis, and the `variable` it shows"
msgstr "各自带有 `title`、其数值的显示格式 `format`、语法设定了坐标轴上限时的 `maximum`，以及它所显示的变量 `variable`"

msgid "`legend`"
msgstr "`legend`"

msgid "what tells the series apart, such as the column variable; absent with one series"
msgstr "区分各系列的依据，例如列变量；只有一个系列时不出现"

msgid "`categories`"
msgstr "`categories`"

msgid "in drawing order: the `label`, the `value` it stands for (`null` for a slice of all missing values), `missing` when it holds missing values, and `bin` (`[from, to]`) for a histogram bin, which holds its lower bound but not its upper one"
msgstr "按绘制顺序：`label`，它所代表的值 `value`（全部为缺失值的扇区为 `null`），包含缺失值时的 `missing`，以及直方图分组的 `bin`（`[from, to]`），分组包含其下界但不包含上界"

msgid "`series`"
msgstr "`series`"

msgid "each with its `name`, the `statistic` its numbers are (`count`, weighted when a weight is set, `percent`, `mean` or `value`), the `variable` and `value` it stands for, and `values`, one number per category"
msgstr "各自带有 `name`，其数值所代表的统计量 `statistic`（`count`，设置了权重时为加权计数，`percent`、`mean` 或 `value`），它所代表的 `variable` 和 `value`，以及 `values`，每个类别一个数值"

msgid "`normal`"
msgstr "`normal`"

msgid "a histogram's normal curve: `mean`, `std_dev` and `total`; its height at x is total times the bin width times the normal density"
msgstr "直方图的正态曲线：`mean`、`std_dev` 和 `total`；它在 x 处的高度等于 total 乘以分组宽度再乘以正态密度"

msgid "`error_bars`"
msgstr "`error_bars`"

msgid "bars, lines and points with error bars, such as a profile plot with ERRORBAR or a GRAPH ERRORBAR chart: a `label` saying what a bar spans (`95% CI`, `2 SE`) and `margins`, for each series a list with the half length of its bar at each category (the bar runs from the value minus it to the value plus it; an empty list for a series without bars, `null` where a value has none); `lower`, only where bars reach less far below than above (the interval of a median), lists the length below in the same way, and `margins` is then the length above"
msgstr "带误差条的条形、线和点，例如带 ERRORBAR 的轮廓图或 GRAPH ERRORBAR 图表：`label` 说明误差条的范围（`95% CI`、`2 SE`），`margins` 为每个系列给出一个列表，列出其在每个类别处误差条的半长（误差条从值减去半长延伸到值加上半长；没有误差条的系列为空列表，某个值没有误差条时为 `null`）；`lower` 只在误差条向下延伸的长度小于向上延伸的长度时出现（中位数的区间），以同样方式列出向下的长度，此时 `margins` 为向上的长度"

msgid "`second_axis`"
msgstr "`second_axis`"

msgid "a bar chart's second value axis on the right (`title`, `format`, `maximum`) for its last series, which is drawn as a line over the bars, such as the cumulative percentage of a GRAPH PARETO chart"
msgstr "条形图右侧的第二个数值坐标轴（`title`、`format`、`maximum`），用于其最后一个系列，该系列绘制为条形上方的一条线，例如 GRAPH PARETO 图表的累积百分比"

msgid "`plot`"
msgstr "`plot`"

msgid "the data of a statistical plot other than the histogram, by its `shape`; `categories` and `series` are then empty, the category axis is the horizontal one and the value axis the vertical one"
msgstr "除直方图以外的统计图的数据，按其 `shape` 区分；此时 `categories` 和 `series` 为空，类别坐标轴为水平轴，数值坐标轴为垂直轴"

msgid "The shapes of `plot`:"
msgstr "`plot` 的各种形状："

msgid "`boxes`: `boxes`, each with its `label`, `group` (the cluster, when boxes are grouped), `n`, `lower_whisker`, `lower_hinge`, `median`, `upper_hinge`, `upper_whisker`, and the marked cases in `outliers` and `extremes` (each a `value` and its `case` label)."
msgstr "`boxes`：`boxes`，每个带有 `label`、`group`（箱体分组时所属的簇）、`n`、`lower_whisker`、`lower_hinge`、`median`、`upper_hinge`、`upper_whisker`，以及标记的个案 `outliers` 和 `extremes`（每个为一个 `value` 及其个案标签 `case`）。"

msgid "`stem_leaf`: `stem_width`, `each_leaf` (cases per leaf), `lines` (each a `frequency`, the `stem` as shown and the `leaves` as digits) and `low_extremes`, `high_extremes` (a `frequency` and the `bound`)."
msgstr "`stem_leaf`：`stem_width`、`each_leaf`（每片叶的个案数）、`lines`（每行包含 `frequency`、显示的 `stem` 以及以数字表示的 `leaves`），以及 `low_extremes`、`high_extremes`（`frequency` 和 `bound`）。"

msgid "`points`: `groups`, each a `name` and `points` (`x`, `y`, an optional `z` and `label`); `lines`, straight reference lines `y = intercept + slope x`; and `z_axis` when the points have depth. Q-Q, P-P, spread-versus-level, scatter, partial regression and loading plots use it."
msgstr "`points`：`groups`，每个带有 `name` 和 `points`（`x`、`y`，可选的 `z` 和 `label`）；`lines`，即直的参考线 `y = intercept + slope x`；点有深度时还有 `z_axis`。Q-Q 图、P-P 图、离散度与水平图、散点图、偏回归图和载荷图使用此形状。"

msgid "`matrix`: `variables`, the axes in order (each with its `title` and `format`), and `groups`, each a `name` and `cases`, each case with its `values` in the order of the variables (`null` where missing) and an optional `label`. GRAPH SCATTERPLOT(MATRIX) uses it, with kind `scatter`."
msgstr "`matrix`：`variables`，按顺序排列的坐标轴（每个带有 `title` 和 `format`），以及 `groups`，每个带有 `name` 和 `cases`，每个个案带有按变量顺序排列的 `values`（缺失处为 `null`）和可选的 `label`。GRAPH SCATTERPLOT(MATRIX) 使用此形状，类型为 `scatter`。"

msgid "`merges`: `items` (the case labels), `order` (the layout of the items, so that no branches cross), `merges` (each joins cluster `right` into cluster `left`, both named by an item index, at `height`, with `rescaled` from 1 to 25) and, for an icicle plot, `solutions`, the numbers of clusters it shows."
msgstr "`merges`：`items`（个案标签）、`order`（各项的排列，使分支不交叉）、`merges`（每个都在高度 `height` 处将簇 `right` 合并到簇 `left` 中，两者都以项的索引命名，`rescaled` 为 1 到 25 的重新标度值），以及冰柱图的 `solutions`，即它所显示的簇数。"

msgid "`tree`: `nodes`, each with its `id`, `parent`, the `split` condition that leads to it, and `statistics` as name and value pairs."
msgstr "`tree`：`nodes`，每个带有 `id`、`parent`、通向它的分割条件 `split`，以及由名称和值对构成的 `statistics`。"

msgid "`regions`: `regions`, each with its `name`, its `center` (`[x, y]`, such as a group centroid) and `vertices`, the corners of its convex polygon in order around it (empty when the region is empty). The DISCRIMINANT territorial map uses it."
msgstr "`regions`：`regions`，每个带有 `name`、其中心 `center`（`[x, y]`，例如组质心）和 `vertices`，即其凸多边形按环绕顺序排列的各个顶点（区域为空时为空）。DISCRIMINANT 的区域图使用此形状。"

msgid "With `--vega-lite` each chart also has a member `vega_lite`: a [Vega-Lite](https://vega.github.io/vega-lite/) v5 specification with the numbers inline, which any Vega-Lite viewer draws as it is. In Markdown output the specification follows the chart's data table as a `json` code block. SPLIT FILE gives a chart per split group, the group named in the title."
msgstr "加上 `--vega-lite` 时，每个图表还有一个成员 `vega_lite`：一个数值内联的 [Vega-Lite](https://vega.github.io/vega-lite/) v5 规范，任何 Vega-Lite 查看器都能直接绘制。在 Markdown 输出中，该规范作为 `json` 代码块跟在图表的数据表之后。SPLIT FILE 为每个拆分组生成一个图表，组名写在标题中。"

msgid "Charts as input"
msgstr "作为输入的图表 {#charts-as-input}"

msgid "Statscraft reads a chart back in the form it writes it, so an agent or a script can put a chart that no procedure makes into the output. The chart is drawn, saved and exported like any other: in the window's output, OUTPUT SAVE, OUTPUT EXPORT, Copy and Open in the office programs."
msgstr "Statscraft 能以其写出的形式读回图表，因此智能体或脚本可以将任何过程都不生成的图表放入输出。该图表的绘制、保存和导出与其他图表一样：在窗口的输出中，以及 OUTPUT SAVE、OUTPUT EXPORT、Copy，和用 Open in 在办公软件中打开。"

msgid "`statscraft chart FILE` (or `-` for standard input) takes `-s`, `--json`, `--vega-lite`, `--xlsx` and `--charts` as `run` does. It runs the syntax BEGIN CHART, a Statscraft extension, with the file's JSON between BEGIN CHART and END CHART, each on its own line; the same block works in any syntax file, so OUTPUT EXPORT in the same run writes the chart out. The MCP tool `add_chart` does the same. See [BEGIN CHART](commands/begin-chart.md)."
msgstr "`statscraft chart FILE`（或用 `-` 表示标准输入）与 `run` 一样接受 `-s`、`--json`、`--vega-lite`、`--xlsx` 和 `--charts`。它运行语法 BEGIN CHART（Statscraft 的扩展），文件的 JSON 位于 BEGIN CHART 和 END CHART 之间，二者各占一行；同样的块在任何语法文件中都有效，因此同一次运行中的 OUTPUT EXPORT 会把该图表写出。MCP 工具 `add_chart` 的作用相同。参见 [BEGIN CHART](commands/begin-chart.md)。"

msgid "The JSON is one of two forms."
msgstr "JSON 采用以下两种形式之一。"

msgid "The chart JSON above, as `--json` writes it. A chart from a run reads back as the same chart, so the simplest way to make one is to take a procedure's chart and change it. `\"version\": 1` may be given; a higher version is refused. The member `vega_lite` that `--vega-lite` adds is ignored. A field the chart does not have is an error, so a misspelt one is not lost silently; a field that is `null`, `false` or empty counts as left out. `kind`, `tier`, `title`, `category_axis` and `value_axis` (each with a `title`), `categories` and `series` (each with `name`, `statistic` and `values`) are required. A number may be `null` where there is none. A statistical plot gives its data in `plot` with the shape `points` (kinds `scatter`, `normal_qq`, `detrended_normal_qq`, `normal_pp`, `qq`, `detrended_qq`, `pp`, `detrended_pp`, `roc`, `spread_level`) or `boxes` (kind `boxplot`); the other shapes are made only by their procedures."
msgstr "上面的图表 JSON，即 `--json` 写出的形式。一次运行产生的图表读回后是同一个图表，因此最简单的做法是取某个过程的图表加以修改。可以给出 `\"version\": 1`；更高的版本会被拒绝。`--vega-lite` 添加的成员 `vega_lite` 会被忽略。图表没有的字段会报错，因此拼错的字段不会悄然丢失；值为 `null`、`false` 或空的字段视为省略。`kind`、`tier`、`title`、`category_axis` 和 `value_axis`（各带一个 `title`）、`categories` 和 `series`（各带 `name`、`statistic` 和 `values`）是必需的。没有数值的地方可以为 `null`。统计图在 `plot` 中给出数据，形状为 `points`（类型 `scatter`、`normal_qq`、`detrended_normal_qq`、`normal_pp`、`qq`、`detrended_qq`、`pp`、`detrended_pp`、`roc`、`spread_level`）或 `boxes`（类型 `boxplot`）；其他形状只能由各自的过程生成。"

msgid "A [Vega-Lite](https://vega.github.io/vega-lite/) specification of one view, the part that maps cleanly to a Statscraft chart:"
msgstr "单个视图的 [Vega-Lite](https://vega.github.io/vega-lite/) 规范，即能清晰对应到 Statscraft 图表的部分："

msgid "Mark"
msgstr "标记"

msgid "Encodings"
msgstr "编码"

msgid "Gives"
msgstr "结果"

msgid "`bar`"
msgstr "`bar`"

msgid "`x` and `y`, one of them `quantitative`; optional `color`, and `xOffset` or `yOffset` on the field of `color`"
msgstr "`x` 和 `y`，其中一个为 `quantitative`；可选 `color`，以及作用于 `color` 字段的 `xOffset` 或 `yOffset`"

msgid "a bar chart: vertical when `y` holds the values, horizontal when `x` does. With `color` the bars stack, as in Vega-Lite; with an offset they stand side by side; `stack: \"normalize\"` stacks them to 100%"
msgstr "条形图：`y` 存放数值时为垂直，`x` 存放数值时为水平。有 `color` 时条形堆积，与 Vega-Lite 相同；有偏移时并列；`stack: \"normalize\"` 将其堆积到 100%"

msgid "`line`"
msgstr "`line`"

msgid "`x` (the categories) and `y` (`quantitative`), optional `color`"
msgstr "`x`（类别）和 `y`（`quantitative`），可选 `color`"

msgid "a line chart, a line per color"
msgstr "折线图，每种颜色一条线"

msgid "`area`"
msgstr "`area`"

msgid "the same"
msgstr "同上"

msgid "an area chart; with `color` stacked, or to 100% with `stack: \"normalize\"`"
msgstr "面积图；有 `color` 时堆积，使用 `stack: \"normalize\"` 时堆积到 100%"

msgid "`point`"
msgstr "`point`"

msgid "`x` and `y`, both `quantitative`, optional `color`"
msgstr "`x` 和 `y`，均为 `quantitative`，可选 `color`"

msgid "a scatter plot, a group per color; a row without both numbers is left out"
msgstr "散点图，每种颜色一组；缺少任一数值的行会被省略"

msgid "`arc`"
msgstr "`arc`"

msgid "`theta` (`quantitative`) and `color`"
msgstr "`theta`（`quantitative`）和 `color`"

msgid "a pie, a slice per color"
msgstr "饼图，每种颜色一个扇区"

msgid "The rows are inline in `data.values`, each an object. Every row gives one value: a category (and color) given twice is an error, since nothing is aggregated."
msgstr "各行以对象形式内联在 `data.values` 中。每行给出一个值：同一类别（和颜色）出现两次会报错，因为不进行任何汇总。"

msgid "A channel takes `field`, `type` (`quantitative`, `nominal`, `ordinal` or `temporal`; `color` and the offsets default to `nominal`), `title` and `sort`: `\"ascending\"` (the default, as in Vega-Lite), `\"descending\"`, `null` for the order of the data, or a list of values that come first. `axis`, `legend` and `scale` are accepted and change nothing; so are `width`, `height`, `config` and the other members that only set how the chart looks, and the properties of `mark` besides `type`."
msgstr "通道接受 `field`、`type`（`quantitative`、`nominal`、`ordinal` 或 `temporal`；`color` 和偏移默认为 `nominal`）、`title` 和 `sort`：`\"ascending\"`（默认，与 Vega-Lite 相同）、`\"descending\"`、表示按数据顺序的 `null`，或一个排在最前的值列表。`axis`、`legend` 和 `scale` 会被接受但不起作用；`width`、`height`、`config` 以及其他只设置图表外观的成员，还有 `mark` 中除 `type` 之外的属性也是如此。"

msgid "`title` is a string, or an object with `text` and `subtitle`. Without one the chart is named \"values by categories\" after the axis titles. An axis title is the channel's `title`, else its field."
msgstr "`title` 是一个字符串，或一个带有 `text` 和 `subtitle` 的对象。没有标题时，图表根据坐标轴标题命名为 “values by categories”。坐标轴标题是通道的 `title`，否则为其字段名。"

msgid "Refused, with a message that names what is not supported: other marks, encodings such as `size` or `shape`, `aggregate`, `bin`, `timeUnit`, a fixed `value` or `datum`, `transform`, `layer`, `facet`, `repeat` and the concatenations, `params`, data from `url` or by `name`, and a Vega (not Vega-Lite) schema."
msgstr "以下内容会被拒绝，并给出指明不支持之处的消息：其他标记，`size` 或 `shape` 等编码，`aggregate`、`bin`、`timeUnit`，固定的 `value` 或 `datum`，`transform`、`layer`、`facet`、`repeat` 和各种拼接，`params`，来自 `url` 或按 `name` 引用的数据，以及 Vega（而非 Vega-Lite）模式。"

msgid "Limits, for both forms: at most 100 series, 3000 categories, 100000 values (series times categories, points, or rows), strings of 1000 characters and a JSON text of 16 MB. A chart whose parts do not fit together, such as a series with fewer values than there are categories, is refused before anything draws it."
msgstr "两种形式的限制：最多 100 个系列、3000 个类别、100000 个值（系列数乘以类别数，或点数、行数），字符串最长 1000 个字符，JSON 文本最大 16 MB。各部分不相容的图表，例如某个系列的值少于类别数，会在绘制之前被拒绝。"

