msgid "counts over all cases"
msgstr "基于所有个案的计数"

msgid "This page is for people who keep survey data in a database. `statscraft db` stores a dataset in SQLite, PostgreSQL, MySQL, MariaDB or Dolt and reads it back, and `statscraft plan` applies recodes and labels to a stored dataset in place. Both follow the OpenStatSpec specification, so other programs that follow it read the same tables."
msgstr "本页面向在数据库中保存调查数据的用户。`statscraft db` 将数据集存入 SQLite、PostgreSQL、MySQL、MariaDB 或 Dolt 并读回，`statscraft plan` 则对已存储的数据集就地应用重新编码和标签。两者都遵循 OpenStatSpec 规范，因此遵循该规范的其他程序可以读取相同的表。"

msgid "A quick round trip with the [sample file](getting-started.md#open-the-sample-file):"
msgstr "用[示例文件](getting-started.md#open-the-sample-file)快速往返一次："

msgid ""
"```\n"
"statscraft db export survey.sav --sqlite study.db\n"
"statscraft plan -e \"RECODE satisfaction (9 = SYSMIS).\" --sqlite study.db --name survey --apply\n"
"statscraft db import --sqlite study.db --name survey --out back.sav\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"statscraft db export survey.sav --sqlite study.db\n"
"statscraft plan -e \"RECODE satisfaction (9 = SYSMIS).\" --sqlite study.db --name survey --apply\n"
"statscraft db import --sqlite study.db --name survey --out back.sav\n"
"```"

msgid "The first line stores the file in a new SQLite database, the second recodes one variable in the database, and the third writes the result to a new .sav file."
msgstr "第一行将文件存入一个新的 SQLite 数据库，第二行在数据库中对一个变量重新编码，第三行将结果写入一个新的 .sav 文件。"

msgid "Transformation plans: plan"
msgstr "转换计划：plan {#transformation-plans-plan}"

msgid "`plan` turns a bounded part of the language into an OpenStatSpec Transformation Plan: one line of canonical JSON with the plan, its SHA-256 `plan_hash` and the `source_hash` of the syntax, or an error with a stable `code`, `line` and `column`."
msgstr "`plan` 把语言中一个有限的子集转换为 OpenStatSpec 转换计划（Transformation Plan）：输出一行规范化 JSON，包含计划本身、其 SHA-256 `plan_hash` 以及语法的 `source_hash`；或者输出一个错误，带有稳定的 `code`、`line` 和 `column`。"

msgid "`--input-schema FILE`"
msgstr "`--input-schema FILE`"

msgid "JSON of the form `{\"variables\": [{\"name\": \"q1\", \"storage_kind\": \"numeric\"}]}`"
msgstr "形如 `{\"variables\": [{\"name\": \"q1\", \"storage_kind\": \"numeric\"}]}` 的 JSON"

msgid "take the input schema from a session's dataset"
msgstr "从会话的数据集获取输入模式"

msgid "`--sqlite DB --name DATASET`"
msgstr "`--sqlite DB --name DATASET`"

msgid "take it from a dataset in an OpenStatSpec SQLite database"
msgstr "从 OpenStatSpec SQLite 数据库中的数据集获取输入模式"

msgid "`--apply`"
msgstr "`--apply`"

msgid "with `--sqlite`, apply the plan to that dataset in place, in one transaction with one audit row"
msgstr "与 `--sqlite` 一起使用时，就地将计划应用到该数据集，在一个事务中完成，并写入一条审计行"

msgid "`--actor NAME`"
msgstr "`--actor NAME`"

msgid "who applies the plan, for the audit row; default `$USER`"
msgstr "应用计划的人，记入审计行；默认为 `$USER`"

msgid "`--profile`"
msgstr "`--profile`"

msgid "the frontend profile, `0.3` by default"
msgstr "前端配置档，默认为 `0.3`"

msgid "`--alias`"
msgstr "`--alias`"

msgid "the name of the input dataset in the plan, `input` by default"
msgstr "计划中输入数据集的名称，默认为 `input`"

msgid "Profile 0.1 accepts RECODE, VARIABLE LABELS and VALUE LABELS; 0.2 adds COMPUTE and IF with single values and simple comparisons, FORMATS, VARIABLE LEVEL and EXECUTE; 0.3 adds comments, TO lists, NE and NOT, LOWEST and HIGHEST ranges and ADD VALUE LABELS. Everything else is rejected, even where `run` accepts it. With `schema.json` holding `{\"variables\": [{\"name\": \"q1\", \"storage_kind\": \"numeric\"}, {\"name\": \"q2\", \"storage_kind\": \"numeric\"}]}`:"
msgstr "配置档 0.1 接受 RECODE、VARIABLE LABELS 和 VALUE LABELS；0.2 增加了使用单个值和简单比较的 COMPUTE 与 IF，以及 FORMATS、VARIABLE LEVEL 和 EXECUTE；0.3 增加了注释、TO 列表、NE 和 NOT、LOWEST 与 HIGHEST 范围以及 ADD VALUE LABELS。其他一切都会被拒绝，即使 `run` 接受它们。当 `schema.json` 包含 `{\"variables\": [{\"name\": \"q1\", \"storage_kind\": \"numeric\"}, {\"name\": \"q2\", \"storage_kind\": \"numeric\"}]}` 时："

msgid ""
"```\n"
"statscraft plan -e \"RECODE q1 (1 = 0).\" --input-schema schema.json --profile 0.1\n"
"statscraft plan -s demo -e \"RECODE satisfaction (9 = SYSMIS).\"\n"
"statscraft plan -e \"FREQUENCIES q1.\" --input-schema schema.json\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"statscraft plan -e \"RECODE q1 (1 = 0).\" --input-schema schema.json --profile 0.1\n"
"statscraft plan -s demo -e \"RECODE satisfaction (9 = SYSMIS).\"\n"
"statscraft plan -e \"FREQUENCIES q1.\" --input-schema schema.json\n"
"```"

msgid "The last one prints `{\"error\":{...,\"message\":\"FREQUENCIES is not supported by frontend profile 0.3\",...},\"ok\":false,...}`, whose `code` is the profile's code for an unsupported command, and exits with 1."
msgstr "最后一条命令打印 `{\"error\":{...,\"message\":\"FREQUENCIES is not supported by frontend profile 0.3\",...},\"ok\":false,...}`，其中的 `code` 是该配置档表示不支持命令的代码，退出代码为 1。"

msgid "Store and read datasets: db"
msgstr "存储和读取数据集：db {#store-and-read-datasets-db}"

msgid "`db` stores a dataset the way OpenStatSpec's SAV/ZSAV profile 1.0 and its SQL dialect profiles specify."
msgstr "`db` 按照 OpenStatSpec 的 SAV/ZSAV 配置档 1.0 及其 SQL 方言配置档的规定存储数据集。"

msgid "One table `data_<name>` holds the cases: `__case_ordinal` (1, 2, 3, ... in case order) and one column per variable, in variable order."
msgstr "一个 `data_<name>` 表保存个案：`__case_ordinal`（按个案顺序为 1、2、3……）以及每个变量一列，按变量顺序排列。"

msgid "Numbers are binary64, with system-missing as NULL. Strings are text that is never NULL. User-missing codes are kept as values, and dates as numbers."
msgstr "数字为 binary64，系统缺失值存为 NULL。字符串为文本，从不为 NULL。用户缺失值代码作为值保留，日期作为数字保留。"

msgid "The dictionary goes into the catalog tables: labels, value labels, missing values, formats, measurement level, role, display settings, attributes, documents, weight variable and multiple response sets."
msgstr "数据字典存入目录表：标签、值标签、缺失值、格式、测量级别、角色、显示设置、属性、文档、权重变量和多重响应集。"

msgid "Variable names that are not plain ASCII get generated column names (`v<position>`); the catalog maps them back."
msgstr "不是纯 ASCII 的变量名会得到生成的列名（`v<position>`）；目录表负责将其映射回原名。"

msgid "The database belongs to OpenStatSpec. `export` sets up the catalog in a new or empty one and refuses one that holds anything else."
msgstr "该数据库专供 OpenStatSpec 使用。`export` 在新的或空的数据库中建立目录表，并拒绝包含其他任何内容的数据库。"

msgid "`--sqlite FILE`, `--postgres URL`, `--mysql URL`, `--dolt URL`"
msgstr "`--sqlite FILE`, `--postgres URL`, `--mysql URL`, `--dolt URL`"

msgid "the database; see [Databases](#supported-databases)"
msgstr "数据库；参见[数据库](#supported-databases)"

msgid "`--name`"
msgstr "`--name`"

msgid "the dataset name: ASCII letters, digits and `_`. For `export` it defaults to the file or session name"
msgstr "数据集名称：ASCII 字母、数字和 `_`。对于 `export`，默认为文件名或会话名"

msgid "`--out FILE`"
msgstr "`--out FILE`"

msgid "`import` writes this .sav or .zsav file"
msgstr "`import` 写入这个 .sav 或 .zsav 文件"

msgid "`export` reads, or `import` replaces, this session's dataset"
msgstr "`export` 读取该会话的数据集，`import` 则替换它"

msgid "`--allow-loss`"
msgstr "`--allow-loss`"

msgid "`import` goes on when the catalog holds items a dataset cannot keep"
msgstr "当目录表中有数据集无法保留的项目时，`import` 仍继续执行"

msgid "Each prints one line of JSON, such as `{\"case_count\":300,\"dataset\":\"survey\",\"dataset_id\":\"...\",\"ok\":true,\"table\":\"data_survey\",\"variable_count\":18}`, or `{\"ok\":false,\"error\":{\"code\":...,\"message\":...}}` with exit code 1."
msgstr "每条命令打印一行 JSON，例如 `{\"case_count\":300,\"dataset\":\"survey\",\"dataset_id\":\"...\",\"ok\":true,\"table\":\"data_survey\",\"variable_count\":18}`，或者打印 `{\"ok\":false,\"error\":{\"code\":...,\"message\":...}}` 并返回退出代码 1。"

msgid ""
"```\n"
"statscraft db export survey.sav --sqlite study.db\n"
"statscraft db export -s demo --sqlite study.db --name work\n"
"statscraft plan -e \"RECODE satisfaction (9 = SYSMIS).\" --sqlite study.db --name survey --apply --actor demo\n"
"statscraft db import --sqlite study.db --name survey --out back.sav\n"
"statscraft db import --sqlite study.db --name work -s fromdb\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"statscraft db export survey.sav --sqlite study.db\n"
"statscraft db export -s demo --sqlite study.db --name work\n"
"statscraft plan -e \"RECODE satisfaction (9 = SYSMIS).\" --sqlite study.db --name survey --apply --actor demo\n"
"statscraft db import --sqlite study.db --name survey --out back.sav\n"
"statscraft db import --sqlite study.db --name work -s fromdb\n"
"```"

msgid "Writing and reading"
msgstr "写入和读取 {#writing-and-reading}"

msgid "Before writing, a preflight checks the column limit, identifiers, value sizes and the row size against the profile and the server's settings. SQLite refuses NaN and negative zero, which it cannot keep."
msgstr "写入前，预检会根据配置档和服务器设置检查列数上限、标识符、值的大小和行的大小。SQLite 拒绝 NaN 和负零，因为它无法保存这两种值。"

msgid "A failure leaves no table and no dataset row, only the failed operation and its diagnostic."
msgstr "失败时不会留下任何表或数据集行，只留下失败的操作及其诊断信息。"

msgid "The rows go in bulk inside the same transaction:"
msgstr "各行在同一事务中批量写入："

msgid "PostgreSQL takes them with `COPY` in the binary format;"
msgstr "PostgreSQL 通过二进制格式的 `COPY` 接收；"

msgid "MySQL and MariaDB in prepared multi-row INSERTs of at most 4 MiB, each within `max_allowed_packet`;"
msgstr "MySQL 和 MariaDB 使用预编译的多行 INSERT，每条最多 4 MiB，且不超过 `max_allowed_packet`；"

msgid "Dolt in multi-row INSERTs of literal values of at most 256 KiB, each within `max_allowed_packet`;"
msgstr "Dolt 使用由字面值组成的多行 INSERT，每条最多 256 KiB，且不超过 `max_allowed_packet`；"

msgid "SQLite through one prepared INSERT per case."
msgstr "SQLite 对每个个案使用一条预编译的 INSERT。"

msgid "Reading streams the rows from the server into the dataset instead of holding the whole result first."
msgstr "读取时，行从服务器以流的方式读入数据集，而不是先保存整个结果。"

msgid "Reading a dataset whose catalog holds items Statscraft cannot keep (dataset attributes, variable sets, write formats other than the print format) fails unless `--allow-loss` is given. The losses are then listed in the output."
msgstr "如果数据集的目录表中有 Statscraft 无法保留的项目（数据集属性、变量集、不同于打印格式的写入格式），读取会失败，除非指定了 `--allow-loss`。此时这些损失会在输出中列出。"

