msgid "New variables in `plan --apply`"
msgstr "`plan --apply` 中的新变量"

msgid "yes, in the same transaction"
msgstr "支持，在同一事务中"

msgid "no: `schema_change_not_atomic` before any change"
msgstr "不支持：在任何更改之前报 `schema_change_not_atomic`"

msgid "no: `schema_change_not_atomic`"
msgstr "不支持：`schema_change_not_atomic`"

msgid "MySQL, MariaDB and Dolt commit DDL implicitly. So `export` creates the table first, writes the rows and the catalog in one transaction, and drops the table again if that fails. A plan that would create a variable is refused before anything changes; create the column and its catalog variable in a separate step first."
msgstr "MySQL、MariaDB 和 Dolt 会隐式提交 DDL。因此 `export` 先创建表，然后在一个事务中写入行和目录表，如果失败则再删除该表。会创建变量的计划会在任何更改发生前被拒绝；请先单独一步创建该列及其目录表中的变量。"

msgid "The product is decided by what the server says about itself, not by the protocol: `--mysql` refuses a Dolt server, and `--dolt` refuses MySQL and MariaDB."
msgstr "数据库产品由服务器对自身的报告决定，而不是由协议决定：`--mysql` 拒绝 Dolt 服务器，`--dolt` 拒绝 MySQL 和 MariaDB。"

msgid "Statscraft never commits, branches, merges or resets."
msgstr "Statscraft 从不执行提交、创建分支、合并或重置。"

msgid "`db export` leaves its changes in the working set for you to commit."
msgstr "`db export` 将其更改留在工作集中，由您来提交。"

msgid "`db import` and the input schema of `plan` write nothing at all (OpenStatSpec's Database I/O Execution Policy v1, which `db capabilities` declares). Allowed losses are therefore reported in the output instead of in the catalog."
msgstr "`db import` 和 `plan` 的输入模式完全不写入任何内容（这是 OpenStatSpec 的 Database I/O Execution Policy v1，由 `db capabilities` 声明）。因此，允许的损失在输出中报告，而不是记入目录表。"

msgid "`plan --apply` needs `--expected-branch` and `--expected-head`. The session must be on that branch at that commit with a clean working set, and the branch must still point at that commit when the apply completes. The audit row records both, and the changes stay uncommitted."
msgstr "`plan --apply` 需要 `--expected-branch` 和 `--expected-head`。会话必须位于该分支的该提交上，且工作集干净；应用完成时，该分支必须仍指向该提交。审计行会记录这两项，而更改保持未提交状态。"

msgid "The session's branch is the database's default branch, or the one named as `db/branch` in the URL."
msgstr "会话所在的分支是数据库的默认分支，或者是 URL 中以 `db/branch` 形式指定的分支。"

msgid "Passwords and TLS"
msgstr "密码和 TLS {#passwords-and-tls}"

msgid "A URL without a password takes it from the `STATSCRAFT_DB_PASSWORD` environment variable. Passwords are never printed."
msgstr "不含密码的 URL 从环境变量 `STATSCRAFT_DB_PASSWORD` 获取密码。密码从不打印。"

msgid "Connections use plain TCP unless the URL asks for TLS. TLS always verifies the server's certificate chain, against the CA file when one is given and otherwise against the bundled Mozilla root certificates. It also checks the host name unless the mode says otherwise. Statscraft never makes an unverified TLS connection, and refuses the modes that fall back to plain TCP (`prefer`, `allow`, `PREFERRED`)."
msgstr "除非 URL 要求使用 TLS，否则连接使用普通 TCP。TLS 总会验证服务器的证书链：提供了 CA 文件时以该文件为准，否则以内置的 Mozilla 根证书为准。除非模式另有规定，它还会检查主机名。Statscraft 从不建立未经验证的 TLS 连接，并拒绝会退回到普通 TCP 的模式（`prefer`、`allow`、`PREFERRED`）。"

msgid ""
"```\n"
"statscraft db export survey.sav --postgres \"postgres://analyst@db.example.org/study?sslmode=verify-full\"\n"
"statscraft db export survey.sav --postgres \"postgres://analyst@10.0.0.5/study?sslmode=verify-ca&sslrootcert=/etc/ssl/study-ca.pem\"\n"
"statscraft db export survey.sav --mysql \"mysql://analyst@db.example.org/study?ssl-mode=VERIFY_IDENTITY&ssl-ca=/etc/ssl/study-ca.pem\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"statscraft db export survey.sav --postgres \"postgres://analyst@db.example.org/study?sslmode=verify-full\"\n"
"statscraft db export survey.sav --postgres \"postgres://analyst@10.0.0.5/study?sslmode=verify-ca&sslrootcert=/etc/ssl/study-ca.pem\"\n"
"statscraft db export survey.sav --mysql \"mysql://analyst@db.example.org/study?ssl-mode=VERIFY_IDENTITY&ssl-ca=/etc/ssl/study-ca.pem\"\n"
"```"

msgid "PostgreSQL `sslmode`"
msgstr "PostgreSQL `sslmode`"

msgid "MySQL, MariaDB, Dolt `ssl-mode`"
msgstr "MySQL、MariaDB、Dolt `ssl-mode`"

msgid "Connection"
msgstr "连接"

msgid "not given, `disable`"
msgstr "未指定、`disable`"

msgid "not given, `DISABLED`"
msgstr "未指定、`DISABLED`"

msgid "plain TCP"
msgstr "普通 TCP"

msgid "`verify-full`, `require`"
msgstr "`verify-full`, `require`"

msgid "`VERIFY_IDENTITY`, `REQUIRED`"
msgstr "`VERIFY_IDENTITY`, `REQUIRED`"

msgid "TLS; the certificate chain and the host name are checked"
msgstr "TLS；检查证书链和主机名"

msgid "`verify-ca`"
msgstr "`verify-ca`"

msgid "`VERIFY_CA`"
msgstr "`VERIFY_CA`"

msgid "TLS; the certificate chain is checked, the host name is not"
msgstr "TLS；检查证书链，不检查主机名"

msgid "`sslrootcert=FILE` (PostgreSQL) or `ssl-ca=FILE` (MySQL, MariaDB, Dolt) names a PEM file of the CA certificates to trust, for a server whose certificate comes from a private CA."
msgstr "`sslrootcert=FILE`（PostgreSQL）或 `ssl-ca=FILE`（MySQL、MariaDB、Dolt）指定一个 PEM 文件，其中包含要信任的 CA 证书，用于证书来自私有 CA 的服务器。"

msgid "A CA file without a mode means `verify-full`."
msgstr "只有 CA 文件而未指定模式时，等同于 `verify-full`。"

msgid "With a CA file, PostgreSQL trusts only that file; the MySQL client trusts the bundled roots as well."
msgstr "有 CA 文件时，PostgreSQL 只信任该文件；MySQL 客户端还会同时信任内置的根证书。"

msgid "`require` and `REQUIRED` always check the certificate chain and the host name."
msgstr "`require` 和 `REQUIRED` 始终检查证书链和主机名。"

msgid "Applying a plan in place"
msgstr "就地应用计划 {#applying-a-plan-in-place}"

msgid "`plan --name DATASET` with a database option takes the input schema from that dataset. With `--apply` it then applies the plan to the same table in one transaction: direct UPDATEs, `ALTER TABLE ... ADD COLUMN` for new variables, catalog updates and one audit row in `transformation_apply` (plan and source hashes, actor, operation count). Nothing is copied, and on any error nothing changes. `--actor` names who applies the plan (default `$USER`)."
msgstr "`plan --name DATASET` 与数据库选项一起使用时，从该数据集获取输入模式。加上 `--apply` 后，它会在一个事务中将计划应用到同一个表：直接执行 UPDATE，为新变量执行 `ALTER TABLE ... ADD COLUMN`，更新目录表，并在 `transformation_apply` 中写入一条审计行（计划哈希和源哈希、执行者、操作数）。不复制任何内容，出现任何错误时也不做任何更改。`--actor` 指定应用计划的人（默认为 `$USER`）。"

msgid "Statscraft is built so that an AI agent with a shell can do the analysis work: everything is syntax, every result is JSON, every error has a line and a column, and a session keeps the data between steps. This page says how an agent should work, and gives a block of instructions you can paste into your agent."
msgstr "Statscraft 的设计使拥有 shell 的 AI 智能体可以完成分析工作：一切都是语法，每个结果都是 JSON，每个错误都有行号和列号，会话在各步骤之间保留数据。本页说明智能体应如何工作，并提供一段可以粘贴到您的智能体中的指令。"

msgid "An agent app that runs MCP servers can use the same loop through tools instead of the shell: see [the MCP server](mcp.md). Run `statscraft connect` once to add it to the agents on your computer; [Connect your AI agent](connect.md) says what it changes and how to undo it."
msgstr "能运行 MCP 服务器的智能体应用可以通过工具而不是 shell 使用同样的循环：参见 [MCP 服务器](mcp.md)。运行一次 `statscraft connect`，即可将其添加到您计算机上的智能体中；[连接您的 AI 智能体](connect.md)说明了它会更改什么以及如何撤销。"

msgid "The loop"
msgstr "工作循环 {#the-loop}"

msgid "**Look at the data.** `statscraft describe FILE --json` gives the dictionary: variable names, types, labels, value labels, missing values, valid counts, the weight variable and multiple response sets. Read it before writing syntax, so names and codes are right."
msgstr "**查看数据。** `statscraft describe FILE --json` 给出数据字典：变量名、类型、标签、值标签、缺失值、有效计数、权重变量和多重响应集。编写语法前先阅读它，确保名称和代码正确。"

msgid "**Look up the syntax.** `statscraft help` lists the supported commands; `statscraft help COMMAND` gives the syntax, the rules and an example. Use only what the help shows. A command the help does not list fails with a clear error."
msgstr "**查阅语法。** `statscraft help` 列出支持的命令；`statscraft help COMMAND` 给出语法、规则和一个示例。只使用帮助中显示的内容。帮助中未列出的命令会失败，并给出清楚的错误。"

msgid "**Write syntax to a file** (`job.sps`), one command per line or block, each ending with a period."
msgstr "**将语法写入文件**（`job.sps`），每条命令占一行或一个块，每条都以句点结尾。"

msgid "**Check it.** `statscraft check -s NAME --json job.sps` parses every command and runs it on a copy of the session's data, so it finds unknown variables and type errors too, and writes nothing."
msgstr "**检查语法。** `statscraft check -s NAME --json job.sps` 解析每条命令，并在会话数据的副本上运行，因此还能发现未知变量和类型错误，而且不写入任何内容。"

msgid "**Run it in pieces.** `statscraft run -s NAME --json --lines FIRST-LAST job.sps` runs the commands in those lines and keeps the result in the session. The next range builds on it. Line numbers stay those of the file. The session keeps the data, settings, macros and named datasets between runs, as a window would ([sessions](command-line.md#sessions-and-line-ranges)). `statscraft describe -s NAME --json` shows the kept state under `session`."
msgstr "**分段运行。** `statscraft run -s NAME --json --lines FIRST-LAST job.sps` 运行这些行中的命令，并把结果保留在会话中。下一个范围在此基础上继续。行号仍为文件中的行号。会话在多次运行之间保留数据、设置、宏和命名数据集，就像窗口一样（[会话](command-line.md#sessions-and-line-ranges)）。`statscraft describe -s NAME --json` 在 `session` 下显示保留的状态。"

msgid "**Read the JSON.** `ok` says whether the run worked. `changes` names the variables added, changed and removed and the case counts before and after; `dataset` gives the size; `commands[].tables` holds the results with raw numbers; `commands[].charts` holds the charts a command made, each as its kind, labels and numbers; `commands[].warnings` says where a command did something other than asked."
msgstr "**读取 JSON。** `ok` 表示运行是否成功。`changes` 列出新增、更改和删除的变量，以及运行前后的个案数；`dataset` 给出数据集大小；`commands[].tables` 包含带原始数字的结果；`commands[].charts` 包含命令生成的图表，每个图表以其类型、标签和数字表示；`commands[].warnings` 指出命令在何处的行为与要求不同。"

msgid "**Fix errors where they point.** On failure `errors[]` gives `kind`, `message`, `line` and, for syntax errors, `column`, `expected` and often a `hint`. Fix that line and run the same range again. A failed run saves nothing, settings included, so a retry starts from the same state."
msgstr "**在错误指向的位置修正。** 失败时，`errors[]` 给出 `kind`、`message`、`line`，对于语法错误还给出 `column`、`expected`，通常还有 `hint`。修正那一行，然后再次运行同一范围。失败的运行不保存任何内容（包括设置），因此重试从相同状态开始。"

msgid "A short session:"
msgstr "一个简短的会话："

msgid ""
"```\n"
"statscraft describe survey.sav --json\n"
"statscraft help RECODE\n"
"statscraft check -s work --json job.sps\n"
"statscraft run -s work --json --lines 1-1 job.sps\n"
"statscraft run -s work --json --lines 4-6 job.sps\n"
"statscraft run -s work --json -e \"FREQUENCIES VARIABLES=age_group.\"\n"
"statscraft describe -s work --json\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"statscraft describe survey.sav --json\n"
"statscraft help RECODE\n"
"statscraft check -s work --json job.sps\n"
"statscraft run -s work --json --lines 1-1 job.sps\n"
"statscraft run -s work --json --lines 4-6 job.sps\n"
"statscraft run -s work --json -e \"FREQUENCIES VARIABLES=age_group.\"\n"
"statscraft describe -s work --json\n"
"```"

msgid "A syntax error tells the agent where and what:"
msgstr "语法错误会告诉智能体出错的位置和内容："

msgid "A misspelled command comes with a suggestion:"
msgstr "拼错的命令会附带建议："

msgid "See [the command line](command-line.md#json-output) for every field."
msgstr "所有字段参见[命令行](command-line.md#json-output)。"

msgid "Good habits:"
msgstr "良好习惯："

msgid "Use `--json` for every step and read the `ok` field first; the exit code is 0 on success and 1 on failure."
msgstr "每一步都使用 `--json`，并先读取 `ok` 字段；成功时退出代码为 0，失败时为 1。"

msgid "Keep the whole analysis in one `.sps` file and run it by line ranges, so the file is the record of what was done and runs again from the top with `statscraft run job.sps`."
msgstr "将整个分析放在一个 `.sps` 文件中，并按行范围运行，这样该文件就是所做工作的记录，还可以用 `statscraft run job.sps` 从头再次运行。"

msgid "Use a new session name for a fresh start, or delete `.statscraft/sessions/NAME/`."
msgstr "要重新开始，请使用新的会话名称，或删除 `.statscraft/sessions/NAME/`。"

msgid "Numbers in the JSON are raw. Round them only when you report them."
msgstr "JSON 中的数字是原始值。只在报告时再进行舍入。"

msgid "Add `--xlsx tables.xlsx` to a run when the person wants the tables in Excel."
msgstr "当用户需要 Excel 格式的表格时，在运行时添加 `--xlsx tables.xlsx`。"

msgid "To hand over the output itself, end the run with `OUTPUT SAVE OUTFILE='results.scout'.`: the person opens it in the window with File > Open output. A `.scout` file the person gives you is plain JSON: read it directly, each command with its syntax and tables ([output files](command-line.md#output-files)). To turn one into a workbook or web page, run `OUTPUT OPEN FILE='results.scout'.` and OUTPUT EXPORT."
msgstr "要交付输出本身，在运行的最后加上 `OUTPUT SAVE OUTFILE='results.scout'.`：用户可以在窗口中通过 File > Open output 打开它。用户交给您的 `.scout` 文件是纯 JSON：直接读取即可，其中每条命令都附有其语法和表格（[输出文件](command-line.md#output-files)）。要将其转换为工作簿或网页，请运行 `OUTPUT OPEN FILE='results.scout'.` 和 OUTPUT EXPORT。"

msgid "Add `--vega-lite` when you want to show a chart: every chart then carries a Vega-Lite specification with its numbers inline, ready for any Vega-Lite viewer. Do not draw charts from numbers you computed yourself."
msgstr "需要展示图表时添加 `--vega-lite`：这样每个图表都会附带一个 Vega-Lite 规范，数字内嵌其中，可直接用于任何 Vega-Lite 查看器。不要根据自己计算的数字绘制图表。"

msgid "Working in the open window"
msgstr "在打开的窗口中工作 {#working-in-the-open-window}"

msgid "When the person has the Statscraft window open, the agent can work in it instead of a file session: the session name `gui` sends the syntax to the window, which runs it like its own Run button. The person sees each table appear in the output window and each command in the log, and can keep working in the window between the agent's runs. [The live window session](command-line.md#the-live-window-session) says how it behaves."
msgstr "当用户打开了 Statscraft 窗口时，智能体可以在窗口中工作，而不使用文件会话：会话名称 `gui` 会把语法发送到窗口，窗口像点击自己的 Run 按钮一样运行它。用户会看到每个表格出现在输出窗口中，每条命令出现在日志中，并且可以在智能体的两次运行之间继续在窗口中工作。[实时窗口会话](command-line.md#the-live-window-session)说明了其工作方式。"

msgid "Because the person may also change the data in the window, the agent should run `statscraft describe -s gui --json` again before it relies on names or counts it saw earlier."
msgstr "由于用户也可能在窗口中更改数据，智能体在依赖先前看到的名称或计数之前，应再次运行 `statscraft describe -s gui --json`。"

msgid "Every run that works leaves its syntax in the window: it is added to a syntax window named Agent, under a comment line with the time (`* Agent 14:32.`). The window opens with the first run, and again after the person closes it. The person can read what was done, change it, run it with Ctrl+Enter and save it. A failed run adds nothing. `trail` in the JSON names the window. A file session does the same in `syntax.sps` in its folder, with the date in each comment line, and `trail` gives that file's path."
msgstr "每次成功的运行都会把其语法留在窗口中：语法被添加到名为 Agent 的语法窗口，位于一行带时间的注释之下（`* Agent 14:32.`）。该窗口在第一次运行时打开；用户关闭它后，下次运行时会再次打开。用户可以阅读所做的工作、修改它、按 Ctrl+Enter 运行并保存。失败的运行不添加任何内容。JSON 中的 `trail` 给出该窗口的名称。文件会话也会这样做，写入其文件夹中的 `syntax.sps`，每行注释带有日期，`trail` 给出该文件的路径。"

msgid "Through the MCP server an agent can also read, edit, run and save the person's syntax windows; see [the MCP server](mcp.md#syntax-windows). When the person asks to fix or explain their syntax, read the window, say what you would change, edit it there and run it from there, so the fix stays in their file."
msgstr "智能体还可以通过 MCP 服务器读取、编辑、运行和保存用户的语法窗口；参见 [MCP 服务器](mcp.md#syntax-windows)。当用户要求修正或解释其语法时，请读取该窗口，说明您打算如何修改，在窗口中编辑并从那里运行，这样修正会保留在用户的文件中。"

msgid "The window can hold several datasets and output documents at once. Under `session`, `describe` lists them as the person sees them: `active_dataset` is the dataset every command works on, `datasets` lists each open one with its size (a file opened from the window gets the name `DataSet1`, `DataSet2` and so on), `output_documents` lists the output documents, and `designated_output` is the one the next tables go to. Each command in a run's JSON names its document in `commands[].document`. To work on another dataset, run `DATASET ACTIVATE name.`; to send tables elsewhere, `OUTPUT NEW NAME=name.` or `OUTPUT ACTIVATE name.` A run from the agent waits while the window is busy, and runs after it."
msgstr "窗口可以同时包含多个数据集和输出文档。在 `session` 下，`describe` 按用户看到的样子列出它们：`active_dataset` 是所有命令作用的数据集，`datasets` 列出每个打开的数据集及其大小（从窗口打开的文件会得到名称 `DataSet1`、`DataSet2` 等），`output_documents` 列出输出文档，`designated_output` 是接收后续表格的文档。运行 JSON 中的每条命令都在 `commands[].document` 中给出其文档。要处理另一个数据集，请运行 `DATASET ACTIVATE name.`；要把表格发送到其他位置，请运行 `OUTPUT NEW NAME=name.` 或 `OUTPUT ACTIVATE name.`。窗口忙碌时，智能体发起的运行会等待，待窗口空闲后再运行。"

msgid "Instructions to paste into your agent"
msgstr "粘贴到智能体中的指令 {#instructions-to-paste-into-your-agent}"

msgid ""
"```text\n"
"You can analyze data with Statscraft, a statistics program driven by the established\n"
"statistics command syntax (COMPUTE, RECODE, FREQUENCIES, CTABLES and so on). Use the `statscraft` command line in the shell.\n"
"\n"
"- Start with `statscraft describe <file> --json` to learn the variables, labels and missing values.\n"
"- Look up syntax with `statscraft help` and `statscraft help <COMMAND>`. Use only commands and\n"
"  options that the help lists.\n"
"- Write the syntax to a .sps file. Before running, check it:\n"
"  `statscraft check -s work --json <file>.sps`.\n"
"- Run it in steps that keep the data between them:\n"
"  `statscraft run -s work --json --lines FIRST-LAST <file>.sps`, or\n"
"  `statscraft run -s work --json -e \"<syntax>\"` for a single command. The session keeps data,\n"
"  settings, macros and named datasets between runs; `statscraft describe -s work --json` shows them.\n"
"- Read the JSON. If \"ok\" is false, fix the line and column given in \"errors\" (use \"expected\" and\n"
"  \"hint\") and run the same lines again; a failed run changes nothing. Read \"warnings\" of every\n"
"  command and \"changes\" to confirm what happened to the data.\n"
"- If I have the Statscraft window open, use `-s gui` instead of `-s work`, so I see every result.\n"
"  Each run that works is added to the syntax window Agent there; with `-s work` it goes to\n"
"  `.statscraft/sessions/work/syntax.sps`. Tell me where (\"trail\" in the JSON).\n"
"- Do not write data files unless I ask; nothing is saved to disk without a SAVE command.\n"
"- Report numbers from the \"tables\" in the JSON; do not compute them yourself.\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"You can analyze data with Statscraft, a statistics program driven by the established\n"
"statistics command syntax (COMPUTE, RECODE, FREQUENCIES, CTABLES and so on). Use the `statscraft` command line in the shell.\n"
"\n"
"- Start with `statscraft describe <file> --json` to learn the variables, labels and missing values.\n"
"- Look up syntax with `statscraft help` and `statscraft help <COMMAND>`. Use only commands and\n"
"  options that the help lists.\n"
"- Write the syntax to a .sps file. Before running, check it:\n"
"  `statscraft check -s work --json <file>.sps`.\n"
"- Run it in steps that keep the data between them:\n"
"  `statscraft run -s work --json --lines FIRST-LAST <file>.sps`, or\n"
"  `statscraft run -s work --json -e \"<syntax>\"` for a single command. The session keeps data,\n"
"  settings, macros and named datasets between runs; `statscraft describe -s work --json` shows them.\n"
"- Read the JSON. If \"ok\" is false, fix the line and column given in \"errors\" (use \"expected\" and\n"
"  \"hint\") and run the same lines again; a failed run changes nothing. Read \"warnings\" of every\n"
"  command and \"changes\" to confirm what happened to the data.\n"
"- If I have the Statscraft window open, use `-s gui` instead of `-s work`, so I see every result.\n"
"  Each run that works is added to the syntax window Agent there; with `-s work` it goes to\n"
"  `.statscraft/sessions/work/syntax.sps`. Tell me where (\"trail\" in the JSON).\n"
"- Do not write data files unless I ask; nothing is saved to disk without a SAVE command.\n"
"- Report numbers from the \"tables\" in the JSON; do not compute them yourself.\n"
"```"

msgid "Safety of the live session"
msgstr "实时会话的安全性 {#safety-of-the-live-session}"

msgid "The window accepts syntax only from programs of the same user on the same computer:"
msgstr "窗口只接受同一台计算机上同一用户的程序发送的语法："

msgid "It listens on a random TCP port of `127.0.0.1` only, so other computers cannot reach it."
msgstr "它只在 `127.0.0.1` 的一个随机 TCP 端口上监听，因此其他计算机无法访问它。"

msgid "At start it creates a random token and writes the address and the token to `statscraft/gui.json` in `$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR` on Linux, `%LOCALAPPDATA%` on Windows, or `~/.config` otherwise. The file is readable only by the user."
msgstr "启动时，它会生成一个随机令牌，并把地址和令牌写入 `statscraft/gui.json`，该文件在 Linux 上位于 `$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR`，在 Windows 上位于 `%LOCALAPPDATA%`，其他系统上位于 `~/.config`。该文件只有该用户可以读取。"

msgid "Every request must carry that token; a request without it is refused. The command line reads the token from the file and sends it only to a loopback address."
msgstr "每个请求都必须携带该令牌；不带令牌的请求会被拒绝。命令行从该文件读取令牌，并只将其发送到回环地址。"

msgid "Requests larger than 64 MB are refused."
msgstr "大于 64 MB 的请求会被拒绝。"

msgid "When the window closes, it removes its file."
msgstr "窗口关闭时，会删除它的文件。"

msgid "What this means in practice: any program running as you can drive the window, just as it could run `statscraft` itself. Syntax sent to the window can do what syntax can do: read files, and write files with `SAVE` or `AGGREGATE OUTFILE`. The same connection lets a program read and change the text of your syntax windows, open .sps files in new ones, and save a syntax window to a file; saving does not replace another existing file unless the request says so. Treat an agent that can use `-s gui` like an agent that can run commands in your shell."
msgstr "这在实际中意味着：任何以您的身份运行的程序都可以驱动窗口，正如它也可以直接运行 `statscraft` 一样。发送到窗口的语法可以做语法能做的一切：读取文件，以及用 `SAVE` 或 `AGGREGATE OUTFILE` 写入文件。同一连接还允许程序读取和更改您语法窗口中的文本、在新窗口中打开 .sps 文件，以及将语法窗口保存到文件；除非请求明确要求，保存不会覆盖另一个已存在的文件。请像对待能在您的 shell 中运行命令的智能体一样，对待能使用 `-s gui` 的智能体。"

msgid "Statscraft has an MCP server built in: `statscraft mcp`. An AI agent that speaks MCP can then look at your data, look up syntax and run it through Statscraft, without a shell. Your data stay on your computer."
msgstr "Statscraft 内置了 MCP 服务器：`statscraft mcp`。支持 MCP 的 AI 智能体可以借此查看您的数据、查阅语法，并通过 Statscraft 运行语法，无需 shell。您的数据始终留在您的计算机上。"

msgid "From the window: Edit > Settings > AI agents"
msgstr "从窗口连接：Edit > Settings > AI agents {#from-the-window-edit--settings--ai-agents}"

msgid "The easiest way needs no terminal. In the Statscraft window, open **Edit > Settings...** and choose **AI agents**. It lists every supported agent app with its state: not installed, not connected, connected, or connected to another Statscraft copy (an older install in another folder, for example)."
msgstr "最简单的方法无需终端。在 Statscraft 窗口中打开 **Edit > Settings...**，然后选择 **AI agents**。这里列出所有受支持的智能体应用及其状态：未安装、未连接、已连接，或已连接到另一份 Statscraft（例如另一个文件夹中的旧安装）。"

msgid "**Claude Desktop**: **Install extension** downloads the Statscraft extension (`.mcpb`) of this version for your system from the release, checks it against the release's `SHA256SUMS`, saves it in your Downloads folder and opens it. Claude Desktop then shows the extension; click **Install**. This is the way that lasts: the extension does not depend on Claude Desktop's settings file, which some versions rewrite or empty when they start or update. If nothing opens, drag the saved file onto Claude Desktop's **Settings**, **Extensions**. **Connect via config file** writes the entry into the settings file instead, as `statscraft connect` does."
msgstr "**Claude Desktop**：**Install extension** 从发布版本中下载适合您系统的本版本 Statscraft 扩展（`.mcpb`），用该版本的 `SHA256SUMS` 进行校验，保存到您的“下载”文件夹并打开它。Claude Desktop 随后显示该扩展；点击 **Install**。这是最持久的方式：扩展不依赖 Claude Desktop 的设置文件，而某些版本的 Claude Desktop 在启动或更新时会重写或清空该文件。如果没有任何东西打开，请把保存的文件拖到 Claude Desktop 的 **Settings**、**Extensions** 上。**Connect via config file** 则改为把条目写入设置文件，与 `statscraft connect` 的做法相同。"

msgid "**Connect** adds Statscraft to one of the other apps, **Remove** takes it out again, and **Connect all** connects every installed app that does not have it yet, except Claude Desktop."
msgstr "**Connect** 把 Statscraft 添加到其他某个应用中，**Remove** 将其再次移除，**Connect all** 连接所有尚未添加 Statscraft 的已安装应用，Claude Desktop 除外。"

msgid "**Check** reads the app's settings files again and shows each path and whether the Statscraft entry is in it right now. Use it after restarting an app, to see whether the app kept the entry."
msgstr "**Check** 重新读取应用的设置文件，显示每个路径，以及 Statscraft 条目此刻是否在其中。请在重启应用后使用它，查看应用是否保留了该条目。"

msgid "After each change the section says which files it wrote and what to restart, for example to quit Claude Desktop completely and open it again. If Claude Desktop was running during the change, it says so: quit Claude Desktop completely and connect again, because a running Claude Desktop may write its settings file back without the entry."
msgstr "每次更改后，该部分会说明写入了哪些文件以及需要重启什么，例如完全退出 Claude Desktop 后再重新打开。如果更改时 Claude Desktop 正在运行，该部分也会提示：请完全退出 Claude Desktop 并重新连接，因为正在运行的 Claude Desktop 可能会把不含该条目的设置文件写回去。"

msgid "The entry starts the `statscraft` command-line program that came with the window, from the same folder (on macOS, the folder that holds Statscraft.app). If that program is missing there, the section says so, and only **Install extension** works."
msgstr "该条目启动随窗口一起提供的 `statscraft` 命令行程序，位于同一文件夹中（在 macOS 上，是包含 Statscraft.app 的文件夹）。如果该程序不在那里，该部分会提示，此时只有 **Install extension** 可用。"

msgid "Apart from the extension, the section makes exactly the changes `statscraft connect` makes, described below."
msgstr "除扩展外，该部分所做的更改与 `statscraft connect` 完全相同，详见下文。"

msgid "From a terminal: statscraft connect"
msgstr "从终端连接：statscraft connect {#from-a-terminal-statscraft-connect}"

msgid "One command adds the server to every agent installed on your computer:"
msgstr "一条命令即可把服务器添加到您计算机上安装的所有智能体："

msgid "It prints which agents it found, connects each of them and says what to restart. Run it again at any time: an agent that is already connected stays as it is. If Claude Desktop is running while its settings file changes, `connect` warns you: quit Claude Desktop completely and run the command again."
msgstr "它会列出找到的智能体，逐一连接，并说明需要重启什么。可以随时再次运行：已连接的智能体保持不变。如果在设置文件更改时 Claude Desktop 正在运行，`connect` 会发出警告：请完全退出 Claude Desktop，然后再次运行该命令。"

msgid "Claude Desktop and Claude Code have a way without a terminal too: [the bundle](#claude-desktop-double-click-the-bundle) and [the plugin](#claude-code-the-plugin). To teach an agent how to work with Statscraft, add [the skill](#teach-your-agent-the-skill)."
msgstr "Claude Desktop 和 Claude Code 也有无需终端的方式：[MCP 包](#claude-desktop-double-click-the-bundle)和[插件](#claude-code-the-plugin)。要教智能体如何使用 Statscraft，请添加[技能](#teach-your-agent-the-skill)。"

msgid "The commands"
msgstr "命令 {#the-commands}"

msgid "`statscraft connect`"
msgstr "`statscraft connect`"

msgid "connects every agent it finds"
msgstr "连接找到的所有智能体"

msgid "`statscraft connect AGENT`"
msgstr "`statscraft connect AGENT`"

msgid "connects one agent"
msgstr "连接一个智能体"

msgid "`statscraft connect --list`"
msgstr "`statscraft connect --list`"

msgid "shows which agents are installed and connected, and changes nothing"
msgstr "显示哪些智能体已安装、已连接，不做任何更改"

msgid "`statscraft connect --remove`"
msgstr "`statscraft connect --remove`"

msgid "takes Statscraft out of every agent that has it"
msgstr "从所有包含 Statscraft 的智能体中移除它"

msgid "`statscraft connect --remove AGENT`"
msgstr "`statscraft connect --remove AGENT`"

msgid "takes it out of one agent"
msgstr "从一个智能体中移除它"

msgid "Add `--json` to any of them for output an agent can read. The exit code is 1 when an agent could not be connected."
msgstr "在任一命令后加上 `--json`，即可得到智能体能读取的输出。当某个智能体无法连接时，退出代码为 1。"

msgid "The agents are `claude-desktop`, `claude-code`, `codex` (also `chatgpt`, for the Codex view of the ChatGPT app), `cursor`, `copilot` (also `vscode`), `gemini` and `antigravity`. On Windows, agents inside WSL have ids such as `codex-wsl:Ubuntu`; `--list` shows them (see [Agents inside WSL](#agents-inside-wsl))."
msgstr "智能体为 `claude-desktop`、`claude-code`、`codex`（也可写作 `chatgpt`，指 ChatGPT 应用的 Codex 视图）、`cursor`、`copilot`（也可写作 `vscode`）、`gemini` 和 `antigravity`。在 Windows 上，WSL 中的智能体有 `codex-wsl:Ubuntu` 这样的 id；`--list` 会显示它们（参见 [WSL 中的智能体](#agents-inside-wsl)）。"

msgid "What it changes"
msgstr "它会更改什么 {#what-it-changes}"

msgid "Every agent gets one entry named `statscraft`. It starts the Statscraft program you ran `connect` with, by its full path, with the argument `mcp`. No shell is involved, and nothing depends on PATH. If you move or reinstall Statscraft in another folder, run `statscraft connect` again."
msgstr "每个智能体都会得到一个名为 `statscraft` 的条目。该条目通过完整路径启动您运行 `connect` 时所用的 Statscraft 程序，参数为 `mcp`。不经过 shell，也不依赖 PATH。如果您把 Statscraft 移动或重新安装到另一个文件夹，请再次运行 `statscraft connect`。"

msgid "Agent"
msgstr "智能体"

msgid "What changes"
msgstr "更改内容"

msgid "Claude Desktop"
msgstr "Claude Desktop"

msgid "`mcpServers.statscraft` in `claude_desktop_config.json`: on Windows in `%APPDATA%\\Claude\\` and, for the Store version, in `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Packages\\Claude_...\\LocalCache\\Roaming\\Claude\\`; on macOS in `~/Library/Application Support/Claude/`; on Linux in `~/.config/Claude/`"
msgstr "`claude_desktop_config.json` 中的 `mcpServers.statscraft`：在 Windows 上位于 `%APPDATA%\\Claude\\`，应用商店版本位于 `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Packages\\Claude_...\\LocalCache\\Roaming\\Claude\\`；在 macOS 上位于 `~/Library/Application Support/Claude/`；在 Linux 上位于 `~/.config/Claude/`"

msgid "Claude Code"
msgstr "Claude Code"

msgid "runs `claude mcp add --scope user statscraft -- PATH mcp`, so Claude Code keeps the entry itself"
msgstr "运行 `claude mcp add --scope user statscraft -- PATH mcp`，由 Claude Code 自己保存该条目"

msgid "Codex, also the Codex view of the ChatGPT app"
msgstr "Codex，以及 ChatGPT 应用的 Codex 视图"

msgid "the table `[mcp_servers.statscraft]` in `~/.codex/config.toml` (or under `CODEX_HOME`)"
msgstr "`~/.codex/config.toml`（或 `CODEX_HOME` 下）中的表 `[mcp_servers.statscraft]`"

msgid "Cursor"
msgstr "Cursor"

msgid "`mcpServers.statscraft` in `~/.cursor/mcp.json`"
msgstr "`~/.cursor/mcp.json` 中的 `mcpServers.statscraft`"

msgid "VS Code with Copilot"
msgstr "VS Code（配合 Copilot）"

msgid "`mcpServers.statscraft` in `~/.copilot/mcp-config.json` (or under `COPILOT_HOME`)"
msgstr "`~/.copilot/mcp-config.json`（或 `COPILOT_HOME` 下）中的 `mcpServers.statscraft`"

msgid "Gemini CLI"
msgstr "Gemini CLI"

msgid "`mcpServers.statscraft` in `~/.gemini/settings.json`"
msgstr "`~/.gemini/settings.json` 中的 `mcpServers.statscraft`"

msgid "Antigravity"
msgstr "Antigravity"

msgid "`mcpServers.statscraft` in `~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json`"
msgstr "`~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json` 中的 `mcpServers.statscraft`"

msgid "On Windows, `~` is your user folder, for example `C:\\Users\\anna`."
msgstr "在 Windows 上，`~` 是您的用户文件夹，例如 `C:\\Users\\anna`。"

msgid "How the files are treated:"
msgstr "文件的处理方式："

msgid "Only the `statscraft` entry changes. Every other setting and every other server stays, in the same order, with the same indentation and line endings. Comments in `config.toml` stay too."
msgstr "只更改 `statscraft` 条目。其他所有设置和其他所有服务器都保持不变，顺序、缩进和换行符也都不变。`config.toml` 中的注释同样保留。"

msgid "Before the first change of a file, a copy of it is saved next to it as `FILE.statscraft-backup`. Later changes keep that first copy."
msgstr "首次更改某个文件之前，会在它旁边保存一份副本，名为 `FILE.statscraft-backup`。之后的更改保留这第一份副本。"

msgid "A file is written to a temporary file first and then put in place, so an agent never reads half a file."
msgstr "文件先写入一个临时文件，然后再放到原位，因此智能体绝不会读到只写了一半的文件。"

msgid "A file that is not plain JSON, for example one with comments, is not touched. You get a message that names it, and you can add the entry by hand as shown below."
msgstr "不是纯 JSON 的文件（例如带注释的文件）不会被改动。您会收到一条指明该文件的消息，并可以按下文所示手动添加条目。"

msgid "An agent counts as installed when its settings folder exists (for Claude Code: when the `claude` command is on PATH). A missing settings file is created only for an installed agent."
msgstr "当智能体的设置文件夹存在时（对 Claude Code 而言：当 `claude` 命令在 PATH 上时），即视为该智能体已安装。缺失的设置文件只会为已安装的智能体创建。"

msgid "Agents inside WSL"
msgstr "WSL 中的智能体 {#agents-inside-wsl}"

msgid "On Windows, many people run their AI agents inside WSL (the Windows Subsystem for Linux): Claude Code, Codex or Gemini CLI installed in Ubuntu, for example, or the ChatGPT app with Codex set to run in WSL. Such an agent reads its settings from the Linux home folder, not from `C:\\Users\\NAME`. Statscraft installed on Windows connects these agents too, so they use the Windows program and see the open Statscraft window."
msgstr "在 Windows 上，很多人在 WSL（Windows Subsystem for Linux，适用于 Linux 的 Windows 子系统）中运行 AI 智能体：例如安装在 Ubuntu 中的 Claude Code、Codex 或 Gemini CLI，或者把 Codex 设置为在 WSL 中运行的 ChatGPT 应用。这样的智能体从 Linux 主文件夹读取设置，而不是从 `C:\\Users\\NAME` 读取。安装在 Windows 上的 Statscraft 也能连接这些智能体，使它们使用 Windows 程序，并能看到打开的 Statscraft 窗口。"

msgid "The window and `statscraft connect` ask WSL which distributions it has (Docker Desktop's own are left out) and look in each one's home folder. Every agent found there gets its own row, named after the distribution, such as **Codex (WSL: Ubuntu)**, with the id `codex-wsl:Ubuntu` on the command line. Rows appear only for agents that are installed there. WSL may need a few seconds to start the first time; the window says so while it waits, and gives up on a distribution that does not answer in 30 seconds."
msgstr "窗口和 `statscraft connect` 会询问 WSL 有哪些发行版（Docker Desktop 自带的发行版除外），并在每个发行版的主文件夹中查找。在那里找到的每个智能体都有自己的一行，以发行版命名，例如 **Codex (WSL: Ubuntu)**，在命令行中的 id 为 `codex-wsl:Ubuntu`。只有在那里安装了的智能体才会出现对应的行。WSL 首次启动可能需要几秒钟；等待期间窗口会给出提示，若某个发行版 30 秒内没有响应，就放弃该发行版。"

msgid "Agent inside WSL"
msgstr "WSL 中的智能体"

msgid "Codex, also the ChatGPT app's Codex in WSL mode"
msgstr "Codex，以及 WSL 模式下 ChatGPT 应用的 Codex"

msgid "`[mcp_servers.statscraft]` in `~/.codex/config.toml` of the Linux home (`CODEX_HOME` set inside Linux is not seen from Windows)"
msgstr "Linux 主文件夹中 `~/.codex/config.toml` 里的 `[mcp_servers.statscraft]`（在 Linux 中设置的 `CODEX_HOME` 在 Windows 上看不到）"

msgid "`mcpServers.statscraft` in `~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json`, when that folder exists"
msgstr "`~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json` 中的 `mcpServers.statscraft`，前提是该文件夹存在"

msgid "runs `claude mcp add --scope user statscraft -e ... -- PATH mcp` inside the distribution, in a login shell, when `claude` is found there"
msgstr "在发行版内的登录 shell 中运行 `claude mcp add --scope user statscraft -e ... -- PATH mcp`，前提是在那里能找到 `claude`"

msgid "What the entry holds:"
msgstr "条目包含的内容："

msgid "The command is the Windows program as Linux sees it, for example `/mnt/c/Users/anna/AppData/Local/Programs/Statscraft/statscraft.exe`. WSL starts Windows programs from Linux, so the agent talks to the Windows Statscraft, which knows the open window."
msgstr "命令是 Linux 所看到的 Windows 程序，例如 `/mnt/c/Users/anna/AppData/Local/Programs/Statscraft/statscraft.exe`。WSL 可以从 Linux 启动 Windows 程序，因此智能体与 Windows 上的 Statscraft 通信，而后者了解打开的窗口。"

msgid "`env` sets `STATSCRAFT_WSL_DISTRO` to the distribution's name and `WSLENV=STATSCRAFT_WSL_DISTRO`. `WSLENV` tells WSL to hand that variable to the Windows program, which then knows that the agent gives Linux paths."
msgstr "`env` 把 `STATSCRAFT_WSL_DISTRO` 设为发行版的名称，并设置 `WSLENV=STATSCRAFT_WSL_DISTRO`。`WSLENV` 让 WSL 把该变量传给 Windows 程序，Windows 程序由此得知智能体给出的是 Linux 路径。"

msgid "The files are reached from Windows through `\\\\wsl$\\DISTRO\\home\\NAME`. They are merged, backed up and written the same way as on Windows, and a new file gets Linux line endings."
msgstr "Windows 通过 `\\\\wsl$\\DISTRO\\home\\NAME` 访问这些文件。它们的合并、备份和写入方式与 Windows 上相同，新建的文件使用 Linux 换行符。"

msgid "By hand, for Codex inside WSL:"
msgstr "手动为 WSL 中的 Codex 添加："

msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[mcp_servers.statscraft]\n"
"command = \"/mnt/c/Users/anna/AppData/Local/Programs/Statscraft/statscraft.exe\"\n"
"args = [\"mcp\"]\n"
"env = { STATSCRAFT_WSL_DISTRO = \"Ubuntu\", WSLENV = \"STATSCRAFT_WSL_DISTRO\" }\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```toml\n"
"[mcp_servers.statscraft]\n"
"command = \"/mnt/c/Users/anna/AppData/Local/Programs/Statscraft/statscraft.exe\"\n"
"args = [\"mcp\"]\n"
"env = { STATSCRAFT_WSL_DISTRO = \"Ubuntu\", WSLENV = \"STATSCRAFT_WSL_DISTRO\" }\n"
"```"

msgid "and for Claude Code inside WSL, in its terminal:"
msgstr "为 WSL 中的 Claude Code 添加，在其终端中运行："

msgid "Restart the agent as below: start a new Claude Code or Gemini CLI session in WSL, or quit the ChatGPT app and open it again."
msgstr "然后按下文所述重启智能体：在 WSL 中启动新的 Claude Code 或 Gemini CLI 会话，或者退出 ChatGPT 应用后重新打开。"

msgid "Paths: the agent works with Linux paths, the server with Windows paths."
msgstr "路径：智能体使用 Linux 路径，服务器使用 Windows 路径。"

msgid "In tool arguments (`file`, `folder`, `xlsx`, the path of `open_syntax_file` and `save_syntax`), Linux paths work: `/mnt/c/data/survey.sav` becomes `C:\\data\\survey.sav`, and a path inside Linux, such as `/home/anna/survey.sav`, becomes `\\\\wsl$\\Ubuntu\\home\\anna\\survey.sav`."
msgstr "在工具参数中（`file`、`folder`、`xlsx`，以及 `open_syntax_file` 和 `save_syntax` 的路径），可以使用 Linux 路径：`/mnt/c/data/survey.sav` 会变成 `C:\\data\\survey.sav`，Linux 内部的路径（例如 `/home/anna/survey.sav`）会变成 `\\\\wsl$\\Ubuntu\\home\\anna\\survey.sav`。"

msgid "File names inside the syntax (GET FILE, SAVE and the others) are not changed. Write them as Windows paths: `GET FILE='C:\\data\\survey.sav'.` `window_status` gives `platform` and `wsl_distro`, so the agent can tell."
msgstr "语法中的文件名（GET FILE、SAVE 等）不会被转换。请把它们写成 Windows 路径：`GET FILE='C:\\data\\survey.sav'.` `window_status` 会给出 `platform` 和 `wsl_distro`，供智能体判断。"

msgid "Where a run kept its syntax (`trail`) and the workbook it wrote come back in both forms: `trail_wsl` and `xlsx_wsl` hold the Linux path."
msgstr "运行保存其语法的位置（`trail`）和它写出的工作簿以两种形式返回：`trail_wsl` 和 `xlsx_wsl` 中是 Linux 路径。"

msgid "If `claude` is not found inside WSL although it is installed, its folder is probably added to PATH only in `~/.bashrc`; add the entry by hand as above."
msgstr "如果 `claude` 已安装但在 WSL 中找不到，很可能是它的文件夹只在 `~/.bashrc` 中加入了 PATH；请按上文手动添加条目。"

msgid "Restart the agent"
msgstr "重启智能体 {#restart-the-agent}"

msgid "An agent reads its settings when it starts. After connecting:"
msgstr "智能体在启动时读取设置。连接之后："

msgid "What to do"
msgstr "操作"

msgid "quit it completely, also from the tray or menu bar, and open it again; closing the window is not enough"
msgstr "完全退出（也要从系统托盘或菜单栏退出），然后重新打开；仅关闭窗口是不够的"

msgid "start a new session"
msgstr "启动新会话"

msgid "Codex, the ChatGPT app"
msgstr "Codex，ChatGPT 应用"

msgid "quit and open it again"
msgstr "退出后重新打开"

msgid "Cursor, VS Code, Antigravity"
msgstr "Cursor, VS Code, Antigravity"

msgid "Then ask the agent what tools Statscraft gives it, or ask it to describe a data file."
msgstr "然后问智能体 Statscraft 为它提供了哪些工具，或者让它描述一个数据文件。"

msgid "If the agent does not see Statscraft"
msgstr "如果智能体看不到 Statscraft {#if-the-agent-does-not-see-statscraft}"

msgid "**Claude Desktop** reads its settings only when it starts. On Windows, check that no Claude process is left after you quit (`Get-Process claude` in PowerShell shows nothing), then open it again. Statscraft is listed under Settings > Desktop app > Extensions, in **Local MCP servers**; a bundle you installed shows above it, under Extensions. Claude Desktop logs each server's start in `mcp-server-statscraft.log`: on Windows in `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Claude\\logs`, on macOS in `~/Library/Logs/Claude`."
msgstr "**Claude Desktop** 只在启动时读取设置。在 Windows 上，请确认退出后没有残留的 Claude 进程（在 PowerShell 中运行 `Get-Process claude` 没有任何输出），然后重新打开。Statscraft 列在 Settings > Desktop app > Extensions 下的 **Local MCP servers** 中；您安装的 MCP 包显示在它上方的 Extensions 下。Claude Desktop 会把每个服务器的启动记录在 `mcp-server-statscraft.log` 中：在 Windows 上位于 `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Claude\\logs`，在 macOS 上位于 `~/Library/Logs/Claude`。"

msgid "**The ChatGPT app** uses local tools only in its Codex view, not in ordinary chats. Quit the app completely, open it again and ask in the Codex view."
msgstr "**ChatGPT 应用**只在其 Codex 视图中使用本地工具，在普通对话中不使用。请完全退出该应用，重新打开，然后在 Codex 视图中提问。"

msgid "To see whether the server itself starts, run `statscraft mcp` in a terminal: it waits for an agent's messages on its input; Ctrl+C ends it."
msgstr "要查看服务器本身能否启动，请在终端中运行 `statscraft mcp`：它会在输入端等待智能体的消息；按 Ctrl+C 结束。"

msgid "In the ChatGPT app, the tools work in its Codex view only. Ordinary ChatGPT chats cannot use tools that run on your computer, even when the app's settings list the Statscraft server."
msgstr "在 ChatGPT 应用中，这些工具只在 Codex 视图中可用。普通 ChatGPT 对话无法使用在您计算机上运行的工具，即使应用的设置中列出了 Statscraft 服务器。"

msgid "Undo"
msgstr "撤销 {#undo}"

msgid "**Remove** in the window, or `statscraft connect --remove`, takes the `statscraft` entry out again and leaves everything else as it is. To go back to the file exactly as it was before the first change, put the `.statscraft-backup` copy back in its place. Settings you changed in the meantime are then lost too."
msgstr "在窗口中点击 **Remove**，或运行 `statscraft connect --remove`，都会再次移除 `statscraft` 条目，其他一切保持原样。若要让文件恢复到首次更改之前的原样，请把 `.statscraft-backup` 副本放回原位。这样一来，您在此期间更改的设置也会丢失。"

msgid "Claude Desktop: double-click the bundle"
msgstr "Claude Desktop：双击 MCP 包 {#claude-desktop-double-click-the-bundle}"

msgid "Every release has an MCP bundle for each system on the [Releases page](https://github.com/statscrafthq/statscraft/releases):"
msgstr "每个发布版本都在 [Releases 页面](https://github.com/statscrafthq/statscraft/releases)上为每个系统提供一个 MCP 包："

msgid "`statscraft-X-windows-x86_64.mcpb` for Windows"
msgstr "`statscraft-X-windows-x86_64.mcpb` 适用于 Windows"

msgid "`statscraft-X-macos-universal.mcpb` for macOS, Apple silicon and Intel"
msgstr "`statscraft-X-macos-universal.mcpb` 适用于 macOS，包括 Apple 芯片和 Intel"

msgid "`statscraft-X-linux-x86_64.mcpb` for Linux"
msgstr "`statscraft-X-linux-x86_64.mcpb` 适用于 Linux"

msgid "In the window, **Install extension** under Edit > Settings > AI agents does this for you. By hand: download the one for your system and double-click it, or drag it onto Claude Desktop's **Settings**, **Extensions**. Claude Desktop shows the tools Statscraft gives and asks you to install it. That is all: no terminal and no settings file."
msgstr "在窗口中，Edit > Settings > AI agents 下的 **Install extension** 会替您完成这一步。手动方式：下载适合您系统的包并双击它，或者把它拖到 Claude Desktop 的 **Settings**、**Extensions** 上。Claude Desktop 会显示 Statscraft 提供的工具，并请您安装。就这么简单：无需终端，也无需设置文件。"

msgid "The bundle carries its own copy of the `statscraft` program, so it works even where Statscraft is not installed. That copy does not update with `statscraft update`; install the bundle of the new release instead. The window, when you have it, still shows everything the agent runs."
msgstr "MCP 包自带一份 `statscraft` 程序，因此即使在没有安装 Statscraft 的地方也能工作。这份程序不会随 `statscraft update` 更新；请改为安装新版本的 MCP 包。如果您有窗口，窗口仍会显示智能体运行的一切。"

msgid "Known limits: the macOS program is not signed, so macOS may stop it; if Claude Desktop says the extension cannot start, use `statscraft connect` instead. Claude Desktop for Linux is a beta."
msgstr "已知限制：macOS 程序未签名，因此 macOS 可能会阻止它；如果 Claude Desktop 提示扩展无法启动，请改用 `statscraft connect`。Linux 版 Claude Desktop 仍是测试版。"

msgid "Claude Code: the plugin"
msgstr "Claude Code：插件 {#claude-code-the-plugin}"

msgid "In Claude Code, type:"
msgstr "在 Claude Code 中输入："

msgid "and start a new session. The plugin adds the MCP server and [the skill](#teach-your-agent-the-skill). It starts the server as `statscraft mcp`, so `statscraft` must be on your PATH. The Windows installer, the .deb package and the Linux tarball put it there; the portable Windows .zip and the macOS download do not, until you add it as [Install and update](install.md) shows. Check with `statscraft --version` in a new terminal. Without PATH, run `statscraft connect claude-code` with the full path of the program: the skill from the plugin still works with that entry."
msgstr "然后启动新会话。该插件会添加 MCP 服务器和[技能](#teach-your-agent-the-skill)。它以 `statscraft mcp` 启动服务器，因此 `statscraft` 必须在您的 PATH 上。Windows 安装程序、.deb 软件包和 Linux tar 压缩包会把它加入 PATH；Windows 便携版 .zip 和 macOS 下载版不会，需要您按[安装与更新](install.md)中的说明自行添加。请在新终端中运行 `statscraft --version` 检查。如果不在 PATH 上，请用程序的完整路径运行 `statscraft connect claude-code`：插件中的技能在该条目下仍然有效。"

msgid "If Claude Code was connected with `statscraft connect` before, it now has the server twice. `statscraft connect --remove claude-code` takes out the older entry."
msgstr "如果 Claude Code 之前已用 `statscraft connect` 连接过，现在它就有两个服务器条目。`statscraft connect --remove claude-code` 会移除较早的那个条目。"

msgid "Teach your agent: the skill"
msgstr "教会您的智能体：技能 {#teach-your-agent-the-skill}"

msgid "The skill `statscraft-analysis` tells an agent how to work with Statscraft: look at the data first, look up each command, check, run in small steps, read every reply, report the numbers from the result tables and never compute them itself, and write no file unless asked. It follows the [Agent Skills](https://agentskills.io) format, so many agent apps read it. It is one folder with one `SKILL.md`, in [`plugins/statscraft/skills/statscraft-analysis`](https://github.com/statscrafthq/statscraft/tree/main/plugins/statscraft/skills/statscraft-analysis) of the repository."
msgstr "技能 `statscraft-analysis` 告诉智能体如何使用 Statscraft：先查看数据，查阅每条命令，先检查，分小步运行，阅读每条回复，报告结果表格中的数字而绝不自行计算，除非被要求否则不写任何文件。它采用 [Agent Skills](https://agentskills.io) 格式，因此许多智能体应用都能读取。它是一个文件夹，内含一个 `SKILL.md`，位于代码仓库的 [`plugins/statscraft/skills/statscraft-analysis`](https://github.com/statscrafthq/statscraft/tree/main/plugins/statscraft/skills/statscraft-analysis) 中。"

msgid "**Claude Code**: it comes with the plugin."
msgstr "**Claude Code**：随插件一起提供。"

msgid "**Claude Desktop and claude.ai**: download `statscraft-X-skill.zip` from the [Releases page](https://github.com/statscrafthq/statscraft/releases) and upload it as a skill in the settings."
msgstr "**Claude Desktop 和 claude.ai**：从 [Releases 页面](https://github.com/statscrafthq/statscraft/releases)下载 `statscraft-X-skill.zip`，并在设置中将其作为技能上传。"

msgid "**Codex and the ChatGPT app's Codex view**: ask Codex `$skill-installer install https://github.com/statscrafthq/statscraft/tree/main/plugins/statscraft/skills/statscraft-analysis`, then restart it."
msgstr "**Codex 和 ChatGPT 应用的 Codex 视图**：对 Codex 说 `$skill-installer install https://github.com/statscrafthq/statscraft/tree/main/plugins/statscraft/skills/statscraft-analysis`，然后重启它。"

msgid "**Other agents** that read Agent Skills: unpack the zip into their skills folder, so that it holds `statscraft-analysis/SKILL.md`."
msgstr "**其他读取 Agent Skills 的智能体**：把该 zip 解压到它们的技能文件夹中，使其中包含 `statscraft-analysis/SKILL.md`。"

msgid "The skill uses the MCP tools when they are there, and the `statscraft` command line when the agent has only a shell."
msgstr "有 MCP 工具时，该技能使用 MCP 工具；智能体只有 shell 时，则使用 `statscraft` 命令行。"

msgid "Connect by hand"
msgstr "手动连接 {#connect-by-hand}"

msgid "Prefer to edit the files yourself? Use the full path of your `statscraft` program. `statscraft connect --list --json` prints it under `server`; `where statscraft` on Windows and `which statscraft` elsewhere show it too. The Windows installer puts it in `C:\\Users\\NAME\\AppData\\Local\\Programs\\Statscraft\\statscraft.exe`. The examples below use `/usr/bin/statscraft`. In JSON, every backslash of a Windows path is written twice: `\"C:\\\\Users\\\\anna\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Programs\\\\Statscraft\\\\statscraft.exe\"`."
msgstr "想自己编辑文件？请使用您的 `statscraft` 程序的完整路径。`statscraft connect --list --json` 会在 `server` 下打印该路径；在 Windows 上运行 `where statscraft`，在其他系统上运行 `which statscraft`，也能显示它。Windows 安装程序把它放在 `C:\\Users\\NAME\\AppData\\Local\\Programs\\Statscraft\\statscraft.exe`。下面的示例使用 `/usr/bin/statscraft`。在 JSON 中，Windows 路径的每个反斜杠都要写两次：`\"C:\\\\Users\\\\anna\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Programs\\\\Statscraft\\\\statscraft.exe\"`。"

msgid "**Claude Code**, one line in a terminal:"
msgstr "**Claude Code**，在终端中运行一行命令："

msgid "**Claude Desktop** (`claude_desktop_config.json`), **Gemini CLI** (`~/.gemini/settings.json`) and **Antigravity** (`~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json`): add the entry under `mcpServers`, next to any servers already there."
msgstr "**Claude Desktop**（`claude_desktop_config.json`）、**Gemini CLI**（`~/.gemini/settings.json`）和 **Antigravity**（`~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json`）：在 `mcpServers` 下添加条目，与已有的服务器并列。"

msgid "\"mcpServers\""
msgstr "\"mcpServers\""

msgid "\"statscraft\""
msgstr "\"statscraft\""

msgid "\"/usr/bin/statscraft\""
msgstr "\"/usr/bin/statscraft\""

msgid "\"args\""
msgstr "\"args\""

msgid "\"mcp\""
msgstr "\"mcp\""

msgid "**Cursor** (`~/.cursor/mcp.json`):"
msgstr "**Cursor**（`~/.cursor/mcp.json`）："

msgid "\"stdio\""
msgstr "\"stdio\""

msgid "**VS Code with Copilot** (`~/.copilot/mcp-config.json`):"
msgstr "**VS Code（配合 Copilot）**（`~/.copilot/mcp-config.json`）："

msgid "\"tools\""
msgstr "\"tools\""

msgid "\"*\""
msgstr "\"*\""

msgid "**Codex and the ChatGPT app's Codex view** (`~/.codex/config.toml`):"
msgstr "**Codex 和 ChatGPT 应用的 Codex 视图**（`~/.codex/config.toml`）："

msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[mcp_servers.statscraft]\n"
"command = \"/usr/bin/statscraft\"\n"
"args = [\"mcp\"]\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```toml\n"
"[mcp_servers.statscraft]\n"
"command = \"/usr/bin/statscraft\"\n"
"args = [\"mcp\"]\n"
"```"

msgid "ChatGPT in the browser and ordinary chats in the ChatGPT app cannot start programs on your computer, so they cannot use Statscraft this way."
msgstr "浏览器中的 ChatGPT 和 ChatGPT 应用中的普通对话无法在您的计算机上启动程序，因此不能以这种方式使用 Statscraft。"

msgid "For agents"
msgstr "面向智能体 {#for-agents}"

msgid "An agent with a shell can connect itself. Run `statscraft connect --list --json` first, then `statscraft connect AGENT --json` for the agent you are, and tell the person what the reply's `restart` field says. [Statscraft for AI agents](ai-agents.md) describes how to work once connected."
msgstr "有 shell 的智能体可以自行连接。先运行 `statscraft connect --list --json`，再针对您自己这个智能体运行 `statscraft connect AGENT --json`，并把回复中 `restart` 字段的内容告诉用户。[面向 AI 智能体的 Statscraft](ai-agents.md) 介绍了连接后如何工作。"

msgid "`statscraft mcp` lets an AI agent work with Statscraft through tools instead of shell commands. It speaks the Model Context Protocol (MCP) over standard input and output, so any agent app that runs local MCP servers can use it: Claude Desktop, Claude Code, Codex (also in the ChatGPT app), Cursor, VS Code with Copilot and others. It ships with the `statscraft` command line, so there is nothing more to install, and the data never leave your computer."
msgstr "`statscraft mcp` 让 AI 智能体通过工具而不是 shell 命令来使用 Statscraft。它通过标准输入和输出使用 Model Context Protocol（MCP，模型上下文协议），因此任何能运行本地 MCP 服务器的智能体应用都可以使用它：Claude Desktop、Claude Code、Codex（包括 ChatGPT 应用中的 Codex）、Cursor、VS Code（配合 Copilot）等。它随 `statscraft` 命令行一起提供，无需另外安装，数据也从不离开您的计算机。"

msgid "The easy way to connect an agent is `statscraft connect`, which finds the agent apps you have installed and adds Statscraft to each one. Claude Desktop also installs it from a bundle with a double click, and Claude Code from a plugin; see [Connect your AI agent](connect.md). To set one up by hand, give it the command `statscraft mcp`, with the full path to `statscraft` if it is not on your PATH."
msgstr "连接智能体最简单的方法是 `statscraft connect`，它会找到您已安装的智能体应用，并把 Statscraft 添加到每个应用中。Claude Desktop 也可以双击 MCP 包来安装，Claude Code 则可以通过插件安装；参见[连接您的 AI 智能体](connect.md)。如需手动设置，请给智能体提供命令 `statscraft mcp`；如果 `statscraft` 不在您的 PATH 上，请写出它的完整路径。"

msgid "The tools"
msgstr "工具 {#the-tools}"

msgid "Tool"
msgstr "工具"

msgid "Input"
msgstr "输入"

msgid "What it gives back"
msgstr "返回内容"

msgid "`describe`"
msgstr "`describe`"

msgid "`file` (a .sav or .zsav file), or `session`"
msgstr "`file`（.sav 或 .zsav 文件），或 `session`"

msgid "the dictionary and counts, and for a session what it keeps; the same JSON as `statscraft describe --json`"
msgstr "字典和计数，对会话还会返回它保存的内容；与 `statscraft describe --json` 的 JSON 相同"

msgid "`list_commands`"
msgstr "`list_commands`"

msgid "none"
msgstr "无"

msgid "every supported command with a one-line summary, as `statscraft help`"
msgstr "每条受支持的命令及其一行摘要，与 `statscraft help` 相同"

msgid "`command_help`"
msgstr "`command_help`"

msgid "the syntax, rules and an example of one command, as `statscraft help COMMAND`"
msgstr "一条命令的语法、规则和示例，与 `statscraft help COMMAND` 相同"

msgid "`check_syntax`"
msgstr "`check_syntax`"

msgid "`syntax` or `file`, and optional `lines`, `session`, `folder`, `vega_lite`, `encoding`"
msgstr "`syntax` 或 `file`，以及可选的 `lines`、`session`、`folder`、`vega_lite`、`encoding`"

msgid "the result of a check, as `statscraft check --json`; nothing is kept or written"
msgstr "检查结果，与 `statscraft check --json` 相同；不保存也不写入任何内容"

msgid "`run_syntax`"
msgstr "`run_syntax`"

msgid "the same as `check_syntax`, and optional `xlsx`, `xlsx_one_sheet`, `xlsx_no_titles`, `plugins`, `plugin_templates`, `charts` and `chart_format`; or `window` (with optional `lines`) instead of `syntax` and `file`"
msgstr "与 `check_syntax` 相同，另加可选的 `xlsx`、`xlsx_one_sheet`、`xlsx_no_titles`、`plugins`、`plugin_templates`、`charts` 和 `chart_format`；或用 `window`（可选 `lines`）代替 `syntax` 和 `file`"

msgid "the result of a run, as `statscraft run --json`; the session keeps the new state, and `trail` says where its syntax was kept"
msgstr "运行结果，与 `statscraft run --json` 相同；会话保存新的状态，`trail` 说明其语法保存在何处"

msgid "`describe_plugin`"
msgstr "`describe_plugin`"

msgid "`program` (the absolute path of a plugin)"
msgstr "`program`（插件的绝对路径）"

msgid "the plugin's name, version and settings, each with its kind, default and the data file attribute that holds it"
msgstr "插件的名称、版本和设置，每项设置附带其类型、默认值以及保存它的数据文件属性"

msgid "`check_plugin_update`"
msgstr "`check_plugin_update`"

msgid "whether the plugin offers a newer version, as `statscraft update --check --plugin`: `plugin`, `current`, `latest`, `update`, `notes`; it installs nothing"
msgstr "插件是否提供更新的版本，与 `statscraft update --check --plugin` 相同：`plugin`、`current`、`latest`、`update`、`notes`；不安装任何东西"

msgid "`window_status`"
msgstr "`window_status`"

msgid "whether a Statscraft window is open, and if so its datasets and output documents; also `platform` (`windows`, `macos`, `linux`) and `wsl_distro` when the agent runs inside WSL"
msgstr "Statscraft 窗口是否已打开，若已打开，则给出其数据集和输出文档；还有 `platform`（`windows`、`macos`、`linux`），智能体在 WSL 中运行时另有 `wsl_distro`"

msgid "`list_syntax_windows`"
msgstr "`list_syntax_windows`"

msgid "the syntax windows of the open window: `id`, `name`, `file`, `unsaved`, `lines`, and whether it is the Agent window, the designated one or the one the person used last"
msgstr "打开的窗口中的语法窗口：`id`、`name`、`file`、`unsaved`、`lines`，以及它是否为 Agent 窗口、指定窗口或用户最近使用的窗口"

msgid "`read_syntax`"
msgstr "`read_syntax`"

msgid "`window`"
msgstr "`window`"

msgid "the text of a syntax window, each line with its number"
msgstr "语法窗口的文本，每行附带行号"

msgid "`edit_syntax`"
msgstr "`edit_syntax`"

msgid "`window`, `mode`, `text`, and `lines` or `before`"
msgstr "`window`、`mode`、`text`，以及 `lines` 或 `before`"

msgid "changes the text: `replace` the lines `lines` (an empty text deletes them), `insert` before line `before`, `append`, or `replace_all`; gives the lines the new text takes"
msgstr "更改文本：`replace` 替换 `lines` 指定的行（文本为空则删除这些行），`insert` 插入到第 `before` 行之前，`append` 追加，或 `replace_all` 全部替换；返回新文本所占的行"

msgid "`new_syntax_window`"
msgstr "`new_syntax_window`"

msgid "optional `name` and `text`"
msgstr "可选的 `name` 和 `text`"

msgid "a new syntax window, empty or with the text"
msgstr "一个新的语法窗口，为空或包含给定文本"

msgid "`open_syntax_file`"
msgstr "`open_syntax_file`"

msgid "`path`"
msgstr "`path`"

msgid "the .sps file in a syntax window, or the window that has it open already"
msgstr "在语法窗口中打开的 .sps 文件，或已打开该文件的窗口"

msgid "`save_syntax`"
msgstr "`save_syntax`"

msgid "`window`, optional `path` and `overwrite`"
msgstr "`window`，可选的 `path` 和 `overwrite`"

msgid "the window written to its own file or to `path`"
msgstr "把窗口写入它自己的文件或 `path`"

msgid "`close_syntax`"
msgstr "`close_syntax`"

msgid "`window`, optional `discard`"
msgstr "`window`，可选的 `discard`"

msgid "the syntax window closed, as File > Close in it"
msgstr "关闭语法窗口，与在该窗口中选择 File > Close 相同"

msgid "`export_output`"
msgstr "`export_output`"

msgid "`path`, optional `folder`, `format`, `one_sheet`, `selected`, `hidden`"
msgstr "`path`，可选的 `folder`、`format`、`one_sheet`、`selected`、`hidden`"

msgid "the output of the open window written to an Excel workbook, web page or PDF, as its File > Export and `statscraft export`"
msgstr "把打开的窗口的输出写入 Excel 工作簿、网页或 PDF，与窗口的 File > Export 和 `statscraft export` 相同"

msgid "`read_output`"
msgstr "`read_output`"

msgid "optional `document`"
msgstr "可选的 `document`"

msgid "what an output window of the open window holds, as `statscraft output --json`: every heading, table and chart with whether it is hidden or selected, and which kinds the window shows"
msgstr "打开的窗口中某个输出窗口的内容，与 `statscraft output --json` 相同：每个标题、表格和图表，以及它是否隐藏或选中，还有该窗口显示哪些类型"

msgid "`undo`"
msgstr "`undo`"

msgid "the last run that changed the data in the open window taken back, as its Edit > Undo and `statscraft undo`; gives that run's syntax under `undone`; each call goes one change further back"
msgstr "撤销打开的窗口中最近一次更改数据的运行，与窗口的 Edit > Undo 和 `statscraft undo` 相同；在 `undone` 下给出那次运行的语法；每次调用再往前撤销一步"

msgid "`redo`"
msgstr "`redo`"

msgid "the run the last undo took back done again in the open window, as its Edit > Redo and `statscraft redo`; gives that run's syntax under `redone`"
msgstr "在打开的窗口中重做最近一次撤销的运行，与窗口的 Edit > Redo 和 `statscraft redo` 相同；在 `redone` 下给出那次运行的语法"

msgid "`add_chart`"
msgstr "`add_chart`"

msgid "`chart`, optional `session` and `vega_lite`"
msgstr "`chart`，可选的 `session` 和 `vega_lite`"

msgid "the chart checked and added to the designated output document, as the result of a run; the text starts with `chart added to output document NAME`"
msgstr "检查图表并把它添加到指定输出文档，返回内容与一次运行的结果相同；文本以 `chart added to output document NAME` 开头"

msgid "`syntax` is the text of one or more commands; `file` is the absolute path of a .sps file. Give one of them."
msgstr "`syntax` 是一条或多条命令的文本；`file` 是 .sps 文件的绝对路径。两者给出其一。"

msgid "`lines` limits the run to the commands within a line range, such as `\"12-20\"`. Line numbers stay those of the whole text."
msgstr "`lines` 把运行限制在某个行范围内的命令，例如 `\"12-20\"`。行号仍按整段文本计算。"

msgid "`folder` is the absolute folder that relative file names in the syntax start from. Default: your home folder. Give absolute paths in the syntax to be sure."
msgstr "`folder` 是语法中相对文件名的起始绝对文件夹。默认：您的主文件夹。为保险起见，请在语法中使用绝对路径。"

msgid "`xlsx`, `xlsx_one_sheet`, `xlsx_no_titles`, `plugins`, `plugin_templates`, `vega_lite`, `encoding`, `charts` and `chart_format` do what the [run](command-line.md#run) flags of the same names do on the command line. Give paths as absolute paths; a relative `charts` folder starts from `folder`. [Exporting all output](window.md#exporting-all-output) describes the workbook, and [Tables with a plugin](#tables-with-a-plugin) the plugins."
msgstr "`xlsx`、`xlsx_one_sheet`、`xlsx_no_titles`、`plugins`、`plugin_templates`、`vega_lite`、`encoding`、`charts` 和 `chart_format` 的作用与命令行中同名的 [run](command-line.md#run) 选项相同。路径请写成绝对路径；相对的 `charts` 文件夹从 `folder` 开始。[导出全部输出](window.md#exporting-all-output)介绍工作簿，[使用插件的表格](#tables-with-a-plugin)介绍插件。"

msgid "An agent inside WSL that uses Statscraft on Windows may give Linux paths in the arguments; the server translates them. Inside the syntax, file names must be Windows paths. See [Agents inside WSL](connect.md#agents-inside-wsl)."
msgstr "在 WSL 中运行、使用 Windows 上 Statscraft 的智能体，可以在参数中给出 Linux 路径；服务器会转换它们。在语法内部，文件名必须是 Windows 路径。参见 [WSL 中的智能体](connect.md#agents-inside-wsl)。"

msgid "`window` names a syntax window of the open window by its id or its name, as `list_syntax_windows` shows them. The syntax window tools work only while the window is open; without it they fail with \"no Statscraft window is running\"."
msgstr "`window` 用 id 或名称指定打开的窗口中的一个语法窗口，与 `list_syntax_windows` 显示的相同。语法窗口工具只在窗口打开时可用；窗口未打开时，它们会失败并提示 \"no Statscraft window is running\"。"

msgid "A run or check returns the JSON described in [the command line](command-line.md#json-output) as structured content, and the tables and charts as Markdown text with a summary line for apps that show only text. A syntax or run error is a normal result: `ok` is false and `errors` gives the line, column and what was expected, so the agent can fix the syntax and try again. A call the server cannot carry out at all, such as a missing file or a bad argument, is marked as a tool error."
msgstr "一次运行或检查会以结构化内容返回[命令行](command-line.md#json-output)中介绍的 JSON，并以 Markdown 文本返回表格和图表，附带一行摘要，供只显示文本的应用使用。语法错误或运行错误是正常结果：`ok` 为 false，`errors` 给出行、列和预期的内容，智能体可以据此修正语法并重试。服务器完全无法执行的调用，例如文件缺失或参数错误，会被标记为工具错误。"

msgid "The server also sends the working loop to the agent when it connects, and offers it as the prompt `analysis`: describe the data first, look up each command, check, run in small steps, read `ok`, `errors` and the warnings, and report the numbers from the result tables instead of computing them."
msgstr "服务器在连接时还会把工作流程发送给智能体，并以提示词 `analysis` 的形式提供：先描述数据，查阅每条命令，先检查，分小步运行，阅读 `ok`、`errors` 和警告，并报告结果表格中的数字，而不是自行计算。"

msgid "Every step leaves syntax"
msgstr "每一步都留下语法 {#every-step-leaves-syntax}"

msgid "Whatever an agent does through `run_syntax` stays readable as syntax, so the person can check it, change it and run it again without the agent:"
msgstr "智能体通过 `run_syntax` 所做的一切都保留为可读的语法，用户可以检查、修改，并在没有智能体的情况下再次运行："

msgid "In the open window, each successful run is added to a syntax window named Agent. It opens with the first run; if the person closes it, the next run opens a new one. Each run comes under a comment line with the time, such as `* Agent 14:32.`, followed by exactly the syntax that ran. The person can edit it, run lines from it with Ctrl+Enter and save it like any syntax window. Runs sent with `statscraft run -s gui` from the command line go there too."
msgstr "在打开的窗口中，每次成功的运行都会添加到名为 Agent 的语法窗口中。该窗口在第一次运行时打开；如果用户关闭了它，下一次运行会打开一个新的。每次运行都位于一行带时间的注释之下，例如 `* Agent 14:32.`，后面是实际运行的语法，一字不差。用户可以像在任何语法窗口中一样编辑它，用 Ctrl+Enter 运行其中的行，并保存它。从命令行用 `statscraft run -s gui` 发送的运行也会进入这里。"

msgid "A run from a syntax window (`run_syntax` with `window`) is not copied: that window's text already is its record."
msgstr "从语法窗口发起的运行（带 `window` 的 `run_syntax`）不会被复制：该窗口的文本本身就是它的记录。"

msgid "In a file session, each successful run is added to `syntax.sps` in the session's folder, under a comment line with the date and time."
msgstr "在文件会话中，每次成功的运行都会添加到会话文件夹中的 `syntax.sps`，位于一行带日期和时间的注释之下。"

msgid "A failed run (`ok` false) changed nothing and leaves nothing; neither does a check."
msgstr "失败的运行（`ok` 为 false）没有更改任何东西，也不留下任何东西；检查同样如此。"

msgid "`trail` in the result, and a line `syntax kept in:` in the text, say where the syntax went: `syntax window Agent`, or the path of the file."
msgstr "结果中的 `trail` 以及文本中的 `syntax kept in:` 一行说明语法保存到了哪里：`syntax window Agent`，或文件的路径。"

msgid "Charts of your own"
msgstr "您自己的图表 {#charts-of-your-own}"

msgid "Procedures draw their own charts. When the person wants a chart that no procedure makes, such as last year's figures beside this year's from two runs, `add_chart` puts it in the output, drawn the Statscraft way:"
msgstr "过程会绘制自己的图表。当用户想要一张没有任何过程能生成的图表时，例如把两次运行得到的去年数字和今年数字并排展示，`add_chart` 会把它放进输出，并按 Statscraft 的方式绘制："

msgid "`chart` is either the chart JSON that `run_syntax` returns under `charts` (so an agent can take a procedure's chart and change its title, labels, kind or numbers), or a simple Vega-Lite specification: one view, the rows inline in `data.values`, mark `bar`, `line`, `area`, `point` or `arc`. Both are described in [Charts as input](command-line.md#charts-as-input)."
msgstr "`chart` 可以是 `run_syntax` 在 `charts` 下返回的图表 JSON（智能体因此可以拿来某个过程的图表，修改其标题、标签、类型或数字），也可以是一个简单的 Vega-Lite 规范：一个视图，行内联在 `data.values` 中，标记为 `bar`、`line`、`area`、`point` 或 `arc`。两者都在[作为输入的图表](command-line.md#charts-as-input)中介绍。"

msgid "The values are drawn as given: nothing is counted, summed or binned. The numbers should come from the result tables."
msgstr "数值按原样绘制：不做任何计数、求和或分组。数字应当来自结果表格。"

msgid "In the open window the chart goes to the designated output window, where the person sees it, copies it, opens it in Excel, Word or PowerPoint, and saves or exports it with the other output. `commands[0].document` in the result names the document."
msgstr "在打开的窗口中，图表进入指定输出窗口，用户可以在那里查看、复制它，在 Excel、Word 或 PowerPoint 中打开它，并与其他输出一起保存或导出。结果中的 `commands[0].document` 给出该文档的名称。"

msgid "The tool runs the syntax BEGIN CHART, a Statscraft extension, with the chart's JSON inside. That syntax is kept like any run: in the Agent syntax window, or in `syntax.sps` of a file session, so running it again shows the chart again."
msgstr "该工具运行语法 BEGIN CHART（Statscraft 的一项扩展），其中包含图表的 JSON。这段语法像任何运行一样被保存：在 Agent 语法窗口中，或在文件会话的 `syntax.sps` 中，因此再次运行它会再次显示该图表。"

msgid "A file session keeps its output between calls, in its folder. Add the chart, then write the document with OUTPUT EXPORT or OUTPUT SAVE through `run_syntax` whenever it is ready."
msgstr "文件会话在调用之间把输出保存在其文件夹中。先添加图表，准备好后再通过 `run_syntax` 用 OUTPUT EXPORT 或 OUTPUT SAVE 写出文档。"

msgid "A chart that cannot be drawn, a misspelt field, or a Vega-Lite feature that Statscraft does not read is an error to fix, like a syntax error: `ok` is false and the message names what is wrong. Nothing is added then."
msgstr "无法绘制的图表、拼错的字段，或 Statscraft 不读取的 Vega-Lite 功能，都是需要修正的错误，与语法错误一样：`ok` 为 false，消息会指出问题所在。此时不会添加任何内容。"

msgid "Tables with a plugin"
msgstr "使用插件的表格 {#tables-with-a-plugin}"

msgid "A plugin decorates the CTABLES tables of a run in the workbook: colors, comments, column widths and the rest of its look. The agent asks `describe_plugin` for the plugin's settings. Each is kept in a data file attribute, such as `plugin_acme_tables_confidence`, and a run takes each setting from that attribute of the active data, else the plugin's default. To change one, the agent runs `DATAFILE ATTRIBUTE ATTRIBUTE=plugin_acme_tables_confidence('90').` before the tables (yes/no as `Yes` or `No`, a color as `#rrggbb`, a style as JSON); SAVE keeps it with the data. Then:"
msgstr "插件会美化一次运行在工作簿中生成的 CTABLES 表格：颜色、注释、列宽以及其他外观。智能体通过 `describe_plugin` 获取插件的设置。每项设置保存在一个数据文件属性中，例如 `plugin_acme_tables_confidence`，运行时从活动数据的该属性中读取每项设置，没有时使用插件的默认值。要更改某项设置，智能体在表格之前运行 `DATAFILE ATTRIBUTE ATTRIBUTE=plugin_acme_tables_confidence('90').`（是/否写作 `Yes` 或 `No`，颜色写作 `#rrggbb`，样式写成 JSON）；SAVE 会把它与数据一起保存。然后："

msgid "\"file\""
msgstr "\"file\""

msgid "\"/home/anna/jobs/tables.sps\""
msgstr "\"/home/anna/jobs/tables.sps\""

msgid "\"work\""
msgstr "\"work\""

msgid "\"xlsx\""
msgstr "\"xlsx\""

msgid "\"/home/anna/jobs/tables.xlsx\""
msgstr "\"/home/anna/jobs/tables.xlsx\""

msgid "\"xlsx_one_sheet\""
msgstr "\"xlsx_one_sheet\""

msgid "\"plugins\""
msgstr "\"plugins\""

msgid "\"/home/anna/plugins/acme-tables\""
msgstr "\"/home/anna/plugins/acme-tables\""

msgid "A plugin that fails fails the run, with its message. In the open window `plugins` works the same way: the settings come from the attributes of the window's active data after the run, and only this run's workbook gets the plugins' look. The window's own output keeps the plugins of Edit > Settings > Plugins, which `export_output` writes."
msgstr "插件失败则运行失败，并给出插件的消息。在打开的窗口中，`plugins` 的作用相同：设置取自运行之后窗口活动数据的属性，并且只有本次运行的工作簿使用插件的外观。窗口自身的输出仍使用 Edit > Settings > Plugins 中的插件，`export_output` 写出的就是这些。"

msgid "With the window open, an agent can work in the person's syntax windows as the person would:"
msgstr "窗口打开时，智能体可以像用户一样在用户的语法窗口中工作："

msgid "`list_syntax_windows` and `read_syntax` show what is there, unsaved changes included. Line numbers are those a run counts."
msgstr "`list_syntax_windows` 和 `read_syntax` 显示其中的内容，包括未保存的更改。行号与运行时计算的行号一致。"

msgid "`edit_syntax` changes the text in the editor; the person sees it at once and can take it back with Ctrl+Z in that editor. It never runs anything and writes no file."
msgstr "`edit_syntax` 更改编辑器中的文本；用户会立即看到更改，并可以在该编辑器中用 Ctrl+Z 撤销。它从不运行任何东西，也不写入任何文件。"

msgid "`run_syntax` with `window` runs the window's text, or with `lines` the commands those lines touch, exactly as Run and Ctrl+Enter in that window do: relative file names start from the window's file, and errors are marked in its margin."
msgstr "带 `window` 的 `run_syntax` 运行该窗口的文本，带 `lines` 时运行这些行涉及的命令，与在该窗口中使用 Run 和 Ctrl+Enter 完全相同：相对文件名从该窗口的文件开始，错误会标记在其页边。"

msgid "`new_syntax_window` and `open_syntax_file` open a window; a window an agent opens takes pasted syntax from the dialogs, as a window the person opens does. The Agent window never does."
msgstr "`new_syntax_window` 和 `open_syntax_file` 会打开一个窗口；智能体打开的窗口会接收从对话框粘贴的语法，与用户打开的窗口一样。Agent 窗口从不接收。"

msgid "`save_syntax` writes the window to its own file, or to `path`. It does not replace any other existing file unless `overwrite` is true, and never a file that another syntax window holds."
msgstr "`save_syntax` 把窗口写入它自己的文件，或写入 `path`。除非 `overwrite` 为 true，否则它不会替换任何其他已有文件，并且绝不替换另一个语法窗口所持有的文件。"

msgid "`close_syntax` closes the window. A window with unsaved changes stays open unless `discard` is true, and the last window of the program always stays, since closing it would end Statscraft."
msgstr "`close_syntax` 关闭窗口。有未保存更改的窗口会保持打开，除非 `discard` 为 true；程序的最后一个窗口总是保留，因为关闭它会退出 Statscraft。"

msgid "When the person asks to fix or explain their syntax, the agent reads the window, says what it would change, makes the change with `edit_syntax` and runs it from the window."
msgstr "当用户要求修正或解释其语法时，智能体会读取窗口，说明它打算更改什么，用 `edit_syntax` 进行更改，然后从窗口中运行。"

msgid "`export_output` writes the designated output window to `path` as File > Export does: `format` `xlsx`, `html` or `pdf` (default: from the extension), `one_sheet` for Excel, `selected` for only the selected tables, `hidden` for hidden items too. A relative `path` starts in `folder`. It replaces an existing file."
msgstr "`export_output` 像 File > Export 一样把指定输出窗口写入 `path`：`format` 为 `xlsx`、`html` 或 `pdf`（默认：根据扩展名），`one_sheet` 用于 Excel，`selected` 只导出选中的表格，`hidden` 同时导出隐藏的项目。相对的 `path` 从 `folder` 开始。它会替换已有文件。"

msgid "`undo` takes back the last run that changed the data in the open window, as Edit > Undo does there; the output stays. Each call goes one change further back, up to 10. `redo` does again the run the last undo took back, as Edit > Redo does; a change to the data after an undo ends the redo. Each fails when there is nothing to take back or do again. File sessions have neither."
msgstr "`undo` 撤销打开的窗口中最近一次更改数据的运行，与窗口中的 Edit > Undo 相同；输出保留。每次调用再往前撤销一步，最多 10 步。`redo` 重做最近一次撤销的运行，与 Edit > Redo 相同；撤销后若又更改了数据，就不能再重做。没有可撤销或可重做的内容时，两者都会失败。文件会话不支持这两项。"

msgid "`read_output` shows the agent what the person sees in an output window: the designated one, or the output document `document`. Its structured content is the JSON of `statscraft output --json`; its text a summary line and the tables as `run_syntax` gives them, each hidden or selected one marked so."
msgstr "`read_output` 让智能体看到用户在输出窗口中看到的内容：指定输出窗口，或输出文档 `document`。其结构化内容是 `statscraft output --json` 的 JSON；其文本是一行摘要加上表格，与 `run_syntax` 给出的形式相同，隐藏或选中的表格都有相应标记。"

msgid "Sessions and the window"
msgstr "会话与窗口 {#sessions-and-the-window}"

msgid "A session keeps the data, settings, macros and named datasets between calls, as with `statscraft run -s NAME` (see [sessions](command-line.md#sessions-and-line-ranges))."
msgstr "会话在调用之间保存数据、设置、宏和命名数据集，与 `statscraft run -s NAME` 相同（参见[会话](command-line.md#sessions-and-line-ranges)）。"

msgid "When the Statscraft window is open, calls without a `session` go to the window (the session `gui`). You see every table appear in the designated output window and every command in the log, and you can keep working in the window between the agent's steps."
msgstr "当 Statscraft 窗口打开时，不带 `session` 的调用会发送到窗口（会话 `gui`）。您会看到每个表格出现在指定输出窗口中，每条命令出现在日志中，并且可以在智能体的各步之间继续在窗口中工作。"

msgid "When no window is open, calls without a `session` use a session named `work`."
msgstr "当没有打开的窗口时，不带 `session` 的调用使用名为 `work` 的会话。"

msgid "File sessions of the MCP server live in your user data folder, not in the folder the agent app started the server in: `~/.local/share/statscraft/sessions` on Linux (or `$XDG_DATA_HOME/statscraft/sessions`), `~/Library/Application Support/Statscraft/sessions` on macOS, and `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Statscraft\\sessions` on Windows. Delete a session's folder for a fresh start, or ask the agent to use a new session name."
msgstr "MCP 服务器的文件会话位于您的用户数据文件夹中，而不是智能体应用启动服务器时所在的文件夹：在 Linux 上是 `~/.local/share/statscraft/sessions`（或 `$XDG_DATA_HOME/statscraft/sessions`），在 macOS 上是 `~/Library/Application Support/Statscraft/sessions`，在 Windows 上是 `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Statscraft\\sessions`。删除某个会话的文件夹即可重新开始，也可以让智能体使用一个新的会话名称。"

msgid "Safety"
msgstr "安全性 {#safety}"

msgid "The server can do what the command line can do, and nothing more. Syntax can read files, and it can write them with `SAVE`, `AGGREGATE OUTFILE`, `OUTPUT EXPORT` or the `xlsx` argument. `check_syntax` writes nothing; nothing is written without one of those."
msgstr "服务器能做的就是命令行能做的，仅此而已。语法可以读取文件，也可以用 `SAVE`、`AGGREGATE OUTFILE`、`OUTPUT EXPORT` 或 `xlsx` 参数写入文件。`check_syntax` 不写入任何内容；没有上述方式之一，就不会写入任何内容。"

msgid "The tools tell the agent app which of them only read (`describe`, `list_commands`, `command_help`, `check_syntax`, `window_status`, `list_syntax_windows`, `read_syntax`, `read_output`), which change only the window's syntax windows (`edit_syntax`, `new_syntax_window`, `open_syntax_file`) or add to its output (`add_chart`, which writes no file), that `close_syntax` can lose unsaved syntax and `undo` and `redo` change the data, and that `run_syntax`, `save_syntax` and `export_output` can change files. Agent apps ask you before a tool runs, unless you allowed it; allow `run_syntax` only for agents you trust with your files."
msgstr "这些工具会告诉智能体应用：哪些只读取（`describe`、`list_commands`、`command_help`、`check_syntax`、`window_status`、`list_syntax_windows`、`read_syntax`、`read_output`），哪些只更改窗口的语法窗口（`edit_syntax`、`new_syntax_window`、`open_syntax_file`）或向其输出添加内容（`add_chart`，不写入文件），`close_syntax` 可能丢失未保存的语法，`undo` 和 `redo` 会更改数据，而 `run_syntax`、`save_syntax` 和 `export_output` 可能更改文件。除非您已允许，智能体应用会在工具运行前询问您；只对您放心让其处理文件的智能体允许 `run_syntax`。"

msgid "The server talks only to the app that started it, over standard input and output. It opens no network port. Calls to the window use the window's local connection, described in [AI agents](ai-agents.md#safety-of-the-live-session)."
msgstr "服务器只与启动它的应用通信，通过标准输入和输出进行。它不打开任何网络端口。对窗口的调用使用窗口的本地连接，详见 [AI 智能体](ai-agents.md#safety-of-the-live-session)。"

msgid "A plugin colors the cells of custom tables and adds comments to them. For example, it can shade the cells as a heat map, flag cells with a small base, add a note to a cell, or give your Excel exports a look of your own."
msgstr "插件为自定义表格的单元格着色并添加注释。例如，它可以把单元格按热力图着色，标记基数较小的单元格，为单元格添加备注，或让您导出的 Excel 文件拥有自己的外观。"

msgid "A plugin is a separate program. You add it once in the window, and Statscraft runs it after every run that makes custom tables."
msgstr "插件是一个独立的程序。您只需在窗口中添加一次，之后每次生成自定义表格的运行结束后，Statscraft 都会运行它。"

msgid "Add a plugin"
msgstr "添加插件 {#add-a-plugin}"

msgid "Choose **Edit > Settings > Plugins**."
msgstr "选择 **Edit > Settings > Plugins**。"

msgid "Click **Add plugin...** and choose the plugin's program file."
msgstr "点击 **Add plugin...**，选择插件的程序文件。"

msgid "Each plugin gets a row with its name and version, a box that turns it on and off, its full path, and the buttons **Up**, **Down**, **Remove** and **Settings...**. If a plugin cannot be used, its row says why."
msgstr "每个插件占一行，显示其名称和版本、一个用于启用或停用的复选框、完整路径，以及 **Up**、**Down**、**Remove** 和 **Settings...** 按钮。如果某个插件无法使用，该行会说明原因。"

msgid "After the next run, the output window shows the colors. A cell with a small red corner has a comment: point at it to read it. When you change a plugin, its order or its settings, every table is decorated again."
msgstr "下一次运行后，输出窗口会显示这些颜色。带有红色小角标的单元格有注释：将鼠标指向它即可阅读。当您更改插件、插件顺序或其设置时，所有表格都会重新装饰。"

msgid "Several plugins"
msgstr "多个插件 {#several-plugins}"

msgid "The plugins run in the order of the list, each with its own settings. Where two plugins style the same thing, for example the fill of a cell, the later one wins. Where they style different things, both show: a fill from one plugin and bold text from another."
msgstr "插件按列表顺序运行，每个插件使用自己的设置。如果两个插件设置同一项样式，例如单元格的填充色，以后运行的为准。如果它们设置的是不同的样式，两者都会显示：例如一个插件的填充色和另一个插件的粗体文字。"

msgid "A plugin that fails, or takes longer than two minutes, adds nothing, and the status bar says why. The other plugins still apply."
msgstr "运行失败或耗时超过两分钟的插件不会添加任何内容，状态栏会说明原因。其他插件仍然生效。"

msgid "Plugin settings"
msgstr "插件设置 {#plugin-settings}"

msgid "**Settings...** opens the plugin's own settings for the active data. Settings with a heading of their own are grouped under it."
msgstr "**Settings...** 打开该插件针对当前数据的设置。有单独标题的设置会归在该标题下。"

msgid "Click **OK** to keep the settings with the data. Save the data file to take them to another computer."
msgstr "点击 **OK**，设置会随数据一起保存。保存数据文件即可把设置带到另一台电脑。"

msgid "A setting marked **(all data files)** is kept on this computer instead, the last value you chose, for every data file. You can set it with no data open. On the command line, give it with `DATAFILE ATTRIBUTE` in the syntax."
msgstr "标有 **(all data files)** 的设置则保存在本机上，对所有数据文件使用您最后选择的值。没有打开数据时也可以设置它。在命令行中，请在语法里用 `DATAFILE ATTRIBUTE` 指定。"

msgid "A setting you leave empty takes the plugin's default."
msgstr "留空的设置使用插件的默认值。"

msgid "A style setting shows a sample, black on white as in Excel, whatever the window's theme. **Define...** sets its font, size, bold, italic, text color, fill and alignment."
msgstr "样式设置会显示一个示例，无论窗口使用什么主题，都像 Excel 中一样白底黑字。**Define...** 用于设置字体、字号、粗体、斜体、文字颜色、填充色和对齐方式。"

msgid "Some settings have **presets**: saved values you can choose from a list. Type a name and click **Save as new** to add one. Choosing a preset fills in its value and its name; change either and click **Save** to keep the changes in that preset, or **Remove** to delete it. Presets belong to the window, so they are there for every data file."
msgstr "有些设置带有**预设**：可以从列表中选择的已保存值。输入名称并点击 **Save as new** 即可添加一个预设。选择一个预设会填入它的值和名称；修改其中任一项后，点击 **Save** 将更改保存到该预设，或点击 **Remove** 删除它。预设属于窗口，因此对所有数据文件都可用。"

msgid "Design templates"
msgstr "设计模板 {#design-templates}"

msgid "A design template is a named set of settings for one plugin, for example one look per client."
msgstr "设计模板是某个插件的一组命名设置，例如每个客户一种外观。"

msgid "Choose a template in the **Template** row at the top of Plugin Settings, or **(none)**."
msgstr "在 Plugin Settings 顶部的 **Template** 行中选择一个模板，或选择 **(none)**。"

msgid "Type a name and click **Save as template** to keep the current settings. **Delete** removes the chosen template."
msgstr "输入名称并点击 **Save as template**，即可保存当前设置。**Delete** 删除所选模板。"

msgid "**OK** makes the chosen template active. While it is active, its settings hold for every data file. Settings that belong to one data file still come from the data, and those marked (all data files) from this computer."
msgstr "**OK** 使所选模板生效。模板生效期间，其设置适用于所有数据文件。属于单个数据文件的设置仍来自数据，标有 (all data files) 的设置仍来自本机。"

msgid "**Export...** writes the chosen template and the plugin's presets to a text file. **Import...** reads such a file, for example one a colleague exported."
msgstr "**Export...** 将所选模板和该插件的预设写入一个文本文件。**Import...** 读取这样的文件，例如同事导出的文件。"

msgid "What shows where"
msgstr "各处显示的内容 {#what-shows-where}"

msgid "Statscraft saves the colors and comments with the output, so a saved output file (.scout) shows them again without the plugin."
msgstr "Statscraft 将颜色和注释与输出一起保存，因此已保存的输出文件（.scout）无需插件即可再次显示它们。"

msgid "Place"
msgstr "位置"

msgid "What a plugin can change"
msgstr "插件可以更改的内容"

msgid "Excel workbooks"
msgstr "Excel 工作簿"

msgid "fills, text colors, bold, italic, alignment, borders, fonts and sizes, column widths, row heights, and comments as Excel notes"
msgstr "填充色、文字颜色、粗体、斜体、对齐方式、边框、字体和字号、列宽、行高，以及作为 Excel 批注的注释"

msgid "Web pages and copied tables"
msgstr "网页和复制的表格"

msgid "the same styles, with comments as tooltips; the browser sets widths and heights"
msgstr "相同的样式，注释显示为提示框；宽度和高度由浏览器决定"

msgid "The output window"
msgstr "输出窗口"

msgid "fills, text colors, bold, italic, borders and alignment; the window keeps its own font and layout"
msgstr "填充色、文字颜色、粗体、斜体、边框和对齐方式；窗口保持自己的字体和布局"

msgid "Whether a plugin writes comments is one of its own settings."
msgstr "插件是否写入注释，由插件自身的设置决定。"

msgid "A plugin that offers updates has **Check now** in its row. While the Plugins page is open, Statscraft also checks each such plugin once a day. When a newer version exists, the row says so, with the plugin's note and an **Update** button."
msgstr "提供更新的插件在其所在行中有 **Check now** 按钮。Plugins 页面打开期间，Statscraft 还会每天检查一次每个这样的插件。有新版本时，该行会显示出来，并附有插件的说明和一个 **Update** 按钮。"

msgid "Nothing is installed until you click **Update**. Statscraft then downloads the new program, checks it against the checksum the plugin gave, puts it in place of the old one and decorates the tables again. If any step fails, the old program stays."
msgstr "在您点击 **Update** 之前，不会安装任何内容。之后 Statscraft 会下载新程序，用插件提供的校验和进行核对，替换旧程序，并重新装饰表格。任何一步失败，都会保留旧程序。"

msgid "Plugins without the window"
msgstr "不使用窗口运行插件 {#plugins-without-the-window}"

msgid "On the command line, `--plugin` lets a plugin style the custom tables of a workbook:"
msgstr "在命令行中，`--plugin` 让插件为工作簿中的自定义表格设置样式："

msgid "The settings come from the active data file, as the window saved them there. To set one in syntax, give it as a data file attribute named `plugin_<name>_<key>` (the plugin's name and the setting's key, in lower case, other characters as `_`), for example `DATAFILE ATTRIBUTE ATTRIBUTE=plugin_example_comments('No').`"
msgstr "设置来自当前数据文件，即窗口保存在其中的设置。要在语法中设置某项，请将其指定为名为 `plugin_<name>_<key>` 的数据文件属性（插件名称和设置的键，均为小写，其他字符写作 `_`），例如 `DATAFILE ATTRIBUTE ATTRIBUTE=plugin_example_comments('No').`"

msgid "`--plugin-template FILE` applies a template file made with **Export...**, as an active template does in the window."
msgstr "`--plugin-template FILE` 应用一个用 **Export...** 制作的模板文件，作用与窗口中生效的模板相同。"

msgid "Give `--plugin` more than once for several plugins. They run in that order. Unlike in the window, a plugin that fails stops the run."
msgstr "要使用多个插件，请多次指定 `--plugin`。插件按指定的顺序运行。与窗口中不同，插件失败会停止运行。"

msgid "`statscraft update --check --plugin PROGRAM` asks a plugin whether it has a newer version. It never installs anything."
msgstr "`statscraft update --check --plugin PROGRAM` 询问插件是否有新版本。它从不安装任何内容。"

msgid "AI agents use the same through the MCP server (see [Tables with a plugin](mcp.md#tables-with-a-plugin))."
msgstr "AI 智能体通过 MCP 服务器使用同样的功能（见[使用插件生成表格](mcp.md#tables-with-a-plugin)）。"

msgid "Write your own"
msgstr "编写您自己的插件 {#write-your-own}"

msgid "[Writing a plugin](https://github.com/statscrafthq/statscraft/blob/main/docs/developers/plugins.md) describes the JSON a plugin reads and writes, with a small example plugin in Rust."
msgstr "[编写插件](https://github.com/statscrafthq/statscraft/blob/main/docs/developers/plugins.md)说明了插件读取和写入的 JSON，并附有一个用 Rust 编写的小型示例插件。"
